2cf83266257548519925a","node_id":"C_kwDORvUZANoAKGFjMmRjOWFjYmYxNzFmMjk3MGYyY2Y4MzI2NjI1NzU0ODUxOTkyNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/oostax/oborobus/commit/5a8af38103ffb057217ac836392a50ca46fccfc2","sha":"5a8af38103ffb057217ac836392a50ca46fccfc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oostax/oborobus/commits/5a8af38103ffb057217ac836392a50ca46fccfc2"}],"sha":"ac2dc9acbf171f2970f2cf83266257548519925a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oostax/oborobus/commits/ac2dc9acbf171f2970f2cf83266257548519925a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oostax/oborobus/commits/5a8af38103ffb057217ac836392a50ca46fccfc2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T19:09:38Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T19:09:38Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"message":"v4.5.0: context quality, provenance repair, prompt discipline\n\nFix provenance: system summaries (task_summary, direction=\"system\") are now\ncorrectly classified across memory.py, consolidator.py, server API, and chat\nUI — no longer masquerading as user messages. New amber system bubbles in UI.\n\nRestore execution reflections (task_reflections.jsonl) in live LLM context.\nMove Health Invariants to the top of dynamic context block in both the main\ntask path and background consciousness.\n\nTask-scope recent progress/tools/events when task_id is available, keeping\ndialogue continuity broad.\n\nHarden run_shell: detect literal $VAR env-ref misuse in argv-form commands.\nHarden claude_code_edit: retry transient first-run Claude CLI auth failure,\nstructured error classification via _format_claude_code_error.\n\nFull SYSTEM.md editorial rewrite: terminology normalized to ''creator'', new\nsections (Methodology Check, Anti-Reactivity, Diagnostics Discipline,\nKnowledge Retrieval Triggers), stronger Health Invariant reactions, compressed\ninventory sections, balanced KB preflight gate.\n\n16 files changed. New test_chat_provenance.py, updated regression tests.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"846a33752a4109077809c411edb633839dfeeb20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oostax/oborobus/git/trees/846a33752a4109077809c411edb633839dfeeb20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oostax/oborobus/git/commits/5a8af38103ffb057217ac836392a50ca46fccfc2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/oostax/oborobus/commit/5a8af38103ffb057217ac836392a50ca46fccfc2","node_id":"C_kwDORvUZANoAKDVhOGFmMzgxMDNmZmIwNTcyMTdhYzgzNjM5MmE1MGNhNDZmY2NmYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/oostax/oborobus/commit/2389f2aa1e0da594f0323e78a0af32a32b57cf38","sha":"2389f2aa1e0da594f0323e78a0af32a32b57cf38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oostax/oborobus/commits/2389f2aa1e0da594f0323e78a0af32a32b57cf38"}],"sha":"5a8af38103ffb057217ac836392a50ca46fccfc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oostax/oborobus/commits/5a8af38103ffb057217ac836392a50ca46fccfc2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oostax/oborobus/commits/2389f2aa1e0da594f0323e78a0af32a32b57cf38/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T14:50:09Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T15:07:32Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"message":"v4.4.0: safe editing, task lifecycle, rescue discovery\n\nAdd str_replace_editor tool for surgical edits to existing files (exact\nunique match semantics). Add shrink guard to repo_write and\nrepo_write_commit that blocks accidental truncation of tracked files\n(>30% size reduction requires force=true). Add STATUS_FAILED,\nSTATUS_INTERRUPTED, STATUS_CANCELLED to task lifecycle and wire them\ninto worker death, hard timeout, and cancel paths. Surface rescue\nsnapshots in health invariants so the agent discovers saved work after\nrestarts. Classify provider incomplete responses (finish_reason=null)\nseparately from genuine empty responses. Change default review\nenforcement to advisory. Fix progress bubble opacity and duplicate emoji.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"040bbb581d4b716f281b406ea9f15fec73373ec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oostax/oborobus/git/trees/040bbb581d4b716f281b406ea9f15fec73373ec9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oostax/oborobus/git/commits/2389f2aa1e0da594f0323e78a0af32a32b57cf38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/oostax/oborobus/commit/2389f2aa1e0da594f0323e78a0af32a32b57cf38","node_id":"C_kwDORvUZANoAKDIzODlmMmFhMWUwZGE1OTRmMDMyM2U3OGEwYWYzMmEzMmI1N2NmMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/oostax/oborobus/commit/98753de86e1301160d263752d9a0fc4932d544b6","sha":"98753de86e1301160d263752d9a0fc4932d544b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oostax/oborobus/commits/98753de86e1301160d263752d9a0fc4932d544b6"}],"sha":"2389f2aa1e0da594f0323e78a0af32a32b57cf38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oostax/oborobus/commits/2389f2aa1e0da594f0323e78a0af32a32b57cf38"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oostax/oborobus/commits/98753de86e1301160d263752d9a0fc4932d544b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T13:49:03Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T13:49:03Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"message":"v4.3.1: fix progress bubble opacity and duplicate emoji\n\nRemove semi-transparent dimming from progress chat bubbles so they\nmatch the regular message style. Remove the duplicate 💬 emoji that\nwas added in both the sender label and the message text.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"86d1236b7f9dbca754b518d15aefe4c02f9136e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oostax/oborobus/git/trees/86d1236b7f9dbca754b518d15aefe4c02f9136e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/rep