"Guilherme Pereira"},"message":"Resolve stash conflicts: phone panes (mobilePane) + rt37 top band\n\n56876e6 was committed after a stash pop with unresolved conflict markers\nin shell.ts and studioSplit.test.ts and a duplicate closeAuraAside import,\nbreaking compilation of 102033 and every dependent publish (e.g. 102047).\n\nKeeps the mobilePane model (applyRuntimeSplit / syncStructureLayout) for\nthe phone one-pane layout and drops rt36''s parallel implementation\n(mobilePanel, syncMobilePanel/setMobilePanel, showClientPanel). rt37''s top\nband scroll stays as is; switching panes restores the band, as rt36 did.\nThe header''s ☰ label now reads data-mobile-pane.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1942d8a75ccfd6cbd3d6bf8fb8a79cb7494531ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expansiva/mls-102033/git/trees/1942d8a75ccfd6cbd3d6bf8fb8a79cb7494531ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expansiva/mls-102033/git/commits/229d5403d62b905d946e3e6967ffc7d5d4b15690","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39830378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilhermeExpansiva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilhermeExpansiva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilhermeExpansiva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilhermeExpansiva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GuilhermeExpansiva","id":39830378,"login":"GuilhermeExpansiva","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODMwMzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilhermeExpansiva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilhermeExpansiva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilhermeExpansiva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GuilhermeExpansiva/starred{/o