lcjg2MDkwNjY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WagnerExpansiva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WagnerExpansiva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WagnerExpansiva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WagnerExpansiva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WagnerExpansiva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WagnerExpansiva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expansiva/mls-102033/commits/e2415b759ebfab198bc3f0cda4ac40b9404efe89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T21:12:02Z","email":"WagnerExpansiva@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Wagner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T21:12:02Z","email":"WagnerExpansiva@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Wagner"},"message":"rt35: o shell escolhe a pagina web/mobile/pageNN pela largura\n\nAs paginas mobile ja eram materializadas e chegavam a release, mas nada\nno shell trocava desktop por mobile - nenhuma era mostrada. Agora o\nrenderer efetivo e rota -> genoma -> dispositivo, nessa ordem, para que\nCtrl+Alt+E e o genoma preservado continuem valendo no celular.\n\nQuem decide e a largura (<=768px), nunca o tipo de aparelho: e isso que\nmantem o \"solicitar site para computador\" como escolha do usuario.\n\nFalha nao e muda e nao vira tela de erro: se o chunk mobile nao carregar\nou o elemento nao registrar, a desktop fica na tela e sai um console.warn\nnomeando rota, entrypoint e causa.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"494cdcb8f68cfe68e94e055ba1c2d8a1a2340f23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expansiva/mls-102033/git/trees/494cdcb8f68cfe68e94e055ba1c2d8a1a2340f23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expansiva/mls-102033/git/commits/e2415b759ebfab198bc3f0cda4ac40b9404efe89","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verif