tion%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoplifya/my-provider-saas/commits/6c3a898260db94954b87db4717ea33907a703096/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T16:55:53Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T16:55:53Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"message":"feat: initial architecture for multi-tenant SaaS platform\n\n- Monorepo setup with pnpm workspaces\n- Shared packages: types, logger, config, utils, db-client, event-bus\n- Node.js services: API Gateway, Auth, Tenant, Payment, Subscription, Analytics, Domain\n- Python services: Store Catalog, AI Service, Notification & Ads (FastAPI)\n- Infrastructure: Docker Compose, Kubernetes manifests, Nginx, CI/CD\n- Micro-frontends: Shell app, Dashboard, Store Builder, Analytics, Settings\n- Themes: Fashion, Restaurant, Hospital, School, Booking (web + mobile)\n- Database: PostgreSQL init script with tenant isolation\n- Documentation: Architecture, Setup, API Reference, Dev Guide, Deploy Guide\n\nCo-Authored-By: Aw Ae <aeaw6350@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b40f72c8472ec0d23fbab1f731a976e348067cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoplifya/my-provider-saas/git/trees/5b40f72c8472ec0d23fbab1f731a976e348067cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoplifya/my-provider-saas/git/commits/6c3a898260db94954b87db4717ea33907a703096","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"com