},"message":"ASMA-8183 stop popover sheet jumping when chips wrap (#234)\n\n* fix(popover): ASMA-8183 pin autocomplete sheets and stop chip-wrap shift\n\nChip-autocomplete filters pass width=\"max\" (472px); radios hug. autoUpdate no longer re-shifts when the sheet''s own content resizes.\n\n* refactor(popover): ASMA-8183 drop the width prop\n\nWidth stays content-driven; consumers that need a fixed width set it on the body. Only the chip-wrap shift fix remains.","tree":{"sha":"8e9f15e87c4d0abeb170b51887575fedf44566da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/trees/8e9f15e87c4d0abeb170b51887575fedf44566da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/commits/e5452ac2ada8d278fb9d56e83044c411031c8a2a","verification":{"payload":"tree 8e9f15e87c4d0abeb170b51887575fedf44566da\nparent 98596798a5d81df2a9501e69348bdbac6e730f68\nauthor VasiliiPeicov <vasilii.peicov@carasent.com> 1790940907 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790940907 +0300\n\nASMA-8183 stop popover sheet jumping when chips wrap (#234)\n\n* fix(popover): ASMA-8183 pin autocomplete sheets and stop chip-wrap shift\n\nChip-autocomplete filters pass width=\"max\" (472px); radios hug. autoUpdate no longer re-shifts when the sheet''s own content resizes.\n\n* refactor(popover): ASMA-8183 drop the width prop\n\nWidth stays content-driven; consumers that need a fixed width set it on the body. Only the chip-wrap shift fix remains.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv5brCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYrIQAC0Vc3oumpBSeeSkCK/eV5yK\n0ziYbHuotH90ifZPIUv9Gc9Ris56IIyMvTAsHQCniR1tGUW41zVEfcTBWrm6IAhI\nRcwCq+ohI6WBsXCJo3+M5j7J1ZpQoHb7G/FFF20oo7Q8XpexjvVXzvmUFKgS48z+\nbEKhDcmdcj4pdm4pdCKiIR5FZwTBZo4HQSEfzY/WeMI4XfJeEptSIfo1eDi673+p\nci80hLsOk/psBCkJWY87L69pRpMbGmUIz19SPGTNYg40zD5meZ3Kgz+65rZMOrw/\n2hLcy6kOiLNLtnmL3QQtiLYIVGeMipJTbvfKCUNF1h2U2zs+m6hLIZSUf+wZ16B3\njlsL14f7uBvrrEAhkePO3Hm4tK7qteoVQfqYCZNizoUgRTt0ZeNBXUK9aoIRtpRf\nGh58yzoeY9ZB