gs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/commits/3dcd35c35badc46d4444969b889e685dd1eba6a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T23:32:41Z","email":"vasilii.peicov@carasent.com","name":"VasiliiPeicov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T23:32:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ASMA-8183 stabilize action popover width (#232)\n\n* feat(popover): ASMA-8183 raise the Action popover max-width to 472px\n\n* feat(popover): ASMA-8183 use 472px max-width for both variants\n\n* test(vrt): ASMA-8183 re-accept popover baselines for the 472px width\n\n* fix(popover): ASMA-8183 draw the surface edge as an outline\n\n* fix(popover): ASMA-8183 draw the surface edge as an inset shadow ring\n\n* fix(popover-sheet): stabilize action popover width\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(input-field): scope end adornment layout effect\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(popover-sheet): use 472px desktop action width\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(popover-sheet): size action popovers to content, contain chip rows\n\nRestore content-driven 240–472 width for action popovers and stop\nAdornmentList chip rows from stretching the surface as selections grow.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(phone-field): stop width-cap story relying on inline-flex class\n\nfullWidth fields now use display:flex via style, so closest(''.inline-flex'')\nwas null and the Storybook a11y run crashed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* style(popover-sheet): order chip-filter width classes for eslint\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7016ac3b5ddcc7f80d2e410645f3385f45b9357","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/trees/d7016ac3b5ddcc7f80d2e410645f3385f45b9357"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/commits/3dcd35c35badc46d4444969b889e685dd1eba6a4","verification":{"payload":"tree d7016ac3b5ddcc7f80d2e410645f3385f45b9357\nparent 56dbaff4e5f6822c8f8e5d67538be29efaf68686\nauthor VasiliiPeicov <vasilii.peicov@carasent.com> 1790811161 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790811161 +0300\n\nASMA-8183 stabilize action popover width (#232)\n\n* feat(popover): ASMA-8183 raise the Action popover max-width to 472px\n\n* feat(popover): ASMA-8183 use 472px max-width for both variants\n\n* test(vrt): ASMA-8183 re-accept popover baselines for the 472px width\n\n* fix(popover): ASMA-8183 draw the surface edge as an outline\n\n* fix(popover): ASMA-8183 draw the surface edge as an inset shadow ring\n\n* fix(popover-sheet): stabilize action popover width\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(input-field): scope end adornment layout effect\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(popover-sheet): use 472px desktop action width\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(popover-sheet): size action popovers to content, contain chip rows\n\nRestore content-driven 240–472 width for action popovers and stop\nAdornmentList chip rows from stretching the surface as selections grow.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(phone-field): stop width-cap story relying on inline-flex class\n\nfullWidth fields now use display:flex via style, so closest(''.inline-flex'')\nwas null and the Storybook a11y run crashed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* style(popover-sheet): order chip-filter width classes for eslint\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvZwZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACMUQAGQE7/Zms7exzHiSFz+762A4\ndm7H/y2/wxG1N3x0hRjrh0EkItl4g+nZZk0/0v7M2cqrugFp0bqplXya/LaN/Cbl\nDUuR/BEhSiFF73kQiajH4seQJFW1G5vVdSh9H6XlS8AsbG+q7F0NNWKcMFFDuWsG\n68uB/6E/aQ5yJhGNs/tluxksYKZkRpHddyRaGi2hPePHC9TCQvdiCc8Jvod3hNYu\ndOpYN7GwM5F54u8LiQrEj6fXFZMFyQTi7LribuHnIqxC8dBGGTyP5e4cpFQLdSiH\nv2ltVHdJz6h31nqSf4oJplLFigKXDDq+jAhkmgTKACezkebEOTCzzOIvvqDtnlhM\n59y+yNsw+s4kSuVYIHzBAU+ZckI6ZNpv7+ADcsWEYea4QgVyFvDdre9WEiS7huK4\njCXP4HH6C3QfTATqPUH3o4mAv6JSgIP/nqqFgJj9DEJIDaVw4rszhhuyrIGAwaro\nXenTfb6WZrOAp0wgJbnPhKO97MKaWU1a4CdT3J+6q05j0WOoOeIBH0mjAwtrKDfB\nx9p7L0GZwL2z2XnncXjVFfdwIt98sO1ylzej+hL6mSx+CAvCVb9kEP/+P0M+FaWg\n9RJA3kDORRAe5njZFKKq5Io93qPCJ5LCY142LkKrYQsrt9l4dkl9DxSp7JBL27yo\nslTF5cvXb3H/Ssj6mEzh\n=w61X\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T23:32:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/