age":"feat(select-autocomplete): add rowSize prop for 40px/48px option rows (#233)\n\nAdd an opt-in `rowSize?: ''compact'' | ''regular''` to StyledSelectAutocomplete and\nStyledDynamicSelect. `''compact''` (default) keeps the 40px option row that matches\nthe Figma Menus item, so existing consumers are unchanged; `''regular''` gives a\nroomier 48px row. It sets min-height only, so a wrapped 2-line label still grows\nthe row, and it does not affect the 32px select-all header or the input field.\nThreaded through DynamicSelectAutocomplete''s own renderOption rows too. Adds a\nRegularRowSize story + VRT baseline.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"38873141f38fa095a93984e30e41c1a650a6b0c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/trees/38873141f38fa095a93984e30e41c1a650a6b0c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/commits/56dbaff4e5f6822c8f8e5d67538be29efaf68686","verification":{"payload":"tree 38873141f38fa095a93984e30e41c1a650a6b0c2\nparent 914cdbb4a2e4337ccd7bbb752a6ab2dfbcd3b1da\nauthor doicovSanya <Alexandr.Doicov@carasent.com> 1790808798 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790808798 +0300\n\nfeat(select-autocomplete): add rowSize prop for 40px/48px option rows (#233)\n\nAdd an opt-in `rowSize?: ''compact'' | ''regular''` to StyledSelectAutocomplete and\nStyledDynamicSelect. `''compact''` (default) keeps the 40px option row that matches\nthe Figma Menus item, so existing consumers are unchanged; `''regular''` gives a\nroomier 48px row. It sets min-height only, so a wrapped 2-line label still grows\nthe row, and it does not affect the 32px select-all header or the input field.\nThreaded through DynamicSelectAutocomplete''s own renderOption rows too. Adds a\nRegularRowSize story + VRT baseline.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvZLeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAn64QAKLzKZvfV9oQne2/JL+uNHta