t list\ncheckboxes (both the select-all header and the option rows) to a 16px box via\ncheckboxClassName, keeping them in one column. The even 16px box also centres\nthe indeterminate dash on integer pixels. Regenerate the affected\nselect-autocomplete visual-regression baselines.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"40d2bca122cab266e73bf06133398e5df7407576","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/trees/40d2bca122cab266e73bf06133398e5df7407576"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/commits/914cdbb4a2e4337ccd7bbb752a6ab2dfbcd3b1da","verification":{"payload":"tree 40d2bca122cab266e73bf06133398e5df7407576\nparent e559074f7fc55e34158a9dda0c4b26e3a13b385f\nauthor doicovSanya <Alexandr.Doicov@carasent.com> 1790805319 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790805319 +0300\n\nfix(select-autocomplete): ASMA-8251 size select list checkbox box to 16px (#231)\n\nThe Figma Reports table checkbox draws a 16px visible box (the `Bg` layer)\ninside a 20px component frame; the design-system `medium` box (20px) rendered\nit 4px too large. StyledCheckbox ships no 16px size, so pin the select list\ncheckboxes (both the select-all header and the option rows) to a 16px box via\ncheckboxClassName, keeping them in one column. The even 16px box also centres\nthe indeterminate dash on integer pixels. Regenerate the affected\nselect-autocomplete visual-regression baselines.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvYVICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbYYQAJdlT7NsUQZYKxfe8oFcX12g\nkijtDmMS3/o+5mnjRuOLxsBCZQeRAOeYrPUQseQxNl/kymvOhl+piB+/cthH6Wzv\nBr2EEOzT3xuFBWzujKJNxHSTPF8WMXOeCREC9Y0UWGThE9Szyw+XpypDUgvYMeNV\nqk8ucGsi7Ay5XzsHr7B3dWKeg332nO7VfHuBr2pVM2gE8SfMbHdix241ZR3Qraf5\nC5ImXudac+0lYxfWr8oTLVRd1UhCyQhglJ350kp+RO1AEFIQnJq0K2VGTKzEwwM+\nuovXk+hECUvbR7eaXhioJ7mLCD9B/YZnXhjF1qc1/St4hVf0yTrayXaxTa2QPAoy\nP+R4sL1wUKrWOmZiyVJmi3Le3N