.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/commits/46909cabdf2ab5233189b35608c12411ad0fc38b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:38:42Z","email":"Alexandr.Doicov@carasent.com","name":"doicovSanya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:38:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(select-autocomplete): ASMA-8251 match select-all group header to Figma (#225)\n\n* fix(select-autocomplete): ASMA-8251 match select-all group header to Figma\n\nRefine the multiple-select \"select all\" group header to the Figma Reports\ntable-header spec: fixed 32px height, `--table-bg-header` (#F9FAFB =\ncolors-gray-10) background, 8px padding, 16px cell gap, and an X-small\nSemibold uppercase (10px/600, 12px line-height, 0.2px tracking) delta-600\nlabel. Drive the header checkbox tri-state from the selection — blank when\nnone, indeterminate when some, checkmark when all. Drop the popover''s\nvertical padding while the group header is shown so the grey bar sits flush\ntop and the last option flush bottom.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(vrt): ASMA-8251 update select-all header baseline\n\nRegenerate the select-all visual-regression baseline for the reworked group\nheader (32px #F9FAFB bar, X-small Semibold uppercase label, flush popover\nedges). Captured in the pinned Playwright container so it matches CI\nbyte-for-byte.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"80a5475b07eddadf094a5a279591273bc09a12c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/trees/80a5475b07eddadf094a5a279591273bc09a12c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/commits/46909cabdf2ab5233189b35608c12411ad0fc38b","verification":{"payload":"tree 80a5475b07eddadf094a5a279591273bc09a12c8\nparent fe988b1ed5104356d2b72e9da094716c5c75531a\nauthor doicovSanya <Alexandr.Doicov@carasent.com> 1790771922 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790771922 +0300\n\nfix(select-autocomplete): ASMA-8251 match select-all group header to Figma (#225)\n\n* fix(select-autocomplete): ASMA-8251 match select-all group header to Figma\n\nRefine the multiple-select \"select all\" group header to the Figma Reports\ntable-header spec: fixed 32px height, `--table-bg-header` (#F9FAFB =\ncolors-gray-10) background, 8px padding, 16px cell gap, and an X-small\nSemibold uppercase (10px/600, 12px line-height, 0.2px tracking) delta-600\nlabel. Drive the header checkbox tri-state from the selection — blank when\nnone, indeterminate when some, checkmark when all. Drop the popover''s\nvertical padding while the group header is shown so the grey bar sits flush\ntop and the last option flush bottom.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(vrt): ASMA-8251 update select-all header baseline\n\nRegenerate the select-all visual-regression baseline for the reworked group\nheader (32px #F9FAFB bar, X-small Semibold uppercase label, flush popover\nedges). Captured in the pinned Playwright container so it matches CI\nbyte-for-byte.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvQLSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+AkQAA4YCfnWg4B0D+Dlx++0wA5Z\n4yu6clrKezmK1iJTCMAFelPYu1Lzdx17wMmObtoxNwil6ferfnJyZm47aar+lDok\nV9AqioEiJaBz/6eiq+pyP+anbN8tYhc3sDyqz2/NRvjotLuQRCB+dA9Tioj/wpJe\nLNuvvtnNhXUuQkADdrJpMds8V6lGLCycNwHB3W/nFyCMgWJBfOp68MEtkpepMhpB\nhxI/FyBc69KeEvGK38kMDrUhq9O6SzfWkzpL1dZYQG9+Zo2ZhqdGKRFyjj0mb+We\nuTyJAeKsw6xdV3yPuMC/B7gX6GZ0X30eFvegPl3qaVWoLUJGxgCQ5MV2hLxsmKaG\nCTM+wk9wFgKhaCBSCMLnJVaSEkCDXsADog83dK1SOjwvhNiwr2BEUHQPLdaXtcdB\n55jORhx1lY2xNO04fPNRjtoSO8ZftXlLi+BTD6mDyyWnz0mhc5BITQJpQS8Ap4Ho\nDvZsppF4OuJymDI3fwd74kMHkL2SMTrq4L1j1xzUlNMBCrW4kYzHaVKDDX9peS/i\nkN4Ys3W3hG2edbp6zybiXWIxHHguWixfQAkAC1qVVrLvk4nB6wbiIJwbLkmfITGr\n80wMMYiWoFzP/diKZPtvfN9wIINj+cMblW