VasiliiPeicov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VasiliiPeicov","id":263779196,"login":"VasiliiPeicov","node_id":"U_kgDOD7jzfA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/commits/fe988b1ed5104356d2b72e9da094716c5c75531a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:57:50Z","email":"vasilii.peicov@carasent.com","name":"VasiliiPeicov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:57:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ASMA-8303 Fix focus ring painting on any focus, not just keyboard (#224)\n\nfix: ASMA-8303 gate focus ring on :focus-visible, not any focus\n\n`StyledChip`''s `.focus-ring` matched `:focus-within` and `HeaderActionMenu`''s\ndrag-icon matched bare `:focus` — neither checks input modality, so a chip or\ndrag handle programmatically focused after a mouse click (e.g. PopoverSheet''s\n\"focus moves to first control\" on open) painted a keyboard-style focus ring\neven though the trigger was never reached via keyboard.\n\nChip''s delete-button case replaced with `:has(button:focus-visible)`, matching\nthe `:has(...:focus-visible)` pattern already used by StyledRadio/StyledCheckbox/\nStyledAccordion/StyledTable elsewhere in this package.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"380616471ac153229344d567291425e03cdc2dd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/trees/380616471ac153229344d567291425e03cdc2dd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/commits/fe988b1ed5104356d2b72e9da094716c5c75531a","verification":{"payload":"tree 380616471ac153229344d567291425e03cdc2dd1\nparent d362506f7436e611ae97de1db74cce4cb71dbf5c\nauthor VasiliiPeicov <vasilii.peicov@carasent.com> 1790762270 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790762270 +0300\n\nASMA-8303 Fix focus ring painting on any focus, not just keyboard (#224)\n\nfix: ASMA-8303 gate focus ring on :focus-visible, not any focus\n\n`StyledChip`''s `.focus-ring` matched `:focus-within` and `HeaderActionMenu`''s\ndrag-icon matched bare `:focus` — neither checks input modality, so a chip or\ndrag handle programmatically focused after a mouse click (e.g. PopoverSheet''s\n\"focus moves to first control\" on open) painted a keyboard-style focus ring\neven though the trigger was never reached via keyboard.\n\nChip''s delete-button case replaced with `:has(button:focus-visible)`, matching\nthe `:has(...:focus-visible)` pattern already used by StyledRadio/StyledCheckbox/\nStyledAccordion/StyledTable elsewhere in this package.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvN0eCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaIcQAJciTI4DiSBbqXnNavclTssS\nDcixW9heNMgZutZYvpGiPGZFFiSFTRsccHtmT4tc6mlQOUqza6+LlFPDbbVqn1JN\nTtiBHS9bEZE4kgSC8QIrp5NrrI4dkfoqg4Q8ZEbSzsgDGxxE0wJHZ6YGvHEDaFY6\nqJIUd70cKsaVVwQAjsyyKpVfHjG02JHwtaxou+/Z8CZH1oGIIWLi3+koEvUTYjP2\n+qd/jFs4+2kTf74CxtATMlsyWHZQj1Ljdxu+he35SfyogDqO1s8zsSv5G6b5OVON\nzhV6o4VtvE6K6QIeQpJTHiYy9d80s5F+YyJ+Ve3yvmN/kOoi6IApw2HbUOb3fE0o\nd6ffesll1kmtYnkk+a7gzQvqwMdLL8G79Lhrl5ijIO5TP8TsiNZTB26JSC82rlSi\nHFj2QUTjd+se/V63nGDPCRSMs8ge+anINVnBVQ7yFjxtVuSq1ou0Q2TExllAO8Xv\nX0w7ZzebucotbhvCGhPjOi+xh4JHbFKl9O9RjAocSlwATQKkeqtIValvsEfdlZNo\n7YF1h684zeJ9hWANiSu1iN8uHj3iiKgi+Z7hsZAex0xwodeefGSwqZfnfbDgprXs\ng3wlhDiD735+H8Q42cZAwpDyx13LIvAr++diM/Bv4EMNVRZ6Ns