g{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doicovSanya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/doicovSanya","id":264966161,"login":"doicovSanya","node_id":"U_kgDOD8sQEQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doicovSanya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doicovSanya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doicovSanya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doicovSanya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doicovSanya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/doicovSanya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/commits/d362506f7436e611ae97de1db74cce4cb71dbf5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T07:33:48Z","email":"Alexandr.Doicov@carasent.com","name":"doicovSanya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T07:33:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: ASMA-8251 select-all table header and drop fixed dialog-footer shadow (#223)\n\n* fix(dialog-footer): ASMA-8251 drop the shadow from the fixed footer\n\nThe ASMA design system separates a fixed dialog footer with its top border\nalone, so remove the \"Fixed bottom\" drop shadow from the sticky variant.\nUpdate the unit test, doc comments and story caption to match.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(select-autocomplete): ASMA-8251 style the select-all row as a table header\n\nRender the multiple-select \"select all\" row as the list''s table header: a\ngrey bar with its own checkbox column and an uppercase category label aligned\nto the option rows below. It stays clickable to toggle select-all, so hover\ndeepens the grey instead of taking the green selected-option highlight.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(vrt): ASMA-8251 update baselines for footer shadow and select-all header\n\nRegenerate the two visual-regression baselines affected by the design fixes:\nthe fixed dialog footer without its drop shadow, and the select-all row\nrendered as a table header. Captured in the pinned Playwright container so\nthey match the CI environment byte-for-byte.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"348042c15f2c38b04058cdf0b9380b04362c7361","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/trees/348042c15f2c38b04058cdf0b9380b04362c7361"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/commits/d362506f7436e611ae97de1db74cce4cb71dbf5c","verification":{"payload":"tree 348042c15f2c38b04058cdf0b9380b04362c7361\nparent 8715869b0997e3af737bfa5447e77109cf4b74da\nauthor doicovSanya <Alexandr.Doicov@carasent.com> 1790753628 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790753628 +0300\n\nfix: ASMA-8251 select-all table header and drop fixed dialog-footer shadow (#223)\n\n* fix(dialog-footer): ASMA-8251 drop the shadow from the fixed footer\n\nThe ASMA design system separates a fixed dialog footer with its top border\nalone, so remove the \"Fixed bottom\" drop shadow from the sticky variant.\nUpdate the unit test, doc comments and story caption to match.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(select-autocomplete): ASMA-8251 style the select-all row as a table header\n\nRender the multiple-select \"select all\" row as the list''s table header: a\ngrey bar with its own checkbox column and an uppercase category label aligned\nto the option rows below. It stays clickable to toggle select-all, so hover\ndeepens the grey instead of taking the green selected-option highlight.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(vrt): ASMA-8251 update baselines for footer shadow and select-all header\n\nRegenerate the two visual-regression baselines affected by the design fixes:\nthe fixed dialog footer without its drop shadow, and the select-all row\nrendered as a table header. Captured in the pinned Playwright container so\nthey match the CI environment byte-for-byte.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvLtcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA96QQAIS34zLTJe5uFuEKHmibUP1i\nzTiqrYed4Jqo/b40Ma1dG+tiZiLFN/z1eFCEL/XQvxEXuYKvqGPIuWMU2bODRYtD\n1jaRr9B05ROncGEjLVSKPMne1HiIDjmONtOUueXP4+BFagqIX2m0D/wmWP18cRVZ\n9krV4xrEcBISVky7FhO/ksdJ1r/oUgtXu1CYXQqNS2ASqSxyZZbMOKCLlpndRlIk\ndJPJXqbnaRMhf4mqIPHy+VmhY4x+pcl7kVtjDWzFKn08LndsmPcpANHO+RT9/Jy1\nuf/TSjPLWQ82QsLlwZxxa1aPkjqnDVpHGLA8pytdJUvD2XtoTFsk8QnJkEv/phn6\nysGUGHFTnf8LU5u1cnRbCzSNfVyQtD9xJMW0uT29K/RmOkDsEbpl/xSEflDXNWKS\nWMmySW8HQL6m/nY5JJD8AYvJUpYJdciCFxSa0TzTfNzhv1tox54e9itPHWxmgFqr\n0ncuP8q7dQT1uXrj3APedudNT3PjzMhSYCUE4el4gsQxSC7B6sDwIKh+ePKVPdgJ\navIiu9CQ4RQSbzN4mA7yGdyAI8g+xpJMeGxzYgKZaTbgw0yReyOwGeVDnjk2u2bJ\n7HYX6D5i8FO3Y3hax+dE0fZGzevbM6Q3BxGLCkimqjvkxaJ1B+omdXZMpLCTe6na\n52oFibVZGkVKJGPItwT0\n=W/30\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T07:33:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.co