78ca0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263779196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VasiliiPeicov","id":263779196,"login":"VasiliiPeicov","node_id":"U_kgDOD7jzfA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/commits/7d4a2f9e0a4873de9118296062de7c539d4c4711/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T20:50:40Z","email":"vasilii.peicov@carasent.com","name":"VasiliiPeicov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T20:50:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(date picker): ASMA-8236 size trigger to the Figma 200px spec (#205)\n\n* fix(date picker): ASMA-8236 size trigger to the Figma 200px spec\n\nThe editable date picker trigger measured 206px: a 160px input segment, the correct 4px gap, and a calendar button that grew to 42px because size=large only pins a height while its 8px padding and 1px border add width.\n\nSet the input segment to 156px and pin the button to a flat 40x40. box-border is required because the package runs Tailwind with preflight disabled, so box-sizing falls back to content-box.\n\nAdds a Chromium interaction regression that measures real layout boxes rather than the style attribute, since the overflow came from padding and borders.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(date picker): ASMA-8236 rebaseline VRT for the 200px trigger\n\nThe Figma width change narrows the trigger by 6px, so the date picker baselines have to match the new layout.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7737193c209d7b16952c0b371ad559c2feb1f85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/trees/f7737193c209d7b16952c0b371ad559c2feb1f85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/commits/7d4a2f9e0a4873de9118296062de7c539d4c4711","verification":{"payload":"tree f7737193c209d7b16952c0b371ad559c2feb1f85\nparent 4988ecf2e7b290a0114e6f85f1fe4999fe50bfab\nauthor VasiliiPeicov <vasilii.peicov@carasent.com> 1790542240 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790542240 +0300\n\nfix(date picker): ASMA-8236 size trigger to the Figma 200px spec (#205)\n\n* fix(date picker): ASMA-8236 size trigger to the Figma 200px spec\n\nThe editable date picker trigger measured 206px: a 160px input segment, the correct 4px gap, and a calendar button that grew to 42px because size=large only pins a height while its 8px padding and 1px border add width.\n\nSet the input segment to 156px and pin the button to a flat 40x40. box-border is required because the package runs Tailwind with preflight disabled, so box-sizing falls back to content-box.\n\nAdds a Chromium interaction regression that measures real layout boxes rather than the style attribute, since the overflow came from padding and borders.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(date picker): ASMA-8236 rebaseline VRT for the 200px trigger\n\nThe Figma width change narrows the trigger by 6px, so the date picker baselines have to match the new layout.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-