ocus accessibility defects\n\n- Add shared focusable helpers and use them across focus trap, popover and tooltip\n- Restore focus to the opener on dialog, popover, menu, accordion and minimizable-dialog close\n- Make select, autocomplete, listbox and phone-field pickers keyboard-operable\n- Keep trailing affordances out of the tab order and mark active options\n- Announce bare snackbar messages via a polite status region\n- Update a11y docs and interaction tests\n\nCloses #ASMA-8087\n\n* fix(utils): Stabilize popover floating props and autocomplete story stat","tree":{"sha":"1f4880bfc3c4a19b66ac87f25ad0d987c78bdc5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/trees/1f4880bfc3c4a19b66ac87f25ad0d987c78bdc5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/commits/616a733496cac879e24d12b9e4d699d14e4603ea","verification":{"payload":"tree 1f4880bfc3c4a19b66ac87f25ad0d987c78bdc5f\nparent b18e649830022867c44c82144df76b317f74f4de\nauthor maxim-carasent <maxim.curudimov@carasent.com> 1789992350 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789992350 +0300\n\nASMA-8087 keyboard navigation support for accessibility (#208)\n\n* fix: Resolve keyboard and focus accessibility defects\n\n- Add shared focusable helpers and use them across focus trap, popover and tooltip\n- Restore focus to the opener on dialog, popover, menu, accordion and minimizable-dialog close\n- Make select, autocomplete, listbox and phone-field pickers keyboard-operable\n- Keep trailing affordances out of the tab order and mark active options\n- Announce bare snackbar messages via a polite status region\n- Update a11y docs and interaction tests\n\nCloses #ASMA-8087\n\n* fix(utils): Stabilize popover floating props and autocomplete story stat","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsR2eCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJvcQAJT8MNMg2ZlITQmGGhrvOD30\nhACeGIKmQixV9H93JJy9Hc/ZqZt50nxCuS+1DRjN7ucYv8U316pVwwXGlskPib1S\n0y9sH+cllwZ5xg3KwRBI1GH0Fll+QdtbMp