://api.github.com/users/mark31072","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/commits/c163f2296df7ccdfc8da3af13765d689efc60143/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T12:47:35Z","email":"91586985+mark31072@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Marin Pesterean"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T12:47:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ASMA-8143 deflake pointer-cancellation clear assertion (#193)\n\ntest(a11y): ASMA-8143 deflake pointer-cancellation clear assertion\n\nThe Enter-activation on the autocomplete Clear button updates the value\nthrough controlled state; asserting immediately can outrun the rerender\n(failed once on master post-merge, passed on rerun). Wrap in waitFor.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"50f03e3f3d79314e29c937bc604153708aeac61c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/trees/50f03e3f3d79314e29c937bc604153708aeac61c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/commits/c163f2296df7ccdfc8da3af13765d689efc60143","verification":{"payload":"tree 50f03e3f3d79314e29c937bc604153708aeac61c\nparent 21500cb5c01437946d7298527147a311d5fb6734\nauthor Marin Pesterean <91586985+mark31072@users.noreply.github.com> 1789390055 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789390055 +0300\n\nASMA-8143 deflake pointer-cancellation clear assertion (#193)\n\ntest(a11y): ASMA-8143 deflake pointer-cancellation clear assertion\n\nThe Enter-activation on the autocomplete Clear button updates the value\nthrough controlled state; asserting immediately can outrun the rerender\n(failed once on master post-merge, passed on rerun). Wrap in waitFor.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqp+znCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkGwQAJc1TlaHndu7QTvBXvPJa5I3\nvlm2kQMHSNjSeGatLuwvdBIR/2heyawc/S+JpRQ/yUAsVFDWW9Kvtk9omZaApL6t\n