_url":"https://github.com/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/commit/9e404f92c59323538471f57cdeccb52168d1a387","node_id":"C_kwDORvrv4doAKDllNDA0ZjkyYzU5MzIzNTM4NDcxZjU3Y2RlY2NiNTIxNjhkMWEzODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/commit/d507dd2f6e94f5e5d0198d2a3f86d0ad3fcf7dc1","sha":"d507dd2f6e94f5e5d0198d2a3f86d0ad3fcf7dc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/commits/d507dd2f6e94f5e5d0198d2a3f86d0ad3fcf7dc1"}],"sha":"9e404f92c59323538471f57cdeccb52168d1a387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/commits/9e404f92c59323538471f57cdeccb52168d1a387"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263779196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VasiliiPeicov","id":263779196,"login":"VasiliiPeicov","node_id":"U_kgDOD7jzfA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/commits/d507dd2f6e94f5e5d0198d2a3f86d0ad3fcf7dc1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T13:45:05Z","email":"vasilii.peicov@carasent.com","name":"VasiliiPeicov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T13:45:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(toolbar): ASMA-8151 Close the More overflow menu when its trigger is pressed again (#186)\n\nThe trigger set the anchor on every press and never cleared it, so the menu could only\nbe dismissed by pressing somewhere else. The press does reach the button rather than\nbeing swallowed on its way — StyledPopover excludes the anchor from its outside-press\nhandler on purpose, which leaves dismissal to the trigger, and the trigger never did\nit. It now toggles.\n\nThis is the menu every module gets once its DynamicToolbar actions overflow, so the\nbehaviour was wrong everywhere it appeared. Found in the design review of ASMA-7327.","tree":{"sha":"bccf7841fa976bb8eb102205a3c760fc185992c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/trees/bccf7841fa976bb8eb102205a3c760fc185992c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/commits/d507dd2f6e94f5e5d0198d2a3f86d0ad3fcf7dc1","verification":{"payload":"tree bccf7841fa976bb8eb102205a3c760fc185992c7\nparent 8ca6e658f5fe369778c24c9b725a49cb4ae025da\nauthor VasiliiPeicov <vasilii.peicov@carasent.com> 1789134305 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789134305 +0300\n\nfix(toolbar): ASMA-8151 Close the More overflow menu when its trigger is pressed again (#186)\n\nThe trigger set the anchor on every press and never cleared it, so the menu could only\nbe dismissed by pressing somewhere else. The press does reach the button rather than\nbeing swallowed on its way — StyledPopover excludes the anchor from its outside-press\nhandler on purpose, which leaves dismissal to the trigger, and the trigger never did\nit. It now toggles.\n\nThis is the menu every module gets once its DynamicToolbar actions overflow, so the\nbehaviour was wrong everywhere it appeared. Found in the design review of ASMA-7327.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpAXhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASiQQAHlt/VQ0AbkJCj1ew9OyWKRl\navAk/VUb057x/FtxCM6Sr9h3Iuy9+CCIOrmF1VchCbXr5Q7T+WnlZ2EMVVNajfTt\n