8ad22c7dcb30b052007dc5826f3037512","sha":"d29b72f8ad22c7dcb30b052007dc5826f3037512","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/commits/d29b72f8ad22c7dcb30b052007dc5826f3037512"}],"sha":"de43b32a01ee77c666d5054cbce3727189de17d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/commits/de43b32a01ee77c666d5054cbce3727189de17d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263864046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxim-carasent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxim-carasent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxim-carasent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxim-carasent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maxim-carasent","id":263864046,"login":"maxim-carasent","node_id":"U_kgDOD7o-7g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxim-carasent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxim-carasent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxim-carasent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxim-carasent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxim-carasent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxim-carasent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/commits/d29b72f8ad22c7dcb30b052007dc5826f3037512/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:28:57Z","email":"maxim.curudimov@carasent.com","name":"maxim-carasent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:28:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ASMA-8097 focus state in every component (#182)\n\n* feat: Unify focus ring styling across components\n\n- Add shared focus-ring token and SCSS mixin\n- Rework keyboard navigation for select, table, and inputs\n- Improve chip, checkbox, and radio accessibility states\n\n* fix(inputs): Align select keyboard navigation with active descendant pat\n\n- Keep focus on the trigger and expose the active option via aria-activedescendant\n- Stop arrow-key navigation at list ends instead of wrapping\n- Clear the keyboard-active option on pointer selection in multiple mode\n- Paint the chip delete focus ring on the parent via focus-within\n- Add aria-label to the table row count select trigger\n\nCloses #8136\n\n* feat(color-variables): Add focused border color tokens for buttons\n\n- Add focused border color tokens for contained, outlined, and text buttons\n- Apply tokens across default, fretex, and jade themes\n- Add beta-400 token to fretex theme\n\n* fix(inputs): Stabilize select portal root and update visual snapshots\n\n- Resolve portal root on open instead of during render to avoid ref reads\n- Update a11y robustness test for 38x38 checkbox and radio hit area\n- Refresh visual test screenshots across components\n\n* style(feedback): Update StyledFilteredEmptyState stories a11y config","tree":{"sha":"066601a72d8b80edbd4d3ff20b5087d7e67d47b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/trees/066601a72d8b80edbd4d3ff20b5087d7e67d47b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/commits/d29b72f8ad22c7dcb30b052007dc5826f3037512","verification":{"payload":"tree 066601a72d8b80edbd4d3ff20b5087d7e67d47b5\nparent 6b7dad3de265ba4f1c20b3f659c5f36a383b48ef\nauthor maxim-carasent <maxim.curudimov@carasent.com> 1789061337 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789061337 +0300\n\nASMA-8097 focus state in every component (#182)\n\n* feat: Unify focus ring styling across components\n\n- Add shared focus-ring token and SCSS mixin\n- Rework keyboard navigation for select, table, and inputs\n- Improve chip, checkbox, and radio accessibility states\n\n* fix(inputs): Align select keyboard navigation with active descendant pat\n\n- Keep focus on the trigger and expose the active option via aria-activedescendant\n- Stop arrow-key navigation at list ends instead of wrapping\n- Clear the keyboard-active option on pointer selection in multiple mode\n- Paint the chip delete focus ring on the parent via focus-within\n- Add aria-label to the table row count select trigger\n\nCloses #8136\n\n* feat(color-variables): Add focused border color tokens for buttons\n\n- Add focused border color tokens for contained, outlined, and text buttons\n- Apply tokens across default, fretex, and jade themes\n- Add beta-400 token to fretex theme\n\n* fix(inputs): Stabilize select portal root and update visual snapshots\n\n- Resolve portal root on open instead of during render to avoid ref reads\n- Update a11y robustness test for 38x38 checkbox and radio hit area\n- Refresh visual test screenshots across components\n\n* style(feedback): Update StyledFilteredEmptyState stories a11y config","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoujZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8wUQAIXHsvepMkYIYZZQ+I7RyMxe\nxJXUrliHDE93o8IgQbfiPhrZNO46B8dO8OnPb3KHgg4ltFGaAy0TdPe1NnZrLg+T\nwOP7OJno13QCHE7dMSh3PFCsBrzvBwVeY8BmucfliPsjPTjbFaafUSlIYQdSyx86\nFTfsJ580lTCl8foR0S8OjX1CVGRPPUqiMkVHR+b76lrKO/RcrEJ5O28bEe1tZrGq\nHFebAcyhbhZC92KCrb+kvnYZtJdymNUDSg4mDWzgIisyiUxbP1f2inspJNK5zTKR\nPiE2ATG6pBb+WYbyYAt0mySdLpmXc+ZuN/E17cE7PPfWPma0Y3QFP9U6BJPJCON7\nw4s+e4tJG7rXw30Z28lF2Mw/FxRYO3krT3mZDgvoAZbDfB3Yxek66sy18AX7maIS\nTFBUO1Gq3JcjiBc3l68JG6IlpiopbjoWegpgZ7G2LShKiebW6VTJ9D6SwnMyxyUV\n0vfMlNouEf2tVQC2c5aZ2MfJRzTviv7atT3mFrq0Wu4mb71BlhQxD255T4mBFj/Y\niWDWRaEADap6IP9RvogkUqqnpBs4R9vdOwaB7E8/vJWr000jjuELWYjOnxzwCxwM\n1MI6eJ7zozuPlh78w7uRfEeASOAenxL12wQOT9/sTMQ2+VfLJy3deqnIfNU2FvXH\noFSnyT7TDjKjDMeG+/xk\n=iLUS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T17:28:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers",