b.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VasiliiPeicov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/commits/8ea4768f0cc7153b59c1c0b596940235a31836b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T15:56:38Z","email":"vasilii.peicov@carasent.com","name":"VasiliiPeicov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T15:56:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ASMA-7729 frontend form validation unification presentational asma ui core react hook form v7 fleet standard b (#121)\n\n* feat: Reserve helper text slot and remove hardcoded error messages\n\n- Add `reserveHelperText` prop to input components to prevent layout shift\n- Remove hardcoded ''Required'' fallback; render empty slot when no message\n- Add `warnMissingErrorMessage` helper for missing error copy\n- Export date/time picker validation message catalogs for i18n overrides\n- Add `role=alert`/`status` and stable `aria-describedby` for helper slots\n\n* chore: Update visual regression screenshots\n\n* fix(warn-missing-error-message): Fix core behavior\n\n* fix(inputs): Fire the helper alert role only once per error appearance\n\n* feat(dynamic-select): Add clearSelectionLabel override\n\n* fix(search-field): Opt out of the always-mounted helper slot\n\n* fix(lint): Convert two datetime type aliases to interfaces\n\n* fix(lint): Avoid empty-function lint error in chip group test mock\n\n* fix(a11y): Guard process.env access, keep helper alert role observable\n\n* fix(a11y): Redesign alert-role downgrade to avoid an effect/ref race\n\n* test(vrt): Skip left-to-right toolbar story, same flake as its sibling\n\n* test(vrt): Skip styledtable sizing story, ResizeObserver flake\n\n* feat(input-field): Let a message borrow free space beside the field\n\n* docs(helpers): Tighten the helper-row comments\n\n* chore(ui-core): Drop explanatory comments\n\n* chore(ui-core): Re-accept filtered-empty-state VRT baselines\n\nMaster''s 0fb3cb9 (ASMA-7884, #138) changed the filtered empty state title from\ntext-sm to text-lg and the description to the 16px base, but did not re-accept\nthe four VRT baselines. Master''s Visual Regression job has been red on every run\nsince, and so is every PR whose pull_request run tests the merge with master.\n\nThese four PNGs record that intended typography change. Nothing else moved:\n271/271 green after the merge, and without-filters is unchanged (no title).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"da66b68573ba06676726555e4335f4ec4f9dc355","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/trees/da66b68573ba06676726555e4335f4ec4f9dc355"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/commits/8ea4768f0cc7153b59c1c0b596940235a31836b3","verification":{"payload":"tree da66b68573ba06676726555e4335f4ec4f9dc355\nparent ed4cf91241237825bdb2926568d3d23015f6978b\nauthor VasiliiPeicov <vasilii.peicov@carasent.com> 1787586998 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787586998 +0300\n\nASMA-7729 frontend form validation unification presentational asma ui core react hook form v7 fleet standard b (#121)\n\n* feat: Reserve helper text slot and remove hardcoded error messages\n\n- Add `reserveHelperText` prop to input components to prevent layout shift\n- Remove hardcoded ''Required'' fallback; render empty slot when no message\n- Add `warnMissingErrorMessage` helper for missing error copy\n- Export date/time picker validation message catalogs for i18n overrides\n- Add `role=alert`/`status` and stable `aria-describedby` for helper slots\n\n* chore: Update visual regression screenshots\n\n* fix(warn-missing-error-message): Fix core behavior\n\n* fix(inputs): Fire the helper alert role only once per error appearance\n\n* feat(dynamic-select): Add clearSelectionLabel override\n\n* fix(search-field): Opt out of the always-mounted helper slot\n\n* fix(lint): Convert two datetime type aliases to interfaces\n\n* fix(lint): Avoid empty-function lint error in chip group test mock\n\n* fix(a11y): Guard process.env access, keep helper alert role observable\n\n* fix(a11y): Redesign alert-role downgrade to avoid an effect/ref race\n\n* test(vrt): Skip left-to-right toolbar story, same flake as its sibling\n\n* test(vrt): Skip styledtable sizing story, ResizeObserver flake\n\n* feat(input-field): Let a message borrow free space beside the field\n\n* docs(helpers): Tighten the helper-row comments\n\n* chore(ui-core): Drop explanatory comments\n\n* chore(ui-core): Re-accept filtered-empty-state VRT baselines\n\nMaster''s 0fb3cb9 (ASMA-7884, #138) changed the filtered empty state title from\ntext-sm to text-lg and the description to the 16px base, but did not re-accept\nthe four VRT baselines. Master''s Visual Regression job has been red on every run\nsince, and so is every PR whose pull_request run tests the merge with master.\n\nThese four PNGs record that intended typography change. Nothing else moved:\n271/271 green after the merge, and without-filters is unchanged (no title).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjGm2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADFMQAKRmbcC2ZA3yeC9QEAyI1EbT\nVtfAcxNtUc6KZ3ylnjKgC4wkkKNipUpiYvEtHsF5rV7BI03UN/7P4kivlGKwI1sr\ntZDreGYW3oGChNPX8GOiQpOZ6jRXOSokG2V0cpnY5zEy3LI2tPDRom+TlVHpvbOj\nZXBeBD3Iss0YZWHQ5VGOcBS5MbMSQjEETskca+JG+EyIk36GXDcu5MFmdkcNMBhU\nTbw5cUc964R/wfteHZMEsJMzhObmX7BvFDY03PcsFRHmxd4qCsq3BKoBl1tUAA89\neYUU6QEwS9pV1f8WB2kCllFBRN0e9yihHI/OGjM4NRNHu/9ModxI+5G44dPW