","name":"doicovSanya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T12:19:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix disabled StyledMenuItem text color not applying (stuck on delta-700) (#145)\n\nAll ui-core utilities compile with `important: true`, so the `!` prefix on\n`!text-delta-300` adds nothing and the later-in-stylesheet `text-delta-700`\nwins. Use the `aria-disabled:text-delta-300` variant (class + attribute\nselector, specificity 0,2,0) so the Figma disabled grey wins regardless of\nstylesheet order, in both the table row-action and navigation menu items.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"2357ba59b445e254dc25daf0eeb599b4ad4bb64b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/trees/2357ba59b445e254dc25daf0eeb599b4ad4bb64b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Carasent-ASMA/asma-ui-core/git/commits/293bbe24f746d2c92bff1419ae651c3c8a439362","verification":{"payload":"tree 2357ba59b445e254dc25daf0eeb599b4ad4bb64b\nparent 8df3b14797bcc2d7b3e82666a8cd304fe16e62b9\nauthor doicovSanya <Alexandr.Doicov@carasent.com> 1787573987 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787573987 +0300\n\nFix disabled StyledMenuItem text color not applying (stuck on delta-700) (#145)\n\nAll ui-core utilities compile with `important: true`, so the `!` prefix on\n`!text-delta-300` adds nothing and the later-in-stylesheet `text-delta-700`\nwins. Use the `aria-disabled:text-delta-300` variant (class + attribute\nselector, specificity 0,2,0) so the Figma disabled grey wins regardless of\nstylesheet order, in both the table row-action and navigation menu items.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjDbjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASgQQAA9ZelezTABY6DPtxJMSq0FV\ndEdtRWneYy52YGIAsX6g+tYwLiyPlWHK4T6h//I3LevK2pQGZgZ1Jpr+eJTshvmA\nvO5myMrNPBIdJz3o7IpQJQL4OpUhzkaXN0hOSUreWviw8MLEwSiESvFviBGwnBUl\nqxz3a4JHM7LjLieAlUgiH2ZSedQ6W+IjEJoK