M@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"message":"feat: send sessions — submit every ready application in one sitting\n\n\"Start sending\" on the Applications view opens the oldest ready application\n(approved first, then filled — the session is the review) with\n#hadoku-session. The hadoku Fill extension fills each form as it opens; the\nowner reviews, presses the board''s Submit and types any emailed code (shown\nin the panel). On the board''s confirmation the row is marked sent and the\nnext form opens in the same tab. Skip and Stop session in the panel.\n\nThe owner does the submit and the code by design: Greenhouse''s code and\nAshby''s reCAPTCHA exist to tell people from automation, so the session makes\nthe person''s part as small as it can be rather than faking it.\n\nHandles Lever''s separate /thanks page, which has no form to mount on.\nSession state lives in chrome.storage.session. Tested end to end against\nfixture forms: auto-fill, confirmation, advance, done.","tree":{"sha":"cca038f1b484367f2bedbe0bc542e6ede3df90b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/trees/cca038f1b484367f2bedbe0bc542e6ede3df90b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/commits/42170f43367b774914b80790d78ac5dbd9fe45ef","verification":{"payload":"tree cca038f1b484367f2bedbe0bc542e6ede3df90b3\nparent 40535e5651f65129478ac36b2a011f2818537379\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791406894 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791406912 -0700\n\nfeat: send sessions — submit every ready application in one sitting\n\n\"Start sending\" on the Applications view opens the oldest ready application\n(approved first, then filled — the session is the review) with\n#hadoku-session. The hadoku Fill extension fills each form as it opens; the\nowner reviews, presses the board''s Submit and types any emailed code (shown\nin the panel). On the board''s confirmation the row is marked sent and the\nnext form opens in the same tab. Skip and Stop session in the panel.\n\nThe owner does the submit and the code by design: Greenhouse''s code and\nAshby''s reCAPTCHA exist to tell people from automation, so the session makes\nthe person''s part as small as it can be rather than faking it.\n\nHandles Lever''s separate /thanks page, which has no form to mount on.\nSession state lives in chrome.storage.session. Tested end to end against\nfixture forms: auto-fill, confirmation, advance, done.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQG+uzF6Z5T1zvqYIbVe52ap/8wAOYGn9JzYfLjLbQ+IyIp+yzX7l41G4IecMbCEeTI\nN+Xg8jn6lvZ+JBdGGbtgw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T21:01:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/commit/42170f43367b774914b80790d78ac5dbd9fe45ef","node_id":"C_kwDORvwX0NoAKDQyMTcwZjQzMzY3Yjc3NDkxNGI4MDc5MGQ3OGFjNWRiZDlmZTQ1ZWY","parent