,"name":"WolffM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T06:00:59Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"message":"feat: applicant profile and fill packets for filling in the owner''s own browser\n\nEvery board we apply through refuses the runner at submit — Greenhouse holds\nthe application for an emailed code, Ashby flags the browser as spam — so\nthe owner will fill and submit from their own Chrome with an extension.\n\n- applicant_profiles (migration 0023) + GET/PUT /applicant-profile: the\n  runner''s ApplicantProfile, until now only a local file on its machine.\n- GET /jobs/:id/fill-packet: that profile, the answers the APPROVED fill\n  entered, its options and multi-select keys, every saved answer, and the\n  résumé PDF link — so the extension replays what the owner reviewed.","tree":{"sha":"6e9efb1d2f8b499044957887317fdc21835ba86f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/trees/6e9efb1d2f8b499044957887317fdc21835ba86f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/commits/b467cc8e0a6a2cfda2f8a13516c7e061528e9d21","verification":{"payload":"tree 6e9efb1d2f8b499044957887317fdc21835ba86f\nparent fc671473a835c2cc60736ac71666fd8adae88ee1\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791180043 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791180059 -0700\n\nfeat: applicant profile and fill packets for filling in the owner''s own browser\n\nEvery board we apply through refuses the runner at submit — Greenhouse holds\nthe application for an emailed code, Ashby flags the browser as spam — so\nthe owner will fill and submit from their own Chrome with an extension.\n\n- applicant_profiles (migration 0023) + GET/PUT /applicant-profile: the\n  runner''s ApplicantProfile, until now only a local file on its machine.\n- GET /jobs/:id/fill-packet: that profile, the answers the APPROVED fill\n  entered, its options and multi-select keys, every saved answer, and the\n  résumé PDF link — so the extension replays what the owner reviewed.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGmPyFYA9nc7en55wcLjGL/mzJvXtStFdQoVFieCWSVzYK56UDcZvIMLGnAC63II60\nbO1oUgoKy8YKj1mDAnIQ0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T06:01:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/commit/b467cc8e0a6a2cfda2f8a13516c7e061528e9d21","node_id":"C_kwDORvwX0NoAKGI0NjdjYzhlMGE2YTJjZmRhMmY4YTEzNTE2YzdlMDYxNTI4ZTlkMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/commit/fc671473a835c2cc60736ac71666fd8adae88ee1","sha":"fc671473a835c2cc60736ac71666fd8adae88ee1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/commits/fc671473a835c2cc60736ac71666fd8adae88ee1"}],"sha":"b467cc8e0a6a2cfda2f8a13516c7e061528e9d21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/commits/b467cc8e0a6a2cfda2f8a13516c7e061528e9d21"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/commits/fc671473a835c2cc60736ac71666fd8adae88ee1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:56:25Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:56:43Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"message":"feat: verification codes on the dashboard, for the owner only\n\nGreenhouse holds an application until a code it emails is typed in. The\nowner, who runs both the hadoku.me mail service and the dashboard, asked to\nread those codes here rather than in an inbox. GET /verification-codes reads\nthe last 6 hours of the mail feed live and extracts the code; the\nApplications view polls it and shows each one with a copy button.\n\nAdmin only — the feed is the owner''s mailbox — and never a service identity\nor ownerName, so the runner can''t get a code. Nothing is stored. The\n\"never displayed\" line in DECISION-mail-reconciler.md is updated to match.\n\nAlso: a jobsFeed test compared a ghost posting against a twin seeded with a\nfixed scraped_at, which passed 60 days old today and flipped the comparison\non staleness; the twin is now seen as recently as the ghost.","tree":{"sha":"0365681b8bd4634387a84cba455c751b7ec5bbef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/trees/0365681b8bd4634387a84cba455c751b7ec5bbef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/commits/fc671473a835c2cc60736ac71666fd8adae88ee1","verification":{"payload":"tree 0365681b8bd4634387a84cba455c751b7ec5bbef\nparent bb1a920ddebddcd83399c351304c692dcc0d0eba\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791179785 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791179803 -0700\n\nfeat: verification codes on the dashboard, for the owner only\n\nGreenhouse holds an application until a code it emails is typed in. The\nowner, who runs both the hadoku.me mail service and the dashboard, asked to\nread those codes here rather than in an inbox. GET /verification-codes reads\nthe last 6 hours of the mail feed live and extracts the code; the\nApplications view polls it and shows each one with a copy button.\n\nAdmin only — the feed is the owner''s mailbox — and never a service identity\nor ownerName, so the runner can''t get a code. Nothing is stored. The\n\"never displayed\" line in DECISION-mail-reconciler.md is updated to match.\n\nAlso: a jobsFeed test compared a ghost posting against a twin seeded with a\nfixed scraped_at, which passed 60 days old today and flipped the comparison\non staleness; the twin is now seen as recently as the ghost.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQEClOzHVECrY3zwdboVplTRsk0rn8+jYZDzL7IsbQTtueyVBlMMOr1oO9oltYYewXa\nJpoGphFNEmSrXqT5tBow0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"20