412e26184a31556a18d6f1348464ae2cd53fbce5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:37:54Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:37:54Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"message":"fix(answers): a blocked question shows ITS board''s options\n\nMany boards ask \"Veteran Status\" with different wording. The queue showed\nwhichever board''s options it read first, so Chime''s card offered \"I am not\na protected veteran\" — the owner picked it, and it can never land on Chime,\nwhose option reads \"No, I am not a veteran\". A pending question now takes\nthe options of a row it is blocking; first sighting is only the fallback.\n\nThe test seeds the other board so it is read first; ordered the other way\nthe old code passed, which is how this survived.","tree":{"sha":"0c9f801bb162ebcce248910417b5f3d588a1d589","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/trees/0c9f801bb162ebcce248910417b5f3d588a1d589"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/commits/412e26184a31556a18d6f1348464ae2cd53fbce5","verification":{"payload":"tree 0c9f801bb162ebcce248910417b5f3d588a1d589\nparent d3e427fde7e5fea9ac3c24dfcf0822a902507e26\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791009474 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791009474 -0700\n\nfix(answers): a blocked question shows ITS board''s options\n\nMany boards ask \"Veteran Status\" with different wording. The queue showed\nwhichever board''s options it read first, so Chime''s card offered \"I am not\na protected veteran\" — the owner picked it, and it can never land on Chime,\nwhose option reads \"No, I am not a veteran\". A pending question now takes\nthe options of a row it is blocking; first sighting is only the fallback.\n\nThe test seeds the other board so it is read first; ordered the other way\nthe old code passed, which is how this survived.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKjZokJZPZcc8jGfZG8RDIk6RftUDt2Pxxj9cMnwrAp73n+RKW0NfMPh2Bjxw47ux/\naiYEBvpl2S6M6z8I2QNA8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T06:38:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/commit/412e26184a31556a18d6f1348464ae2cd53fbce5","node_id":"C_kwDORvwX0NoAKDQxMmUyNjE4NGEzMTU1NmExOGQ2ZjEzNDg0NjRhZTJjZDUzZmJjZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/commit/d3e427fde7e5fea9ac3c24dfcf0822a902507e26","sha":"d3e427fde7e5fea9ac3c24dfcf0822a902507e26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/commits/d3e427fde7e5fea9ac3c24dfcf0822a902507e26"}],"sha":"412e26184a31556a18d6f1348464ae2cd53fbce5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/commits/412e26184a31556a18d6f1348464ae2cd53fbce5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/commits/d3e427fde7e5fea9ac3c24dfcf0822a902507e26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:12:43Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:12:43Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"message":"fix(answers): an answer saved after the fill is waiting, not rejected\n\nThe queue called any saved answer on a blocked question \"not one of this\nboard''s options\" — including answers saved after the row was last filled,\nwhich have never met the form. The owner answered 78 questions on\n2026-10-03 and saw a wall of rejections for answers nothing had tried.\nRejected now means a fill ran after the answer was saved.\n\nAlso: an optional \"If yes, …\" follow-up is no longer put to the owner\n(a required one still is), and matchOption treats every name of the United\nStates as one, mirroring scraper 8b75884.","tree":{"sha":"048055a270cef202c011bdbe15cd5df7f5ee77ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/trees/048055a270cef202c011bdbe15cd5df7f5ee77ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/commits/d3e427fde7e5fea9ac3c24dfcf0822a902507e26","verification":{"payload":"tree 048055a270cef202c011bdbe15cd5df7f5ee77ea\nparent ceb3a99b5977f0f28753c5fa1022001f97dec738\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791007963 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791007963 -0700\n\nfix(answers): an answer saved after the fill is waiting, not rejected\n\nThe queue called any saved answer on a blocked question \"not one of this\nboard''s options\" — including answers saved after the row was last filled,\nwhich have never met the form. The owner answered 78 questions on\n2026-10-03 and saw a wall of rejections for answers nothing had tried.\nRejected now means a fill ran after the answer was saved.\n\nAlso: an optional \"If yes, …\" follow-up is no longer put to the owner\n(a required one still is), and matchOption treats every name of the United\nStates as one, mirroring scraper 8b75884.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQO9mg2/I1FwDnF2B5qyVtiOcNUPF2i/jsOD7oTVOuYe363vw7+9qIdQmHXZiLIwell\n8P0GZVJzMKbWfV7RNN7A4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T06:13:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_eve