b3a99b5977f0f28753c5fa1022001f97dec738/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T05:54:08Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T05:54:08Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"message":"fix(applications): a background re-queue can no longer erase an approval\n\npacket-link stashed the minted slug under the CALLER, so the runner''s service\nidentity got it and the owner''s application row never did. Every fill minted\nagain, and the mint ends in POST /jobs/:id/apply — which re-queued 18\napproved rows on 2026-10-02 and cleared their approvals.\n\n- packet-link and application-extras resolve ownerName (effectiveUserId),\n  before minting, so a refused name leaves no orphan variant.\n- POST /jobs/:id/apply refuses an approved row unless forced, and a\n  submitted one always: re-queueing clears the approval and would refill and\n  resend a sent application.","tree":{"sha":"7c18fd9fb08b3472673e59d34f3c347f376889f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/trees/7c18fd9fb08b3472673e59d34f3c347f376889f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/commits/ceb3a99b5977f0f28753c5fa1022001f97dec738","verification":{"payload":"tree 7c18fd9fb08b3472673e59d34f3c347f376889f4\nparent db7d22fe15756cf554088b2edd67c86c9ced9205\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791006848 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791006848 -0700\n\nfix(applications): a background re-queue can no longer erase an approval\n\npacket-link stashed the minted slug under the CALLER, so the runner''s service\nidentity got it and the owner''s application row never did. Every fill minted\nagain, and the mint ends in POST /jobs/:id/apply — which re-queued 18\napproved rows on 2026-10-02 and cleared their approvals.\n\n- packet-link and application-extras resolve ownerName (effectiveUserId),\n  before minting, so a refused name leaves no orphan variant.\n- POST /jobs/:id/apply refuses an approved row unless forced, and a\n  submitted one always: re-queueing clears the approval and would refill and\n  resend a sent application.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMiQI3TW0ZT3b8sq57Jocveg9x7jJZbhCNv1dbrQW/6wDvacZwg7XBjDLj1zd5FInZ\nV0SK556bDVmuDiHfHIaAY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T05:54:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/commit/ceb3a99b5977f0f28753c5fa1022001f97dec738","node_id":"C_kwDORvwX0NoAKGNlYjNhOTliNTk3N2YwZjI4NzUzYzVmYTEwMjIwMDFmOTdkZWM3Mzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/commit/db7d22fe15756cf554088b2edd67c86c9ced9205","sha":"db7d22fe15756cf554088b2edd67c86c9ced9205","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/commits/db7d22fe15756cf554088b2edd67c86c9ced9