ffirm''s \"Other Links\" joins the personal-website family.","tree":{"sha":"72a1df126b6d940c9a13aa9c761b21cb2e89e6d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/trees/72a1df126b6d940c9a13aa9c761b21cb2e89e6d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/commits/db7d22fe15756cf554088b2edd67c86c9ced9205","verification":{"payload":"tree 72a1df126b6d940c9a13aa9c761b21cb2e89e6d8\nparent 750a5b51490b4c7c879b31ae0a4ffb8de4373273\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791005795 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1791005812 -0700\n\nfeat(answers): checkboxes for select-all questions, a tick box for consents\n\n- /unanswered-questions reports multi (from the runner''s evidence, scraper\n  75de8d5); the dashboard offers checkboxes and saves the picks joined by\n  \" | \". Datadog''s \"select all the languages you speak\" was a single picker.\n- A question whose only option is itself (Aledade''s and Chime''s consent\n  boxes) is a tick box saved as \"Yes\", not a text box.\n- Closed postings leave the applications list: nothing to review or act on.\n- Affirm''s \"Other Links\" joins the personal-website family.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIEcYZ0KphRGVsyVFzg64xlBzbc/wp9l9jao8z0WGiiEDq0Kp4nqev3C36zjrPZpUc\n/Jea6+m19QzMb72j+Obw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T05:36:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.c