hub.com","name":"WolffM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:52:41Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"message":"chore: bump the worker package the rebase left behind\n\nThe pre-commit hook bumps per commit, but every worker bump on this branch was\na version-line conflict against the answers queue and got resolved to\nupstream''s number. The worker package therefore still read 2.12.0 with the\nfeed rewrite inside it, so a publish would have shipped changed code under a\nversion already on the registry.","tree":{"sha":"3e82279a15ed7c073e88c6c2bc0044fc6ed70223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/trees/3e82279a15ed7c073e88c6c2bc0044fc6ed70223"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-jobplatform/git/commits/07a6602e9e4afbcf0a508aa0c119a4464b788cb6","verification":{"payload":"tree 3e82279a15ed7c073e88c6c2bc0044fc6ed70223\nparent 7c947a6b2c54fe17d916d94671ed286f8c58fcfb\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1788295961 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1788295961 -0700\n\nchore: bump the worker package the rebase left behind\n\nThe pre-commit hook bumps per commit, but every worker bump on this branch was\na version-line conflict against the answers queue and got resolved to\nupstream''s number. The worker package therefore still read 2.12.0 with the\nfeed rewrite inside it, so a publish would have shipped changed code under a\nversion already on the registry.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMec7INEG0OAud7QCsOSfx1bYjO7CXm82QjefpsxJaR3mEKfLByWeUzoDZ0kJCxArh\nnd7vQCZMMa1l/4TJYh9gY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-01T20:53:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_ur