e_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDE1ZTIyNjA3ZDZhNGZiZGFmZWY4ZDlkNTM0ZDYzMzUwYjg0MTZhYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/83a84ba164f31d637e24439d8f3f42917c45eec6","sha":"83a84ba164f31d637e24439d8f3f42917c45eec6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/83a84ba164f31d637e24439d8f3f42917c45eec6"}],"sha":"15e22607d6a4fbdafef8d9d534d63350b8416aa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/15e22607d6a4fbdafef8d9d534d63350b8416aa3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/83a84ba164f31d637e24439d8f3f42917c45eec6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:34:24Z","email":"165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com","name":"praveen-vr-moonhive"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:34:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(crm-fe): real-estate sales CRM UI — unit booking, matching units, assignment rules, dedup/import/merge, RE widgets (#53)\n\n* feat(crm-fe): unit booking in lead/deal product pickers (A8)\n\nBehind submodule:crm:unit_booking: Project (inventory category) filter,\nclient-side \"Only available\" toggle and a hold-duration select (default\n48h) sent as hold_hours when attaching a unit; hold/sold chip per product\nline from reservation_status/reservation_expires_at; 409s surface via the\nexisting add-error alert. Adds useCrmFeatureFlag + RE_FLAGS and exports\nthe shared crmApiClient for per-feature service files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* feat(crm-fe): duplicate-lead warning and lead merge (A6)\n\n- leadDedupService: parse 409 DUPLICATE_LEAD, POST /leads/:keepId/merge\n- DuplicateLeadWarning (Open existing / Cancel) on Create Lead and inline save\n- MergeLeadPanel side panel from a Merge header action on Lead Detail\n  (needs leads.update + leads.delete; hidden on customer route)\n- BDD specs for service, components and page wiring\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* feat(crm-fe): lead assignment rules settings tab (A5)\n\nSettings -> Assignment (flag submodule:crm:lead_assignment): inline rule\neditor with conditions, People (UserSelector) or Department\n(DepartmentSelector) target, method and skip-inactive; reorder, toggle,\ndelete, and a dry-run \"Test a lead\" panel against POST\n/assignment-rules/test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* feat(crm-fe): lead import wizard — upload, map, review, import (A7)\n\nImport button on the Leads header (flag action:crm:bulk_import + leads.create)\nopens a single-modal wizard: file preview via POST /leads/import/preview,\ncolumn-to-field mapping pre-filled from suggested_mapping, sample-row review\nwith a duplicate policy, then POST /leads/import (file re-sent with the\nmapping JSON) and a created/updated/skipped summary with row errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* feat(crm-fe): matching units panel on lead and deal products (A9)\n\nBehind submodule:crm:property_matching. Lists crm-be''s scored matches\n(GET leads|deals/:id/matching-units) with score, facts and reasons;\nAttach reuses addLeadProduct/addDealProduct (default 48h hold when unit\nbooking is on); Share copies a plain-text unit summary. Empty or failed\nlookups render nothing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* feat(crm-fe): real-estate dashboard widgets (A10)\n\nInventory, pipeline by project, holds expiring in 24h and source conversion\non the CRM dashboard, behind submodule:crm:re_widgets. Reads\nGET /dashboard/re-widgets; flag off, empty or failed response renders\nnothing, and an error boundary keeps the dashboard intact.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* test(crm-fe): close branch gaps in RE services, flag hook and unit booking helpers\n\nAdds BDD cases for toRuleBody array/null/blank-in conditions, parseDuplicateLead\nstatus-less and malformed bodies, describeImportError edge messages, matching\nunit encoding/flooring and sparse share text, RE widget normalisation of loose\nrows plus default clocks, and describeReservation threshold timings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* test(crm-fe): branch coverage for reservation chip, unit booking controls, RE widgets and matching panel\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* test(crm-fe): branch coverage for merge panel, import wizard and create-lead duplicate warning\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* test(crm-fe): branch coverage for the assignment rules settings tab\n\nCovers loading/empty/explained-error states, summary fallbacks, editor\nnormalisation, picker onChange shapes, shell fallbacks, save/toggle/delete\n/reorder failure and in-flight paths, and every test-a-lead outcome.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* test(crm-fe): flag on/off/not-loaded cases for RE page wiring; useShellBridge in older Dashboard mocks\n\n- DashboardPage.reWidgets: flags not loaded and unrelated flag keep widgets hidden\n- SettingsPage.assignment: settings write off, tab switching, flags not loaded\n- LeadsPage.import: wizard close/reopen, onImported refetch, flags not loaded\n- DashboardPage bdd/extra/leadDeletion/test: mock useShellBridge (RE flags off)\n  so REWidgets does not throw on the missing export\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* test(crm-fe): LeadDetailPage A6 merge/duplicate branch coverage\n\nMerge gate (no update, permissions not loaded, customers route), panel close,\nmerge success broadcast + refetch, duplicate Cancel refetch + leave edit,\nwarning cleared on next save, non-duplicate 4xx/5xx/no-status/409-non-dup toasts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* test(crm-fe): product-tab RE branch specs + crmApiClient mock in older product-tab specs\n\n- DealProductsTab/LeadProductsTab.bdd: mock crmApiClient.get (MatchingUnitsPanel\n  renders under the default all-flags-on alias shell) and assert the matching call.\n- New *.re.branches.bdd specs: fallback add/attach errors, null unit facts\n  (item_id label, price 0), existing-items filter, chip hidden when booking off,\n  single-arg search, all-sold \"No products found\", project reset hint, chosen\n  hold_hours, default 48h hold on attach, lead infinite scroll with/without project.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* test(crm-fe): drop the duplicate getLeadProducts stub that shadowed the spy in the lead matching spec\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* test(crm-fe): make the merge, matching and import specs deterministic\n\n- merge: drain queued mockResolvedValueOnce between tests; wait for the null search to actually run\n- matching: both units share facts, so assert both lines\n- import: scope the custom-field option to the Budget picker\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"353c2e2cb8fde096f18ea896f4cb69a76ca039dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/353c2e2cb8fde096f18ea896f4cb69a76ca039dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/83a84ba164f31d637e24439d8f3f42917c45eec6","verification":{"payload":"tree 353c2e2cb8fde096f18ea896f4cb69a76ca039dc\nparent 5145dd49771273272349493bf1f77f238ee09e84\nauthor praveen-vr-moonhive <165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com> 1790606064 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790606064 +0400\n\nfeat(crm-fe): real-estate sales CRM UI — unit booking, matching units, assignment rules, dedup/import/merge, RE widgets (#53)\n\n* feat(crm-fe): unit booking in lead/deal product pickers (A8)\n\nBehind submodule:crm:unit_booking: Project (inventory category) filter,\nclient-side \"Only available\" toggle and a hold-duration select (default\n48h) sent as hold_hours when attaching a unit; hold/sold chip per product\nline from reservation_status/reservation_expires_at; 409s surface via the\nexisting add-error alert. Adds useCrmFeatureFlag + RE_FLAGS and exports\nthe shared crmApiClient for per-feature service files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* feat(crm-fe): duplicate-lead warning and lead merge (A6)\n\n- leadDedupService: parse 409 DUPLICATE_LEAD, POST /leads/:keepId/merge\n- DuplicateLeadWarning (Open existing / Cancel) on Create Lead and inline save\n- MergeLeadPanel side panel from a Merge header action on Lead Detail\n  (needs leads.update + leads.delete; hidden on customer route)\n- BDD specs for service, components and page wiring\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* feat(crm-fe): lead assignment rules settings tab (A5)\n\nSettings -> Assignment (flag submodule:crm:lead_assignment): inline rule\neditor with conditions, People (UserSelector) or Department\n(DepartmentSelector) target, method and skip-inactive; reorder, toggle,\ndelete, and a dry-run \"Test a lead\" panel against POST\n/assignment-rules/test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* feat(crm-fe): lead import wizard — upload, map, review, import (A7)\n\nImport button on the Leads header (flag action:crm:bulk_import + leads.create)\nopens a single-modal wizard: file preview via POST /leads/import/preview,\ncolumn-to-field mapping pre-filled from suggested_mapping, sample-row review\nwith a duplicate policy, then POST /leads/import (file re-sent with the\nmapping JSON) and a created/updated/skipped summary with row errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* feat(crm-fe): matching units panel on lead and deal products (A9)\n\nBehind submodule:crm:property_matching. Lists crm-be''s scored matches\n(GET leads|deals/:id/matching-units) with score, facts and reasons;\nAttach reuses addLeadProduct/addDealProduct (default 48h hold when unit\nbooking is on); Share copies a plain-text unit summary. Empty or failed\nlookups render nothing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* feat(crm-fe): real-estate dashboard widgets (A10)\n\nInventory, pipeline by project, holds expiring in 24h and source conversion\non the CRM dashboard, behind submodule:crm:re_widgets. Reads\nGET /dashboard/re-widgets; flag off, empty or failed response renders\nnothing, and an error boundary keeps the dashboard intact.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* test(crm-fe): close branch gaps in RE services, flag hook and unit booking helpers\n\nAdds BDD cases for toRuleBody array/null/blank-in conditions, parseDuplicateLead\nstatus-less and malformed bodies, describeImportError edge messages, matching\nunit encoding/flooring and sparse share text, RE widget normalisation of loose\nrows plus default clocks, and describeReservation threshold timings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* test(crm-fe): branch coverage for reservation chip, unit booking controls, RE widgets and matching panel\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* test(crm-fe): branch coverage for merge panel, import wi