sreekpcreatives/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anusreekpcreatives/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anusreekpcreatives/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anusreekpcreatives/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anusreekpcreatives","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/973be4549417c68be4a604a8757ed0bddb3c3d6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:37:28Z","email":"anusree.k.p@creatives.moonhive.in","name":"Anusree"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:37:28Z","email":"anusree.k.p@creatives.moonhive.in","name":"Anusree"},"message":"fix(tasks): keep the chosen assignee on project-linked lead tasks\n\nTasks created from Lead Detail and linked to a Project could end up owned\nby the wrong person (Pulse 4dc7892e).\n\n- A new task defaulted its assignee to whichever user the list returned\n  first. It now defaults to the current user, or asks for one.\n- Every save resent assignee_id, so editing only the date or status could\n  reassign. Edits now send it only when it actually changed.\n- Assigning a project-linked task to someone outside the project team is\n  blocked before saving, with a message to pick a project member.\n- Removed the client-side CRM_TASK_ASSIGNED emit; the backend already sends\n  it, so assignees were notified twice.\n- onSuccess gets the task as returned by the project link, so lists show\n  the link without a refresh.\n- updateTask forwards description, priority and start_date, which were\n  silently dropped on edit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"90fdc9c664ce379bd52aaaf879e7c43094253cf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/90fdc9c664ce379bd52aaaf879e7c43094253cf8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/