r":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/6511364af7bd9d935a86dfdc2ad4165d44d71152/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:02:35Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:02:35Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(crm-fe): stabilize Deal Detail loading skeleton and header wrap\n\nDeal Detail previously rendered a bare centered spinner while fetchData()\nresolved 7+ parallel/conditional calls, causing a large uncontrolled height\njump from spinner to full header + lifecycle stepper + two-column grid +\ntabs on every load, plus secondary pop-in for late-arriving conditional\ndata (e.g. associated lead / contact card).\n\n- Replace the spinner with a structural skeleton (header, lifecycle strip,\n  two-column grid, tabs) that height-matches the loaded layout, following\n  this repo''s existing animate-pulse skeleton convention (QuoteDetailPage).\n- Add flex-wrap to the header action button group (Delete, Request\n  Signature, Create Estimate, Create Invoice, Create/Manage Project) so\n  2-5 conditionally-rendered buttons wrap instead of squeezing the deal\n  name at md (768-1024px) widths. Verified no conflict with the sibling\n  stage-selector dropdown fix already on this branch.\n- DealLifecycleStepper: truncate fixed-width stage labels instead of only\n  text-center, preventing wrap-induced stepper height changes.\n\nNo data-fetching logic was modified — this is a rendering/layout fix only.\n\nPulse task e57a26ae.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"da197c0deca99ed340037a38811ffebbde970ba5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/da197c0deca99ed340037a38811ffebbde970ba5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/6511364af7bd9d935a86dfdc2ad4165d44d71152","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/6511364af7bd9d935a86dfdc2ad4165d44d71152","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDY1MTEzNjRhZjdiZDlkOTM1YTg2ZGZkYzJhZDQxNjVkNDRkNzExNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/2b875972b90eebdcd9c6ecd7da83229ea423391e","sha":"2b875972b90eebdcd9c6ecd7da83229ea423391e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/2b875972b90eebdcd9c6ecd7da83229ea423391e"}],"sha":"6511364af7bd9d935a86dfdc2ad4165d44d71152","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/6511364af7bd9d935a86dfdc2ad4165d44d71152"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/2b875972b90eebdcd9c6ecd7da83229ea423391e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:00:25Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:00:25Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(crm-fe): open a proper popover dropdown for deal stage selection\n\nThe deal-detail header wrapped the deal name AND stage badge in one click\ntarget, so clicking anywhere near the name swapped the whole header for a\nbare native <select>. That select also wrote stage_id via a raw\nPATCH /deals/:id, diverging from the Pipeline board''s flow\n(crmService.updateDealStage -> target_state), which meant it never synced\ncurrent_flow_state / the Deal Lifecycle Stepper and had no deals.update\npermission gate.\n\n- Move the click target onto the stage badge alone; the <h1> deal name is\n  now always rendered and never swapped out.\n- Replace the raw <select> with a popover-style dropdown (button trigger +\n  isOpen state + outside-click/Escape handling), mirroring\n  StageStatusSelect''s interaction pattern.\n- Selecting a stage now opens the same StageTransitionModal the Pipeline\n  board uses, and commits via crmService.updateDealStage(id, stageId,\n  reason) instead of handleUpdateDeal({ stage_id }) — one API path, one\n  confirmation UX, and current_flow_state/the Lifecycle Stepper stay in\n  sync with the board.\n- Gate the control behind a new canEditDeal check (hasPermission(''deals.update''),\n  fail-closed), following the same pattern as canDeleteDeal.\n- Highlight the current stage in the dropdown; stage order stays driven by\n  dealStages from settingsData?.deal_stages (no hardcoding).\n\nAdds BDD coverage in DealDetailPage.bdd.test.tsx for: opening the dropdown\nwithout touching the deal name, the deal name staying visible while open,\noutside-click/Escape closing without any update call, selecting a stage\ncalling crmService.updateDealStage (not the old stage_id PATCH path),\ncurrent-stage highlighting, a same-stage click being a no-op, and the\ncontrol being disabled/inert for a user without deals.update.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"95ebd3d91ccde8c6a164905c67d96b7b5ba37b20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/95ebd3d91ccde8c6a164905c67d96b7b5ba37b20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/2b875972b90eebdcd9c6ecd7da83229ea423391e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/2b875972b90eebdcd9c6ecd7da83229ea423391e","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDJiODc1OTcyYjkwZWViZGNkOWM2ZWNkN2RhODMyMjllYTQyMzM5MWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/b4138045861d8773db5ec38399599d94d417e1d3","sha":"b4138045861d8773db5ec38399599d94d417e1d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/b4138045861d8773db5ec38399599d94d417e1d3"}],"sha":"2b875972b90eebdcd9c6ecd7da83229ea423391e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/2b875972b90eebdcd9c6ecd7da83229ea423391e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/03bfd962200dc49546c0a18686282aa8dbd74240/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:00:17Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:00:17Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(crm-fe): gate dashboard route on crm.dashboard.view, remove legacy stats bypass\n\nPulse 5174b5ae: the CRM Dashboard route had no PermissionGuard at all, so\nany authenticated user (including basic Tasks/Leads-only roles) could open\nit and see business-metrics. Wrap the /dashboard route with\nPermissionGuard permission=''crm.dashboard.view'', matching the pattern used\nby the leads/pipeline/tasks routes.\n\nAlso remove crmService.getDashboardStats()''s dead \"legacy client-side\naggregation\" branch, which computed revenue/pipeline/win-rate stats\nclient-side from raw getLeads()/getDeals()/getUsers()/getTasks() calls\nwhenever no `period` param was passed, bypassing the analytics-endpoint''s\nserver-side permission gate entirely. The method now always routes through\nthe gated /analytics/dashboard endpoint, defaulting to a monthly period.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd0f923645165764ddd134923091902198967c00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/cd0f923645165764ddd134923091902198967c00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/03bfd962200dc49546c0a18686282aa8dbd74240","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/03bfd962200dc49546c0a18686282aa8dbd74240","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDAzYmZkOTYyMjAwZGM0OTU0NmMwYTE4Njg2MjgyYWE4ZGJkNzQyNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/b4138045861d8773db5ec38399599d94d417e1d3","sha":"b4138045861d8773db5ec38399599d94d417e1d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/b4138045861d8773db5ec38399599d94d417e1d3"}],"sha":"03bfd962200dc49546c0a18686282aa8dbd74240","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/03bfd962200dc49546c0a18686282aa8dbd74240"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/b4138045861d8773db5ec38399599d94d417e1d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:31:03Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:31:03Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"test(crm-fe): fix reply-content fixtures against the NoteContent mock\n\nRoot cause found via local repro: this test file mocks NoteContent as\na plain passthrough ({html} rendered as text, not dangerouslySetInnerHTML).\nThe two new reply tests passed HTML-wrapped content (''<p>...</p>''),\nwhich the mock rendered as escaped literal text instead of parsing it,\nso `getByText(''First reply'')` never matched. Existing tests in this\nfile already avoid HTML tags in note content for the same reason —\nswitched the new reply fixtures to plain text to match. Verified with\na full local vitest run (only an unrelated, pre-existing DashboardPage\nflake remains, confirmed to pass in isolation and untouched by any of\ntoday''s changes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d203c53ebafe9ec9e3ab728d43dad15e2b1a741c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/d203c53ebafe9ec9e3ab728d43dad15e2b1a741c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/b4138045861d8773db5ec38399599d94d417e1d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.gith