onhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/faeadc70cb79564a50a812c7f254a5afb97e8a9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T08:40:25Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T08:40:25Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(partners): resolve ambiguous \"2 partners\" text match in BDD test\n\nThe pre-push gate caught this: PartnerStatusOverview''s own \"N partners\"\nheader text collides with the pre-existing pagination footer''s\n\"{filteredPartners.length} partners\" text, so getByText(''2 partners'')\nthrew on the ambiguous multi-match rather than the intended single\nmatch. Narrowed the assertion to the overview''s unique\n\"Partner Type Distribution\" heading instead; count/percentage coverage\nalready lives in the dedicated \"Given the Partner Status Overview\"\ntests below.\n\nTask: 52daf7c7\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3e69c6dd2bbaa7509f7ce7f86f449015684a21a","