://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/2f20edd423670d1962cb04cb764606b030192a37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T10:54:38Z","email":"165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com","name":"praveen-vr-moonhive"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T10:54:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(targets): custom metric 400 + dynamic Lead Stage Metrics picker (#43)\n\n* fix(targets): custom metric 400 + dynamic Lead Stage Metrics picker\n\nhandleCreateCustomMetric never sent `source`, which crm-be''s\nCreateTaskTypeDto requires (@IsEnum, no default) — every \"Create & Add to\nPlan\" click 400''d. Extracts payload-building into metricCatalog.ts and sends\nsource: ''MANUAL'', the only source that doesn''t also need a\nflow_trigger/crm_table_rule.\n\nAdds the \"+ Lead Stage Metric\" quick-add: fetches GET\n/sales-targets/metric-catalog (grouped Lead Stage / Standard / Custom\nmetrics, sourced live from the Flow module''s CRM lead flow definition) and\nlets an admin wire up any unlinked stage as a FLOW_TRANSITION task type\nkeyed on `flow_trigger.to_state`. The per-row metric <select> now groups by\nthese three categories via <optgroup>, falling back to one flat list if the\ncatalog fails to load so metric selection is never blocked.\n\nBDD specs in metricCatalog.bdd.test.ts cover the payload builders and\nclassification, plus a source-scan regression guard for the missing\n`source` field that caused the 400.\n\n* test(targets): cover unlinkedLeadStages missing-field edge case\n\nRounds out metricCatalog.bdd.test.ts: unlinkedLeadStages on a catalog object\nwith no lead_stage_metrics field at all (not just null/undefined).","tree":{"sha":"c20311629815a8bf3b0bd6211cef0eb83c432bc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/c20311629815a8bf3b0bd6211cef0eb83c432bc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/2f20edd423670d1962cb04cb764606b030192a37","verification":{"payload":"tree c20311629815a8bf3b0bd6211cef0eb83c432bc2\nparent 05e90612fee208655f19add4c88bed15f00507db\nauthor praveen-vr-moonhive <165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com> 1788951278 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788951278 +0400\n\nfix(targets): custom metric 400 + dynamic Lead Stage Metrics picker (#43)\n\n* fix(targets): custom metric 400 + dynamic Lead Stage Metrics picker\n\nhandleCreateCustomMetric never sent `source`, which crm-be''s\nCreateTaskTypeDto requires (@IsEnum, no default) — every \"Create & Add to\nPlan\" click 400''d. Extracts payload-building into metricCatalog.ts and sends\nsource: ''MANUAL'', the only source that doesn''t also need a\nflow_trigger/crm_table_rule.\n\nAdds the \"+ Lead Stage Metric\" quick-add: fetches GET\n/sales-targets/metric-catalog (grouped Lead Stage / Standard / Custom\nmetrics, sourced live from the Flow module''s CRM lead flow definition) and\nlets an admin wire up any unlinked stage as a FLOW_TRANSITION task type\nkeyed on `flow_trigger.to_state`. The per-row metric <select> now groups by\nthese three categories via <optgroup>, falling back to one flat list if the\ncatalog fails to load so metric selection is never blocked.\n\nBDD specs in metricCatalog.bdd.test.ts cover the payload builders and\nclassification, plus a source-scan regression guard for the missing\n`source` field that caused the 400.\n\n* test(targets): cover unlinkedLeadStages missing-field edge case\n\nRounds out metricCatalog.bdd.test.ts: unlinkedLeadStages on a catalog object\nwith no lead_stage_metrics field at all (not just null/undefined).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoTruCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMLwQAGkUFzxekIndM5bHnsPTPKF7\nVjf9e2NbhDzAoNs8gRdXJEo6hD7eji4t1vmKn/XD9WYMQ1USNAqjcrJxZ2BhWFBx\nnWEwD3Ig3BfEoyJL/lLrZSFmP7Tt8Rxbnk5Eb/E9Ekl2Xxtl6rd0Baq7yL3SsN0W\nc2U1eQeUWx9wT4RQ7XI2+KUt0sssEZmwREoJKdyNaa8pF/+CLaGIOHKdMyLdh5mH\n4iwaZG5KQKQ1zwLwY3K0PjiJ/ZGc9pUfK4roJ0bbrkCnaV7lSwkpv+LdMR8yVqfr\n6KGNrpJ4akSqm7BjWtnLzULARZvTA/1bMeU6qyureINJQfmlta8WTtHxmHZBscXx\nBtZqZpZ3cAdpZ9k7z9N6BYfBbYrSfOhHzc1M+n+1L6lHfAZGiP2Bnhosb/39vBBA\nD+P/CPN//ND45xzO/U6w3eTOQU31ygHKov3higzEmrx9l+vdEZuVi6Qu8DDvjlQI\nftWT8KIr1K/0YhvkFaeqsnDrL7ZN3AThxT29JnRv7u6BWev18UHBDLmXTHMxqGZw\nhYfEsn8YGxVdhytqXSInoEUjpoy1q09bKAIyMob66gWbdCasU3qyNFb4UeNiNItT\nLchpqIQ6DTokyVHttMq4Se8/6/p7WQTBFkP+p1cd35MH0hmxbDFfxkNXvU2afVAN\nTejnypWLpAuz/+FVq5Ef\n=qplX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-09T10:54:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url