raveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T18:49:39Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(crm-fe): fetch Inventory product categories under the /v1/inventory prefix\n\ngetProductCategories tried the unprefixed /settings/:orgId first, which\nInventory 404s (it serves the route as /v1/inventory/settings/:orgId),\nlogging a console error on every Custom Product Build modal open before\nfalling through to the correct path. Drops the dead first attempt.\n\nAdds BDD specs asserting the prefixed path is used, the unprefixed one\nis never called, no double /v1/v1, and empty-list fallbacks hold.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XChVyESdFfaAjW13yRZori","tree":{"sha":"5b5a71531b9e53b598549a1de2d935d9f8ee70bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/5b5a71531b9e53b598549a1de2d935d9f8ee70bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/541501fafc8729ba5ea08b2de981d4fb8d7cc439","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_