/api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/7527abc5242ec8b9d0958b93c68c62d40f9ea4da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:54:57Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:54:57Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(leads): a duplicate-email 409 offers \"Open the existing record\"\n\ncrmService now carries the structured error body on the thrown Error\n(apiError.body). CreateLeadModal reads code DUPLICATE_EMAIL + existing_id /\nexisting_type from it and renders a link to the existing lead or customer\nunder the message, instead of only repeating the sentence.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DzwVcvA8C7AMZ1hL81KRDp","tree":{"sha":"143242e909fa102b64232ae6bd02b751c1073edc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/143242e909fa102b64232ae6bd02b751c1073edc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/7527abc5242ec8b9d0958b93c68c62d40f9ea4da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/7527abc5242ec8b9d0958b93c68c62d40f9ea4da","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDc1MjdhYmM1MjQyZWM4YjlkMDk1OGI5M2M2OGM2MmQ0MGY5ZWE0ZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/91abff5a86de083fc9245a468f586b462146abb9","sha":"91abff5a86de083fc9245a468f586b462146abb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/91abff5a86de083fc9245a468f586b462146abb9"}],"sha":"7527abc5242ec8b9d0958b93c68c62d40f9ea4da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/7527abc5242ec8b9d0958b93c68c62d40f9ea4da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/91abff5a86de083fc9245a468f586b462146abb9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:40:08Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:40:08Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(inbox): route inboxClient through inbox-be''s /v1/inbox global prefix\n\nCustomer detail page''s Emails tab / AI summary card (LeadDetailPage,\nreused for converted leads) called GET /conversations/by-crm-lead/:leadId\ndirectly on INBOX_API_ORIGIN, but inbox-be sets a global route prefix of\nv1/inbox — so every call 404''d with \"Cannot GET\n/conversations/by-crm-lead/:leadId\". inboxClient''s base URL now carries\n/v1/inbox, matching the existing fulfillmentClient pattern for the same\nclass of prefixed backend.\n\nAdds BDD coverage for inboxIntegrationApi.getConversationsForLead() and\ngetMessages() asserting the /v1/inbox-prefixed URL and tenant header.","tree":{"sha":"6da034706577e58ac2cdd18c7cd91481229fe6b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/6da034706577e58ac2cdd18c7cd91481229fe6b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/91abff5a86de083fc9245a468f586b462146abb9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/91abff5a86de083fc9245a468f586b462146abb9","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDkxYWJmZjVhODZkZTA4M2ZjOTI0NWE0NjhmNTg2YjQ2MjE0NmFiYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/de04b48566f7962eb90b23e08f3bf76f53835c7b","sha":"de04b48566f7962eb90b23e08f3bf76f53835c7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/de04b48566f7962eb90b23e08f3bf76f53835c7b"}],"sha":"91abff5a86de083fc9245a468f586b462146abb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/91abff5a86de083fc9245a468f586b462146abb9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/de04b48566f7962eb90b23e08f3bf76f53835c7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T08:04:17Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T08:04:17Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(crm-fe): route DealDetailPage''s project-details fetch through crmService too\n\nSame root cause class as the getProjects() fix (a638433/b55a496), a\ndifferent call site: DealDetailPage.fetchProjectDetails() used a raw\nfetch(''/projects-api/projects/:id'') with NO auth/tenant/org headers at\nall. The path only resolves via a Vite dev-server-only proxy rule in\nso360-shell-fe/vite.config.ts (absent in staging/production), and even\nif it had resolved, GET /projects/:id is guarded by the same\nPermissionsGuard as the list route -- an unauthenticated request would\nhave been rejected regardless.\n\nAdded crmService.getProjectById(), routed through the projectsClient\nfixed in the previous commits (correct origin, Bearer/X-Tenant-Id/\nX-Org-Id headers already wired via setAccessToken/setTenantId/setOrgId).\nfetchProjectDetails() collapses to a single call -- getProjectById()\nalready logs its own failures and resolves null, matching the existing\ncall site''s null-on-failure contract.\n\nVerified DealDetailPage''s existing `title`/`status`/`budget_total`/\n`completion_percentage` field names against real usages elsewhere in\nso360-projects-be/src/modules/projects/projects.service.ts (not the\nschema doc, which is unreliable for this table) -- they''re correct,\nno mismatch to fix there.\n\nTest plan: 4 BDD specs in crmService.getProjectById.bdd.test.ts covering\nsuccess (incl. asserting the tenant header the old fetch never sent),\n404/non-2xx, and network failure. Per project policy, tests run via the\nMac Mini pre-push gate, not locally.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8a2cbdd0cb9f6d4ab7e737dd40e9dbfe1736fe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/f8a2cbdd0cb9f6d4ab7e737dd40e9dbfe1736fe4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/de04b48566f7962eb90b23e08f3bf76f53835c7b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/de04b48566f7962eb90b23e08f3bf76f53835c7b","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKGRlMDRiNDg1NjZmNzk2MmViOTBiMjNlMDhmM2JmNzZmNTM4MzVjN2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/b55a496cf751c7f9a18b9a272d304259f71e6e41","sha":"b55a496cf751c7f9a18b9a272d304259f71e6e41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/b55a496cf751c7f9a18b9a272d304259f71e6e41"}],"sha":"de04b48566f7962eb90b23e08f3bf76f53835c7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/de04b48566f7962eb90b23e08f3bf76f53835c7b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/b55a496cf751c7f9a18b9a272d304259f71e6e41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:29:31Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:29:31Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(crm-fe): declare VITE_SO360_PROJECTS_API for the previous commit''s projectsClient\n\nThe previous commit (a638433) added PROJECTS_API_ORIGIN reading\nimport.meta.env.VITE_SO360_PROJECTS_API, but missed two things the\nrepo''s own apiOrigin.bdd.spec.ts guard exists specifically to catch:\n\n1. vite-env.d.ts didn''t declare the key, so TypeScript had no type for\n   it (caught by \"Then it is declared in vite-env.d.ts\").\n2. .env.production didn''t set a value for it either -- every other\n   module origin in this file has a real https://api.neonbee.app/<module>\n   entry; Projects was missing entirely. Without it, even correct code\n   ships with the localhost fallback baked into the production bundle\n   (the exact failure mode this guard spec''s own docstring describes\n   happening to six other origins previously).\n\nValue confirmed against so360-projects-fe/.env.production and\nso360-shell-fe/.env.production, both already using\nhttps://api.neonbee.app/projects.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d4cdef8ae1f2ca86d39477fc0440ad589587330","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/4d4cdef8ae1f2ca86d39477fc0440ad589587330"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/b55a496cf751c7f9a18b9a272d304259f71e6e41","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/b55a496cf751c7f9a18b9a272d304259f71e6e41","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKGI1NWE0OTZjZjc1MWM3ZjlhMThiOWEyNzJkMzA0MjU5ZjcxZTZlNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/a638433c0f41f717a7d01696a86001727c849c15","sha":"a638433c0f41f717a7d01696a86001727c849c15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/a638433c0f41f717a7d01696a86001727c849c15"}],"sha":"b55a496cf751c7f9a18b9a272d304259f71e6e41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/b55a496cf751c7f9a18b9a272d304259f71e6e41"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/a638433c0f41f717a7d01696a86001727c849c15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:26:01Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:26:01Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(crm-fe): route getProjects() to the actual Projects backend, unwrap its paginated response\n\nThe New Task modal''s Project dropdown (Lead Detail -> Tasks -> New Task,\nand everywhere else TaskModal is used) always showed only \"No Project\"\nbecause crmService.getProjects() had two independent, compounding bugs:\n\n1. It called apiClient.get(''/projects-api/projects''). apiClient is bound\n   to CRM_API_ORIGIN (CRM''s own backend), so the request actually\n   resolved to `${CRM_API_ORIGIN}/projects-api/projects` -- a path that\n   doesn''t exist on the CRM backend at all (crm-be has no /projects-api\n   prefix; that prefix is a Vite dev-server-only proxy rule in\n   so360-shell-fe/vite.config.ts, and a separate runtime rewrite table in\n   the shell''s own coreApi.ts -- neither of which crmService.ts''s plain\n   `fetch`-based ApiClient goes through). The request 404''d and was\n   silently swallowed by getProjects()''s own try/catch, producing an\n   empty list with no visible error.\n2. Even with the right origin, GET /projects on the Projects backend\n   returns `{ data, pagination }`, not a flat array (projects.service.ts\n   findAll()). The old code did `return projects || []` with no\n   unwrapping, so a correctly-routed request would still have handed\n   TaskModal a non-array object instead of a project list.\n\nEvery other cross-module call in this file (coreClient, dailystoreClient,\ninventoryClient, fulfillmentClient, accountingClient, neuraClient,\ninboxClient) already has its own dedicated ApiClient bound to that\nmodule''s real origin via a VITE_SO360_<MODULE>_API env var, injected by\nthe shell at runtime (confirmed already present in shell-fe''s runtime\nenv-var allowlist). Projects was simply never added to this system.\nFixed by adding PROJECTS_API_ORIGIN + projectsClient following the exact\nsame pattern, wiring it into setTenantId/setOrgId/setAccessToken (it was\nmissing from all three), and pointing getProjects() at it with defensive\n{ data } unwrapping.\n\nNote: DealDetailPage.tsx has a separate, unrelated `fetch(''/projects-api/\nprojects/:id'')` call for single-project lookup that relies on the same\ndev-only proxy rule and is very likely broken in staging/production too\n-- left untouched as out of scope for this specific dropdown bug, but\nflagged for a follow-up.\n\nTest plan: 5 BDD specs in crmService.getProjects.bdd.test.ts covering\nthe paginated-response unwrap, a flat-array response, an unexpected\nshape, an HTTP failure, and a network-level rejection -- including an\nexplicit assertion that the request URL never contains \"/projects-api\"\n(the exact regression). Per project policy, tests run via the Mac Mini\npre-push gate, not locally.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"70994f052e9636a9aeb6d7f029771a51456d5356","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/70994f052e9636a9aeb6d7f029771a51456d5356"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/a638433c0f41f717a7d01696a86001727c849c15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/a638433c0f41f717a7d01696a86001727c849c15","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKGE2Mzg0MzNjMGY0MWY3MTdhN2QwMTY5NmE4NjAwMTcyN2M4NDljMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/f890647d15ebda5000d7c63e8be34e64e6dda507","sha":"f890647d15ebda5000d7c63e8be34e64e6dda507","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/f890647d15ebda5000d7c63e8be34e64e6dda507"}],"sha":"a638433c0f41f717a7d01696a86001727c849c15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/a638433c0f41f717a7d01696a86001727c849c15"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/f890647d15ebda5000d7c63e8be34e64e6dda507/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T17:51:47Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T17:51:47Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(crm-fe): add optional Project connection to CRM tasks (create, status, disconnect, retry)\n\nBuilds the FE half of CRM Task <-> Project Task sync against the new\nso360-crm-be contract (POST /tasks/:id/connect-project, /disconnect-project,\n/retry-sync), implemented in parallel by a backend agent.\n\n- types/crm.ts: Task gains optional project_id, project_task_id, sync_status\n  (''connected''|''syncing''|''sync_failed''|''disconnected''|null), last_synced_at.\n  All optional/absent-safe — no consumer breaks if the backend migration\n  hasn''t landed yet.\n- crmService.ts: connectTaskToProject, disconnectTaskFromProject,\n  retryTaskProjectSync. connectTaskToProject also treats a 2xx body shaped\n  like { connected: false, reason } as a failure, since the backend''s exact\n  failure shape wasn''t finalized. Reused the existing crmService.getProjects()\n  (GET /projects-api/projects, already used by DealDetailPage) for the\n  Project picker — no new cross-module endpoint needed.\n- TaskModal.tsx: optional Project dropdown, auto-selected from a new\n  dealProjectId prop (threaded from DealDetailPage''s already-loaded\n  deal.project_id) or from task.project_id when editing; user can still\n  change/clear it. On submit, connecting the project is best-effort — a\n  connect failure never blocks/rolls back the already-saved task, just shows\n  a non-blocking toast.warning.\n- DealDetailPage.tsx: passes dealProjectId={deal?.project_id} into TaskModal\n  (small, targeted prop-threading — no larger structural change needed).\n- TaskDetailPage.tsx: shows a compact sync-status block only when\n  task.sync_status is set (undefined/null = fully unaffected). ''connected''\n  shows a CrossLinkChip to the project + last_synced_at + a Disconnect\n  action; ''sync_failed'' shows a Retry Sync button; ''disconnected'' shows a\n  subtle one-line note, no persistent indicator. Disconnect opens an inline\n  confirm (matches this page''s existing note/delete confirm pattern) letting\n  the user pick ''keep_but_disconnect'' vs ''remove_project_task''.\n- test/__mocks__/lucide-react.tsx: added the missing `Unlink` icon stub\n  (existing convention requires every icon used to be enumerated here).\n\nTests: 174 passed (TaskModal.bdd, TaskDetailPage.bdd, TaskModal.test,\nTaskDetailPage.test, DealDetailPage.test). Coverage on touched files:\nTaskModal.tsx 100% lines / 92.5% branches / 95.2% functions; TaskDetailPage.tsx\n95.1% lines / 79.7% branches (remaining gaps are pre-existing, unrelated\nlines). `npm run lint` clean. `tsc -b` (build''s typecheck step) clean;\n`npm run build`''s vite step fails only on a pre-existing, unrelated unresolved\ngit merge conflict in so360-shell-fe/packages/shell-context/src/hooks/usePeople.ts\n(a different repo, untouched by this change) — not caused by this task.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RiF4mfQT5jgDybLWZ85BTg","tree":{"sha":"a01d2c59473edc7134cbe2019eaa72edb0b8d031","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/a01d2c59473edc7134cbe2019eaa72edb0b8d031"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/f890647d15ebda5000d7c63e8be34e64e6dda507","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/f890647d15ebda5000d7c63e8be34e64e6dda507","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKGY4OTA2NDdkMTVlYmRhNTAwMGQ3YzYzZThiZTM0ZTY0ZTZkZGE1MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/cdea8ceeef8f8b0923bfe254cf92d096a957de4f","sha":"cdea8ceeef8f8b0923bfe254cf92d096a957de4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/cdea8ceeef8f8b0923bfe254cf92d096a957de4f"}],"sha":"f890647d15ebda5000d7c63e8be34e64e6dda507","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/f890647d15ebda5000d7c63e8be34e64e6dda507"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/cdea8ceeef8f8b0923bfe254cf92d096a957de4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T15:40:22Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T15:40:22Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(crm-fe): scope amber/warning styling to accents instead of whole Quote approval panel\n\nThe \"Approval in Progress\" panel on QuoteDetailPage applied text-amber-200\nto the whole container div, cascading amber text onto the heading, body\nparagraph, sub-notes, divider label, and approver names. This was unreadable\nin light theme and inconsistent with the app''s scoped-warning convention\n(see design-system Alert.tsx: amber is scoped to icon/title/action only).\n\nChanges in QuoteDetailPage.tsx approval panel:\n- Container: bg-amber-500/10 border-amber-500/30 kept, text-amber-200 removed\n  so text no longer cascades amber to children.\n- Heading \"Approval in Progress\": text-amber-100 -> text-slate-100 (matches\n  this page''s other h2/label heading convention).\n- Body paragraph: text-amber-200/90 -> text-slate-400 (matches page''s\n  standard secondary text convention).\n- \"Required Approvers:\" label: text-amber-300/80 -> text-slate-400.\n- Approver name span: added text-slate-200 override so the name stays\n  neutral regardless of the surrounding chip''s semantic (pending/approved/\n  rejected) color.\n- Icon (text-amber-400) and the compact \"Locked\" badge (amber-tinted pill)\n  kept unchanged — these are correctly scoped small accent uses.\n- QuotesPage.tsx and QuoteApprovalHistory.tsx status badges were audited\n  but left unchanged: they are already small, correctly-scoped pill/badge\n  elements, not panel-level bleed.\n\nTests: added src/pages/QuoteDetailPage.approvalPanelStyling.bdd.test.tsx\n(10 BDD specs, reusing the existing QuoteApprovalWorkflow.bdd.test.tsx mock\nsetup) asserting the panel container carries no direct text-amber-* class,\nheading/body/label use the neutral classes, the icon/Locked badge/approver\nstatus chips retain their scoped accents, and approver names stay neutral\nacross pending/approved/rejected chip colors.\n\nTest results: 10/10 new specs pass; full QuoteApprovalWorkflow.bdd.test.tsx\n(19 tests) still passes. Coverage on the touched panel lines (605-660) in\nQuoteDetailPage.tsx is 100% (0 uncovered); whole-file coverage remains below\nthe repo''s 70% global threshold because this large pre-existing page has\nmany untested branches unrelated to this change (acceptable per task scope\nper CLAUDE.md testing guidance for large legacy files). tsc -b and npm run\nbuild both pass with no errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f27b4307095663369c0205d4fa3a77e9f5db1146","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/f27b4307095663369c0205d4fa3a77e9f5db1146"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/cdea8ceeef8f8b0923bfe254cf92d096a957de4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"htt