Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/48eb6c74669c4103108c5cacaa6e4b13527ee7e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:30:24Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:30:24Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"chore(crm-fe): delete the three retired Sales Target Engine pages\n\nTheir routes became redirects in 9032aea; the files themselves were left\nbehind and referenced by nothing. Removing them so the retirement is\ncomplete rather than half-done — a page nobody can reach is a page that\nstill gets read, updated and reasoned about.\n\nAdminTaskTypesPage stays: it owns the activity types Target Plans and\nTarget Templates read.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BEj2A2FJuYMMwmuYpGu1ce","tree":{"sha":"1dbe8fd31af1b8a762c5783d31af783d1fcac0b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/1dbe8fd31af1b8a762c5783d31af783d1fcac0b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/48eb6c74669c4103108c5cacaa6e4b13527ee7e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/48eb6c74669c4103108c5cacaa6e4b13527ee7e4","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDQ4ZWI2Yzc0NjY5YzQxMDMxMDhjNWNhY2FhNmU0YjEzNTI3ZWU3ZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/435f7ed29d84e5b0502c4b55687a2683d05e1e77","sha":"435f7ed29d84e5b0502c4b55687a2683d05e1e77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/435f7ed29d84e5b0502c4b55687a2683d05e1e77"}],"sha":"48eb6c74669c4103108c5cacaa6e4b13527ee7e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/48eb6c74669c4103108c5cacaa6e4b13527ee7e4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/435f7ed29d84e5b0502c4b55687a2683d05e1e77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:37:25Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:37:25Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(quota): surface 402 quota-exceeded responses to the Shell upgrade modal\n\nWire the shared quota-exceeded contract from @so360/shell-context into the\nCRM API clients. This MFE uses fetch (no axios), so notifyQuotaExceeded()\nis the fetch-side equivalent of installQuotaExceededInterceptor(): every 402\nfrom the ApiClient request/getText/download/upload helpers, the inventory\nstock-availability lookup, salesTargetService.fetch and\ntargetPlanService.fetch dispatches __so360_quota_exceeded\n(detail = resolution ?? body) and the call still fails/degrades as before.\n\n- src/services/quotaExceeded.ts: fetch-side 402 -> event helper\n- crmService.ts (5 fetch sites), salesTargetService.ts, targetPlanService.ts:\n  one-line hook after each fetch\n- src/types/stubs/shell-context (tsconfig fallback) and the vitest\n  __mocks__/shell-context stub now mirror QUOTA_EXCEEDED_EVENT and\n  buildQuotaExceededDetail\n- BDD spec: 402 with/without resolution dispatches, 500 does not\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R6bNiMB1b9vsa4n8JBY5Lk","tree":{"sha":"b22692e1d70b786c85a0052e1085d2c1946c3146","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/b22692e1d70b786c85a0052e1085d2c1946c3146"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/435f7ed29d84e5b0502c4b55687a2683d05e1e77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/435f7ed29d84e5b0502c4b55687a2683d05e1e77","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDQzNWY3ZWQyOWQ4NGU1YjA1MDJjNGI1NTY4N2EyNjgzZDA1ZTFlNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/7fe59eacfa19945a6b48604efa86fdffedf1e4e5","sha":"7fe59eacfa19945a6b48604efa86fdffedf1e4e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/7fe59eacfa19945a6b48604efa86fdffedf1e4e5"}],"sha":"435f7ed29d84e5b0502c4b55687a2683d05e1e77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/435f7ed29d84e5b0502c4b55687a2683d05e1e77"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/7fe59eacfa19945a6b48604efa86fdffedf1e4e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T09:13:59Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T09:13:59Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(crm): coupon search panel could shrink-wrap to its content\n\nThe Context & Search panel was `flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-end`\nover a single `flex-1` child. Another remote''s Tailwind sheet can flatten\n`md:flex-row` to a column (media queries add no specificity, so source order\nwins), and the unprefixed `items-end` then stops the child stretching — the\nwhole panel, coupon search included, narrows to its content.\n\nFixed by moving the alignment behind the same breakpoint as the direction\n(`md:items-end`), so the pair fails safe together: if the row is flattened the\npin is flattened with it and stretch resumes. `w-full` on the child covers it\neither way. No new CSS needed for a wrapper with one child.\n\nAdds a source-scanning guard spec that fails on any container in the repo\ncombining `flex-col` + `*:flex-row` with an unprefixed cross-axis pin over a\nwidthless `flex-1` child; verified it fails on the pre-fix markup.\n\nNote: src/pages/QuotesPage.createFromDeal.bdd.test.tsx is flaky independently\nof this change — it fails intermittently on a clean tree (confirmed across\nrepeated runs with these changes stashed). Untouched here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2302e4de16f65738b41cdd89fe714fc0a738cb10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/2302e4de16f65738b41cdd89fe714fc0a738cb10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/7fe59eacfa19945a6b48604efa86fdffedf1e4e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/7fe59eacfa19945a6b48604efa86fdffedf1e4e5","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDdmZTU5ZWFjZmExOTk0NWE2YjQ4NjA0ZWZhODZmZGZmZWRmMWU0ZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/3b325dfaeb2f7270ef461f815a0331ba7c4bcbcf","sha":"3b325dfaeb2f7270ef461f815a0331ba7c4bcbcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/3b325dfaeb2f7270ef461f815a0331ba7c4bcbcf"}],"sha":"7fe59eacfa19945a6b48604efa86fdffedf1e4e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/7fe59eacfa19945a6b48604efa86fdffedf1e4e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/3b325dfaeb2f7270ef461f815a0331ba7c4bcbcf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T07:15:08Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T07:15:08Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(crm-fe): let a quote from a deal arrive populated, and show its customer\n\nTwo halves of the same defect.\n\nQuotesPage posted { deal_id, title: ''New Quote'', lines: [] } when the seller\npicked a deal. crm-be treats a supplied title and line array as the caller''s\nown, so that payload suppressed the derivation it could have had: every quote\nwas named \"New Quote\" and opened with no customer and no items. It now sends\nthe deal alone — `lines` absent rather than empty, which is the distinction\ncrm-be keys off — and lands on the draft crm-be seeded from the deal and its\nproducts. The draft is a normal editable draft; nothing is locked.\n\nQuoteDetailPage already resolved the linked customer, but spent it only on the\nprinted document and the send-email default. Nothing on screen said who the\nquote was for, so a seller could not confirm the link was right. Adds a\nread-only Customer panel — company, contact, email, phone, tax id, each row\nomitted when the customer has no such value — linking to the customer record.\nRead-only on purpose: the record lives in Customers, and a quote references it\nrather than keeping a copy that can drift.\n\nSpecs: QuotesPage.createFromDeal.bdd.test.tsx pins the create payload down to\nthe absence of the `lines` key, and QuoteDetailPage.customerPanel.bdd.test.tsx\ncovers the panel, its omitted rows, and a quote with no customer at all.","tree":{"sha":"0f8c62baefb36416606ab43346ea494b9e278b86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/0f8c62baefb36416606ab43346ea494b9e278b86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/3b325dfaeb2f7270ef461f815a0331ba7c4bcbcf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/3b325dfaeb2f7270ef461f815a0331ba7c4bcbcf","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDNiMzI1ZGZhZWIyZjcyNzBlZjQ2MWY4MTVhMDMzMWJhN2M0YmNiY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/9032aeacc2f1635bfb21429dc3e6056e1341be88","sha":"9032aeacc2f1635bfb21429dc3e6056e1341be88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/9032aeacc2f1635bfb21429dc3e6056e1341be88"}],"sha":"3b325dfaeb2f7270ef461f815a0331ba7c4bcbcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/3b325dfaeb2f7270ef461f815a0331ba7c4bcbcf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/9032aeacc2f1635bfb21429dc3e6056e1341be88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T07:02:37Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T07:02:37Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(crm-fe): redirect the retired sales-targets URLs instead of dead-ending\n\nRetiring the three pages in 6fb3d79 deleted their routes outright. This\nrouter registers no `path=\"*\"`, so an unmatched path renders NOTHING —\nnot a 404, just an empty content area. Any stale bookmark to a retired\npage became a silent dead end.\n\nPoints each at the screen that replaced it:\n\n  sales-targets/targets     -> /crm/targets/plans\n  sales-targets/scorecard   -> /crm/targets/mine\n  sales-targets/leaderboard -> /crm/targets   (no direct equivalent)\n\nAbsolute paths, matching the existing `Navigate to=\"/crm/dashboard\"` in\nthis file: the MFE mounts into the shell''s router with no basename.\n\nThe BDD spec now asserts the redirect target rather than the route''s\nabsence, and pins the missing catch-all as the reason these redirects\nare load-bearing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BEj2A2FJuYMMwmuYpGu1ce","tree":{"sha":"037ce27458a7a5b55a09204b425e23ccaec5cfbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/037ce27458a7a5b55a09204b425e23ccaec5cfbc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/9032aeacc2f1635bfb21429dc3e6056e1341be88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/9032aeacc2f1635bfb21429dc3e6056e1341be88","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDkwMzJhZWFjYzJmMTYzNWJmYjIxNDI5ZGMzZTYwNTZlMTM0MWJlODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/6fb3d79d99cdd2a3221cc1c992025ce8635b3c16","sha":"6fb3d79d99cdd2a3221cc1c992025ce8635b3c16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/6fb3d79d99cdd2a3221cc1c992025ce8635b3c16"}],"sha":"9032aeacc2f1635bfb21429dc3e6056e1341be88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/9032aeacc2f1635bfb21429dc3e6056e1341be88"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/6fb3d79d99cdd2a3221cc1c992025ce8635b3c16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T05:13:36Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T05:13:36Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"refactor(crm-fe): retire three superseded Sales Target Engine pages\n\nThe original Sales Target Engine shipped on 2026-06-30 with routes and\nguards but no nav entry anywhere. `git log -S` on the shell''s\nmoduleNavConfig shows the entries were never removed — they were never\nwritten, so these pages were reachable only by typing the URL. Tenant\ndata agrees nobody did: 11 activity types and 1 target seeded, and ZERO\nrows in the activity log the scorecard and leaderboard both read.\n\nRetires the three that Targets & Performance supersedes:\n\n  sales-targets/targets     -> targets/plans\n  sales-targets/scorecard   -> targets/mine\n  sales-targets/leaderboard -> (read an activity log with no rows)\n\nKeeps sales-targets/task-types. It looked equally legacy, but Target\nPlans and Target Templates both call listTaskTypes() and this is the\nonly UI that can create or edit those rows — retiring it would have left\nthe metrics every plan is built from permanently read-only, while Target\nPlans'' own empty state tells the user to \"add a task type first\". The\nmatching nav entry lands in so360-shell-fe.\n\nThe three page files are left in the tree, unreferenced, for a separate\ndeletion pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BEj2A2FJuYMMwmuYpGu1ce","tree":{"sha":"9f4d939b7ffccb51d226d2037bc30b89bee685c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/9f4d939b7ffccb51d226d2037bc30b89bee685c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/6fb3d79d99cdd2a3221cc1c992025ce8635b3c16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/6fb3d79d99cdd2a3221cc1c992025ce8635b3c16","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDZmYjNkNzlkOTljZGQyYTMyMjFjYzFjOTkyMDI1Y2U4NjM1YjNjMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/ab51934a715bfe578b763120cfd4cf652361fc09","sha":"ab51934a715bfe578b763120cfd4cf652361fc09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/ab51934a715bfe578b763120cfd4cf652361fc09"}],"sha":"6fb3d79d99cdd2a3221cc1c992025ce8635b3c16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/6fb3d79d99cdd2a3221cc1c992025ce8635b3c16"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/ab51934a715bfe578b763120cfd4cf652361fc09/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:03:57Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:03:57Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(crm-fe): reachable retry for reviews that never reached People Connect\n\nThe page already told users to \"retry from the sync action\" after a failed\npush, but no such action existed — the backend''s retry-sync route was never\nwired to the client. Finalizing is one-way, so every review caught by the /v1\n404 was stranded: finalized, unusable as appraisal evidence, with no recovery\npath in the UI.\n\nA banner now appears whenever any finalized review has no pc_synced_at, with a\nretry that reports how many succeeded and how many are still failing rather\nthan claiming success blindly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BEj2A2FJuYMMwmuYpGu1ce","tree":{"sha":"1e15520411d4e706e3dcf00ae370177acfe5f061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/1e15520411d4e706e3dcf00ae370177acfe5f061"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/ab51934a715bfe578b763120cfd4cf652361fc09","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/ab51934a715bfe578b763120cfd4cf652361fc09","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKGFiNTE5MzRhNzE1YmZlNTc4Yjc2MzEyMGNmZDRjZjY1MjM2MWZjMDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/26d5e82d2ecddd022d823db9a2f4cb3474f8a9a0","sha":"26d5e82d2ecddd022d823db9a2f4cb3474f8a9a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/26d5e82d2ecddd022d823db9a2f4cb3474f8a9a0"}],"sha":"ab51934a715bfe578b763120cfd4cf652361fc09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/ab51934a715bfe578b763120cfd4cf652361fc09"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/26d5e82d2ecddd022d823db9a2f4cb3474f8a9a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T19:16:01Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T19:16:01Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(crm-fe): the edit and allocate panels read a plan shape that does not exist\n\nBoth panels shipped reading fields the API never returns.\n\nGET /target-plans/:id returns `lines[]`, each line carrying its own\n`periods[]`, with the metric under a nested `task_type` relation. The editor\nread `plan.periods` — undefined — so the entire \"Period targets\" section\nnever rendered; the panel looked complete and silently did nothing. The\nallocate panel read `line.metric_name` and `line.unit`, so its metric dropdown\ncaptioned every option with a raw UUID and money formatted as a plain number.\n\nNothing threw and nothing logged in either case, which is exactly why both got\nthrough review and a deployed-bundle check.\n\nThe shape is now read through planShape.ts and asserted against a fixture of\nthe real response, so it is verified once rather than assumed per component.\nPeriod buckets are labelled with their metric — a plan can have several lines,\nand two unlabelled buckets for the same month are indistinguishable — and\nsorted by metric then sequence, because insertion order is not calendar order.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BEj2A2FJuYMMwmuYpGu1ce","tree":{"sha":"72bea826937a1306b0fb760691841399d47c3a9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/72bea826937a1306b0fb760691841399d47c3a9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/26d5e82d2ecddd022d823db9a2f4cb3474f8a9a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/26d5e82d2ecddd022d823db9a2f4cb3474f8a9a0","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDI2ZDVlODJkMmVjZGRkMDIyZDgyM2RiOWEyZjRjYjM0NzRmOGE5YTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/58d48ae1cedbe004e15cc9a94a4ae5211e018a4e","sha":"58d48ae1cedbe004e15cc9a94a4ae5211e018a4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/58d48ae1cedbe004e15cc9a94a4ae5211e018a4e"}],"sha":"26d5e82d2ecddd022d823db9a2f4cb3474f8a9a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/26d5e82d2ecddd022d823db9a2f4cb3474f8a9a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/58d48ae1cedbe004e15cc9a94a4ae5211e018a4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T17:50:23Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T17:55:44Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(crm-fe): period selection, plan editing, and a real duplicate-channel message\n\nPeriod selection: My Targets, Team Targets and Measurement were pinned to\ntoday, so a past month was unreachable even though its numbers were stored.\nEach now has a period picker. `as_of` is omitted entirely when no period is\nchosen, leaving today to the backend rather than the browser''s clock, and the\nteam scorecard joins it with & because person_ids is always present — a second\n? would drop the date and show today while claiming otherwise. A past period\nis banner-labelled, or last quarter''s shortfall reads as this quarter''s. The\npicker renders in the loading, error and empty branches too: without that,\nchoosing a period with no data removed the only control for leaving it.\n\nPlan editing: name, role, priority, status, notes and per-period targets, with\na change reason, since the backend records a revision per changed field and a\nre-baselined target with no stated reason is indistinguishable from a mistake.\nDates stay fixed — the window defines the period buckets that history is\nalready attributed to, so moving it would strand stored numbers against a\nwindow that no longer exists.\n\nTouchpoint channels: the table has UNIQUE (org_id, value) and provisioning\nseeds system channels, so the likeliest add failure is a key that already\nexists — possibly on an inactive channel. The page now names the clash instead\nof surfacing a Postgres duplicate-key string.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BEj2A2FJuYMMwmuYpGu1ce","tree":{"sha":"ebdb9d9b9df89c691e93a2f6e8cfb5a264d92ff1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/ebdb9d9b9df89c691e93a2f6e8cfb5a264d92ff1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/58d48ae1cedbe004e15cc9a94a4ae5211e018a4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/58d48ae1cedbe004e15cc9a94a4ae5211e018a4e","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDU4ZDQ4YWUxY2VkYmUwMDRlMTVjYzlhOTRhNGFlNTIxMWUwMThhNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/32f61aed55d69d26ad331d919bc7954161c7e13d","sha":"32f61aed55d69d26ad331d919bc7954161c7e13d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/32f61aed55d69d26ad331d919bc7954161c7e13d"}],"sha":"58d48ae1cedbe004e15cc9a94a4ae5211e018a4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/58d48ae1cedbe004e15cc9a94a4ae5211e018a4e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/32f61aed55d69d26ad331d919bc7954161c7e13d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T17:22:40Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T17:22:40Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"test(crm-fe): guard where the Targets screens get their currency\n\nThe base_currency fix shipped without a test, which is how the original defect\nsurvived: reading a key that does not exist fails silently, so every revenue\nfigure rendered as USD with no error and no empty state — a wrong symbol in\nfront of a correct number.\n\nSource-level, because a runtime test would assert against a fixture that could\ncarry the wrong shape too. Also pins formatValue''s edges: an unknown currency\ncode degrades to a plain number rather than throwing, and an absent value\nrenders a dash rather than zero — \"no data\" and \"zero\" are different answers\nto how someone is doing against target.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BEj2A2FJuYMMwmuYpGu1ce","tree":{"sha":"60e7889e53da295a3d931402f5eb25fe07ce93b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/60e7889e53da295a3d931402f5eb25fe07ce93b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/32f61aed55d69d26ad331d919bc7954161c7e13d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/32f61aed55d69d26ad331d919bc7954161c7e13d","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDMyZjYxYWVkNTVkNjlkMjZhZDMzMWQ5MTliYzc5NTQxNjFjN2UxM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/5fc628f2187925d2bc1445f229217e85934e6f23","sha":"5fc628f2187925d2bc1445f229217e85934e6f23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/5fc628f2187925d2bc1445f229217e85934e6f23"}],"sha":"32f61aed55d69d26ad331d919bc7954161c7e13d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/32f61aed55d69d26ad331d919bc7954161c7e13d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/5fc628f2187925d2bc1445f229217e85934e6f23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T17:03:57Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T17:03:57Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(crm-fe): read base_currency, and stop reporting -0 remainders\n\nEvery money figure on the Targets screens formatted as USD regardless of the\norg''s setting. The pages read `businessSettings.currency`, but Core returns\n`base_currency` — the key simply did not exist, so `undefined` reached\nformatValue and hit its USD fallback. Six pages corrected.\n\nAllocation rounding also produced -0 for an exactly-met team target, which\nfails an equality check against 0 and renders as \"-0\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BEj2A2FJuYMMwmuYpGu1ce","tree":{"sha":"c5cda6101836f8a1cf20a87d32f352fcc20571bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/c5cda6101836f8a1cf20a87d32f352fcc20571bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/5fc628f2187925d2bc1445f229217e85934e6f23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/5fc628f2187925d2bc1445f229217e85934e6f23","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDVmYzYyOGYyMTg3OTI1ZDJiYzE0NDVmMjI5MjE3ZTg1OTM0ZTZmMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/72ee41cded87f0c4d11cfcac5b7a6b7eaf65b5a2","sha":"72ee41cded87f0c4d11cfcac5b7a6b7eaf65b5a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/72ee41cded87f0c4d11cfcac5b7a6b7eaf65b5a2"}],"sha":"5fc628f2187925d2bc1445f229217e85934e6f23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/5fc628f2187925d2bc1445f229217e85934e6f23"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/72ee41cded87f0c4d11cfcac5b7a6b7eaf65b5a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T16:56:47Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T16:56:47Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(crm-fe): allocate a team plan across its members\n\nA team or organisation plan had a person picker for its owner, which is\nmeaningless, and there was no way to reach POST /target-plans/:id/allocate at\nall — so a team plan could be created but never turned into anyone''s target.\n\n- The owner picker now appears only for an individual plan. Team and org plans\n  say what they cover instead, and a stale owner_id is no longer sent when the\n  type is switched, which would have attached the team''s plan to one person.\n- Team plans get an Allocate action: choose the metric, add people, give each\n  a target. Each row becomes that person''s own child plan, which is why the\n  team target, running total and remainder are shown while typing.\n- Over-allocation is displayed, never blocked. Teams commit above target\n  deliberately and forcing a match would push a dishonest number into the plan.\n\nValidation lives in allocation.ts because a bad row is not a form error, it is\na wrong number somebody is measured against: every row needs a person and a\ntarget above zero, and one person cannot appear twice — two child plans for\none person means the overview shows whichever the query returns first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BEj2A2FJuYMMwmuYpGu1ce","tree":{"sha":"4969e20a421fbd6d98e84347d63ee3bf27b04f5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/4969e20a421fbd6d98e84347d63ee3bf27b04f5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/72ee41cded87f0c4d11cfcac5b7a6b7eaf65b5a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/72ee41cded87f0c4d11cfcac5b7a6b7eaf65b5a2","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDcyZWU0MWNkZWQ4N2YwYzRkMTFjZmNhYzViN2E2YjdlYWY2NWI1YTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/73e19624a6e8ce9ac0b55f2c1fbf41f57d88ac8f","sha":"73e19624a6e8ce9ac0b55f2c1fbf41f57d88ac8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/73e19624a6e8ce9ac0b55f2c1fbf41f57d88ac8f"}],"sha":"72ee41cded87f0c4d11cfcac5b7a6b7eaf65b5a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/72ee41cded87f0c4d11cfcac5b7a6b7eaf65b5a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/73e19624a6e8ce9ac0b55f2c1fbf41f57d88ac8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T13:03:34Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T13:03:34Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(crm-fe): make Targets & Performance usable end to end\n\nThree gaps meant the module could be looked at but not operated.\n\nProvisioning: an org starts with no metrics, so no plan can be built and every\nscreen is empty with nothing on the page explaining why. The Plans page now\noffers the industry starter pack when no metrics exist. The call is idempotent\n— existing metrics match by name and are skipped.\n\nReviews: createReview had no UI at all. Reviews are now opened from the page,\nchoosing a person and a month or quarter. The period is derived, never typed:\na hand-entered range produces a review covering a period no plan matches, and\nthe pre-filled numbers then look wrong for invisible reasons. Bounds are\ncomputed in UTC so they do not shift a day west of UTC.\n\nIncentive rules: createIncentiveRule had no UI either. Assembly is validated\nin a separate module because crm_incentive_rules accepts a loose object — a\nmalformed rule inserts happily and then never fires, so a manager configures a\nbonus, sees it listed, and it silently never pays. Enforced at entry: the\nthreshold is stored as a fraction (90 → 0.9, or the bonus needs 9,000%\nattainment); only the highest band may be open-ended; bands may not overlap;\na rule scoped to a person or role must name one, or it widens to everyone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BEj2A2FJuYMMwmuYpGu1ce","tree":{"sha":"d0fb3d7e567a83ed62f8b22bac7ad9014b2e7e2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/d0fb3d7e567a83ed62f8b22bac7ad9014b2e7e2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/73e19624a6e8ce9ac0b55f2c1fbf41f57d88ac8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/73e19624a6e8ce9ac0b55f2c1fbf41f57d88ac8f","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKDczZTE5NjI0YTZlOGNlOWFjMGI1NWYyYzFmYmY0MWY1N2Q4OGFjOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/b601a94eea67ab0ce07c13b6a8c1169ed35abaac","sha":"b601a94eea67ab0ce07c13b6a8c1169ed35abaac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/b601a94eea67ab0ce07c13b6a8c1169ed35abaac"}],"sha":"73e19624a6e8ce9ac0b55f2c1fbf41f57d88ac8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/73e19624a6e8ce9ac0b55f2c1fbf41f57d88ac8f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/b601a94eea67ab0ce07c13b6a8c1169ed35abaac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T12:32:30Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T12:38:05Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(crm-fe): search-suggest person fields on Targets & Performance\n\nEvery person field asked for a raw UUID and every table printed the first\neight characters of a person id. Nobody can type a colleague''s UUID, so the\nfields were unusable and the tables unreadable.\n\n- PersonPicker: search-suggest over the People Connect directory, filtered\n  client-side across name, email, employee id, job title and department. The\n  registry API indexes only the first three, so searching by role or\n  department would otherwise be a dead end.\n- PersonName: renders an id as a name, falling back to a short id rather than\n  a blank cell — someone who has left the org still has rows attached, and\n  blank cells read as a rendering fault.\n- The directory is fetched once per page load via a shared promise, through\n  crm-be''s broker route; People Connect''s public /people needs permissions a\n  CRM user does not hold. A rejection is deliberately not cached, or one\n  transient 503 would leave every picker on the page dead until reload.\n\nCall sites: plan owner, template assignment, incentive calculation, incentive\nrule scope, team roll-up, review list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BEj2A2FJuYMMwmuYpGu1ce","tree":{"sha":"6582c5800fe0dd9a76dd9be4fc08ddd590205508","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/trees/6582c5800fe0dd9a76dd9be4fc08ddd590205508"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/git/commits/b601a94eea67ab0ce07c13b6a8c1169ed35abaac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/b601a94eea67ab0ce07c13b6a8c1169ed35abaac","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DTNoAKGI2MDFhOTRlZWE2N2FiMGNlMDdjMTNiNmE4YzExNjllZDM1YWJhYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commit/9c0d6c288b2dea55fca77eb8ea81797360e8dfee","sha":"9c0d6c288b2dea55fca77eb8ea81797360e8dfee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/9c0d6c288b2dea55fca77eb8ea81797360e8dfee"}],"sha":"b601a94eea67ab0ce07c13b6a8c1169ed35abaac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits/b601a94eea67ab0ce07c13b6a8c1169ed35abaac"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-crm-fe/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=c5cf84a66aa38fbed1842d39616dacef2e3521b1&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A17%3A41.289Z"}');
