oonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/7bad650eb04cf20b584bd9bb2cb3221150de5d08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:25:41Z","email":"165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com","name":"praveen-vr-moonhive"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:25:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(bulk-import): multiple images per product (Pulse 4a0c9531) (#43)\n\n* feat(bulk-import): multiple images per product (Name.jpg, Name_2.jpg, Name_3.jpg)\n\n- parseImageName/planImages: `_N`/`-N` suffix = gallery position; exact product\n  name wins over suffix reading; ordered mapping per product\n- unsafe cases never guessed: duplicate position, numbered images without a\n  primary, ambiguous product names; gaps map in order with a warning\n- Step 2 \"How to Upload Product Images\" guide + Primary/Image N labels\n- Step 3 shows \"Primary + N more\"; commit payload carries all URLs in order\n- BDD tests for parsing, planning, page mapping, step UI\n\nNo backend/DB change: items.image_urls already stores an ordered array.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(bulk-import): remove unreachable branches, cover multi-gap warning\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(bulk-import): fix out-of-scope helper in multi-image preview test\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(bulk-import): tolerate filename also appearing in the naming guide\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f21316032632aadbd1bd89acea8ef564fc7dc85d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/f21316032632aadbd1bd89acea8ef564fc7dc85d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/7bad650eb04cf20b584bd9bb2cb3221150de5d08","verification":{"payload":"tree f21316032632aadbd1bd89acea8ef564fc7dc85d\nparent da7f43566e58aae04c15489b4ca7394c3b752f11\nauthor praveen-vr-moonhive <165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com> 1790868341 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790868341 +0400\n\nfeat(bulk-import): multiple images per product (Pulse 4a0c9531) (#43)\n\n* feat(bulk-import): multiple images per product (Name.jpg, Name_2.jpg, Name_3.jpg)\n\n- parseImageName/planImages: `_N`/`-N` suffix = gallery position; exact product\n  name wins over suffix reading; ordered mapping per product\n- unsafe cases never guessed: duplicate position, numbered images without a\n  primary, ambiguous product names; gaps map in order with a warning\n- Step 2 \"How to Upload Product Images\" guide + Primary/Image N labels\n- Step 3 shows \"Primary + N more\"; commit payload carries all URLs in order\n- BDD tests for parsing, planning, page mapping, step UI\n\nNo backend/DB change: items.image_urls already stores an ordered array.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(bulk-import): remove unreachable branches, cover multi-gap warning\n\nCo-Authored-B