ee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/da7f43566e58aae04c15489b4ca7394c3b752f11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:29:46Z","email":"anusree.k.p@creatives.moonhive.in","name":"anusreekpcreatives"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:29:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(bulk-import): drop SKU column and map images by product name (#41)\n\n* feat(bulk-import): drop SKU column and map images by product name\n\nTemplate and help text no longer ask for a SKU. Images match on the product\nname (case/space/extension insensitive); ambiguous product names, duplicate\nimages and missing images are flagged in the image step and the preview, and\nthe result step shows each generated SKU.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(bulk-import): flag a product with no uploaded image as not found\n\nA row with no image under its name was marked mapped with an undefined URL.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(bulk-import): explain why images cannot match when no CSV row is importable\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"79099a9a6f0b20ba7f367be5109e84790017df06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/79099a9a6f0b20ba7f367be5109e84790017df06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/da7f43566e58aae04c15489b4ca7394c3b752f11","verification":{"payload":"tree 79099a9a6f0b20ba7f367be5109e84790017df06\nparent 71a1565c8dd28e2e3e2f187fe9bee055e7b91465\nauthor anusreekpcreatives <anusree.k.p@creatives.moonhive.in> 1790864986 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790864986 +0400\n\nfeat(bulk-import): drop SKU column and map images by product name (#41)\n\n* feat(bulk-import): drop SKU column and map images by product name\n\nTemplate and help text no longer ask for a SKU. Images match on the product\nname (case/space/extension insensitive); ambiguous product names, duplicate\nimages and missing images are flagged in the image step and the preview, and\nthe result step shows each generated SKU.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(bulk-import): flag a product with no uploaded image as not found\n\nA row with no image under its name was marked mapped with an undefined URL.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(bulk-import): explain why images cannot match when no CSV row is importable\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvm5aCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxPMQAK48Oto2ngtXSiqmgky0Sz6T\nomUP6c76uPV4i/l+PRxjX7hn5r2wwpFH6wV+M9LSiZtvP32hyG+qW4YoAt1Wbxq/\nk2rmRlU6JtuQJq+0NyP3n0U7SMPAxelWAPXSAeC7WcCLCZ0m0nzA4GR6hmolJBF9\nqnIAAeZMn4o468rAc6SBkD4V+ud9Y2RRs8bp6vAza54xCwKEE+QFFIXFBnL2Xm69\ndR/TJqcJXUIIVkCS3OSMbaJYq3YabpXaNHyf2jZ8rLiaE4kNpTRJYrEfrORw8Luw\nt21hdTwlYy3kiXlD/lcy5ihZyKSvJ/VzYonYS9zdGbRH7UJEUBA4Yh4P1LWnFgDF\nTIE5H5Lx3TBQ2XyTGHfy1yaShiRPZwdmch1a3YrEAjWB1CuvCDnIhWjVADcckvcd\nYYK81YNNZAZQfXye2OfW+DepwkAtnAUJ9U/K8KrBl/H95qr4yIBzx3WmMN4oRsTz\nM7ZPs70hxnakDWzhpXdQytbVzAjROqcyUiXcFuHUbjzRE9FVsGsZgZBlGTWQG4WT\nFsmoheTzXveEPoDFrUVuk2C6wfArZJ9PPem5G2vt/GjXN+o5QWBaBMhshNcoJf11\nWTtVqVQAbMlFcVSECW3BQcmCi03uCMHvJKT4aLDdv72YUxkKWwcrTfPoCw2P+5vz\nhXhiR/kSFtF7SEfW4hAj\n=bnVF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T14:29:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","