riptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/b46d6e8c7b2d2c502e6355203527683785fbf5e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:40:17Z","email":"165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com","name":"praveen-vr-moonhive"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:40:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(real-estate): payment plan templates, tower/unit agent allocation, developer G1 fields (RE Phase C) (#38)\n\n* feat(real-estate): payment plan templates, tower/unit agent overrides, developer edit (RE Phase C)\n\n- Project details: structured payment-plan template editor (metadata.payment_plan_templates,\n  max 10, all-percent sums to 100, one default); legacy free-text plan stays read-only;\n  Save blocked client-side on an invalid plan\n- Tower (category metadata) and Unit (item custom_attributes) \"Assigned agents/teams\"\n  override panels behind action:crm:unit_allocation, showing what is inherited\n- DeveloperCard: edit website, logo, status and account manager via Core partner PATCH;\n  developer picker also lists property owners with a role filter chip\n- BDD unit tests for every new branch\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* test(real-estate): stub Wallet icon; percent tolerance cases match backend float check\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* feat(real-estate): user/team pickers for project, tower and unit agents\n\nReplace the raw \"Assigned user/team IDs\" comma lists with multi-select\npickers. Users come from Core directory search (core_user entries only);\nteams are People Connect departments, which is what CRM lead assignment\nresolves assigned_team_ids against. If departments cannot be listed\n(e.g. no departments.read) the team field falls back to entering IDs.\nUnknown ids render as removable truncated chips. Stored shape (id arrays,\nnull when empty), inherited hints and read-only mode are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd7973320819d54f3adaa87278368561b6576351","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/fd7973320819d54f3adaa87278368561b6576351"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/b46d6e8c7b2d2c502e6355203527683785fbf5e4","verification":{"payload":"tree fd7973320819d54f3adaa87278368561b6576351\nparent b72e92b8610fa2765f3d03b68ae4e88e6db57fe6\nauthor praveen-vr-moonhive <165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com> 1790682017 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790682017 +0400\n\nfeat(real-estate): payment plan templates, tower/unit agent allocation, developer G1 fields (RE Phase C) (#38)\n\n* feat(real-estate): payment plan templates, tower/unit agent overrides, developer edit (RE Phase C)\n\n- Project details: structured payment-plan template editor (metadata.payment_plan_templates,\n  max 10, all-percent sums to 100, one default); legacy free-text plan stays read-only;\n  Save blocked client-side on an invalid plan\n- Tower (category metadata) and Unit (item custom_attributes) \"Assigned agents/teams\"\n  override panels behind action:crm:unit_allocation, showing what is inherited\n- DeveloperCard: edit website, logo, status and account manager via Core partner PATCH;\n  developer picker also lists property owners with a role filter chip\n- BDD unit tests for every new branch\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Sessi