or category SEO fields (100% coverage of touched files)\n\nRestructure CategoriesPage.seo.test.tsx into strict Given/When/Then and\nclose branch gaps: CharCount slate/amber/rose, chevron + collapsed /c/ hint,\npreviewSlug fallbacks (typed -> saved -> slugFromName -> \"category\"),\nsnippet title/description fallbacks, placeholder fallbacks, slug aria-invalid\nand hint, the defensive slugError guard in handleSaveDetail (re-opens SEO,\nshows error, no write), unchanged/blank/pre-migration payload cases, and the\nImageUploadZone alt default.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R6bNiMB1b9vsa4n8JBY5Lk\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45cd2005d9a7d72bb2b74dfbba0470545056453e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/45cd2005d9a7d72bb2b74dfbba0470545056453e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/b72e92b8610fa2765f3d03b68ae4e88e6db57fe6","verification":{"payload":"tree 45cd2005d9a7d72bb2b74dfbba0470545056453e\nparent 572396e504ed48a5df8868b8bc5658ad5831239a\nauthor praveen-vr-moonhive <165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com> 1790678436 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790678436 +0400\n\nfeat(seo): storefront SEO / GEO / analytics program (P1–P5) + BDD coverage (#36)\n\n* P5.2 feat(categories): search engine listing in the category editor\n\n- Collapsible \"Search engine listing\" section (collapsed by default):\n  editable slug with /c/<slug> preview and kebab-case validation (blank =\n  regenerate from name; invalid blocks Save), meta title (n/70) and meta\n  description (n/160) counters, Google-style snippet preview.\n- Banner alt text field under the category banner, used as the preview alt.\n- Save sends slug / meta_title / meta_description / banner_alt only when\n  changed (blank -> null), so plain edits never touc