.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/c42834219f237c49443bf5de3a8510830b5aed48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:43:21Z","email":"165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com","name":"praveen-vr-moonhive"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:43:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(property-units): developer card, project fields, unit status override (RE plan G1-G3) (#34)\n\n- G1: DeveloperCard reads the Core partner (via inventory service) for the\n  project''s developer_partner_id: logo, status, account manager, contact,\n  and linked projects; one tap switches project.\n- G2: ProjectDetailsSection edits the RFP 4 project fields in category\n  metadata; availability summary shows totals and % sold.\n- G3: AvailabilityMatrix unit panel shows the Property Unit attributes,\n  money in unit or org currency, reservation/sale reference read-only,\n  and a manual Blocked/Cancelled/Unavailable override for managers.\n- All gated by submodule:inventory:property_units; BDD specs added.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f640021da61e119b71c0855e7afcd00a8c303254","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/f640021da61e119b71c0855e7afcd00a8c303254"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/c42834219f237c49443bf5de3a8510830b5aed48","verification":{"payload":"tree f640021da61e119b71c0855e7afcd00a8c303254\nparent 8f35d1738ca20bf298dc7ac366f8749a6da58655\nauthor praveen-vr-moonhive <165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com> 1790613801 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790613801 +0400\n\nfeat(property-units): developer card, project fields, unit status override (RE plan G1-G3) (#34)\n\n- G1: 