ts{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/c42834219f237c49443bf5de3a8510830b5aed48","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKGM0MjgzNDIxOWYyMzdjNDk0NDNiZjVkZTNhODUxMDgzMGI1YWVkNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/8f35d1738ca20bf298dc7ac366f8749a6da58655","sha":"8f35d1738ca20bf298dc7ac366f8749a6da58655","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/8f35d1738ca20bf298dc7ac366f8749a6da58655"}],"sha":"c42834219f237c49443bf5de3a8510830b5aed48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/c42834219f237c49443bf5de3a8510830b5aed48"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/8f35d1738ca20bf298dc7ac366f8749a6da58655/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:29:13Z","email":"165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com","name":"praveen-vr-moonhive"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:29:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(inventory-fe): real-estate Projects & Units (submodule:inventory:property_units) (#33)\n\n* feat(inventory-fe): real-estate Projects & Units (flag submodule:inventory:property_units)\n\nBehind shell.isFeatureEnabled(''submodule:inventory:property_units''):\n- Categories page speaks Projects/Towers via a central label map (usePropertyUnits)\n- Project details on root categories: developer (Core partners type=developer),\n  location, handover, brochure upload — saved into category metadata\n- Generate units dialog on a tower: floors x units/floor, numbering pattern,\n  SKU prefix, per-stack bedrooms/area/view/price, live preview count (cap 2000)\n- Availability matrix: tower tabs, floor x stack grid, status chips\n  (available/on hold/sold) linking to item detail, counts summary\n- inventoryService: generateUnits, getCategoryAvailability, searchDevelopers;\n  updateCategory accepts metadata\n\nFlag off: no behaviour change. BDD vitest specs for hook, utils, service,\ncomponents and page wiring.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* fix(property-units): call the inventory-be property routes and map to its contract\n\ngenerateUnits -> POST /property/:org/towers/:id/units/generate (pattern, integer stacks,\nno null optionals); availability -> GET /property/:org/projects/:id/availability with\ntower counts flattened for the matrix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* test(property-units): BDD edge-branch coverage for the property-units UI; blank grid inputs read as unset\n\n- unitGrid: toInt treats blank/whitespace as \"not entered\" (was 0), with\n  specs for padding, token-less patterns, unknown statuses, null units/stacks\n- AvailabilityMatrix: load/tower errors, loading, stale-tower race, cache,\n  zero counts, unknown status fallback, cell titles, refreshKey reload\n- GenerateUnitsDialog: 0 units/floor, example range, in-flight guard,\n  reset on reopen, generic failure, non-finite price\n- ProjectDetailsSection: loading option, unmount during fetch/upload,\n  brochure upload states and failure, disabled mode\n- inventoryService: generateUnits optional keys/null body,\n  availability flat/null towers and stacks, searchDevelopers guards\n- CategoriesPage: empty state, bare metadata, canManage/canCreate gating,\n  swallowed activity failure, selection resets availability/dialog\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac38434eae81cce1bd68eaf3a0b55563047cfe36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/ac38434eae81cce1bd68eaf3a0b55563047cfe36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/8f35d1738ca20bf298dc7ac366f8749a6da58655","verification":{"payload":"tree ac38434eae81cce1bd68eaf3a0b55563047cfe36\nparent afb1b4e3005ce275b472281545774c7c669a5b47\nauthor praveen-vr-moonhive <165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com> 1790605753 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790605753 +0400\n\nfeat(inventory-fe): real-estate Projects & Units (submodule:inventory:property_units) (#33)\n\n* feat(inventory-fe): real-estate Projects & Units (flag submodule:inventory:property_units)\n\nBehind shell.isFeatureEnabled(''submodule:inventory:property_units''):\n- Categories page speaks Projects/Towers via a central label map (usePropertyUnits)\n- Project details on root categories: developer (Core partners type=developer),\n  location, handover, brochure upload — saved into category metadata\n- Generate units dialog on a tower: floors x units/floor, numbering pattern,\n  SKU prefix, per-stack bedrooms/area/view/price, live preview count (cap 2000)\n- Availability matrix: tower tabs, floor x stack grid, status chips\n  (available/on hold/sold) linking to item detail, counts summary\n- inventoryService: generateUnits, getCategoryAvailability, searchDevelopers;\n  updateCategory accepts metadata\n\nFlag off: no behaviour change. BDD vitest specs for hook, utils, service,\ncomponents and page wiring.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* fix(property-units): call the inventory-be property routes and map to its contract\n\ngenerateUnits -> POST /property/:org/towers/:id/units/generate (pattern, integer stacks,\nno null optionals); availability -> GET /property/:org/projects/:id/availability with\ntower counts flattened for the matrix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n* test(property-units): BDD edge-branch coverage for the property-units UI; blank grid inputs read as unset\n\n- unitGrid: toInt treats blank/whitespace as \"not entered\" (was 0), with\n  specs for padding, token-less patterns, unknown statuses, null units/stacks\n- AvailabilityMatrix: load/tower errors, loading, stale-tower race, cache,\n  zero counts, unknown status fallback, cell titles, refreshKey reload\n- GenerateUnitsDialog: 0 units/floor, example range, in-flight guard,\n  reset on reopen, generic failure, non-finite price\n- ProjectDetailsSection: loading option, unmount during fetch/upload,\n  brochure upload states and failure, disabled mode\n- inventoryService: generateUnits optional keys/null body,\n  availability flat/null towers and stacks, searchDevelopers guards\n- CategoriesPage: empty state, bare metadata, canManage/canCreate gating,\n  swallowed activity failure, selection resets availability/dialog\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WgjVaoV7bzhQ769EAUW5RX\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqunm5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdR0QAAi7XBQOjNLgNTbKuF8vHvHd\nxesMGloh4WiVzKU+VpM1rRPsnIuW5fv54CljTP+Ex80z8Knzo7iySueVruCbN4dv\nTxLb8T+dZA9aomHtAaPYoFKLxOSirOAMdM2LY2t/6qxQYqjgaKfEf8OZOmrllOfP\nxu8yhdZMiKBPZQ/ki4HaNO8zQJ3KdoxWXEt75SUGUnOZTWNmIwvbAsJ7X6GN9ViH\nQTQQehZgCgYRy5b87s9EyQ0Xz/81LCCzimj5sgnEFLuxtL1Ol7HXSXDgY4RDxncF\n4sljARm04E+5XQwQWTzaKW0JAjcrj1FKvf+RerS0KbJLD9s3RycBCJshUlk+o6Yl\nBb7ksI25+8Gj0WjEQlVwnoHnCsJFhoZOlV1ckGtUvAG6ielg6Nw0o2ZJRoVEwPqG\nsgl5RkTHPt5tDyagoJuA6OJ1bHjx4biMzvqyJPZAGUSyeH+uwBlUJnOGui3sI1JJ\nqhaoc7QgSNu8wtdifKcXnjoR2TL3+unhzEI5lMM1/wHuTTM6+grmf8AqZj1m+8wx\ninp4SWpi8nUZeEqhzexqOSAoSMcxJHT15nEC4E8VJ8CGwb9x2BWij64ZqalR3BZg\newY+eSvTkt77sz3kJPLDoWuGA24j7BC+XZmtxXqZv+mSPGy65hEsBnk0omNqEa4y\nQeOwlfNSmRQTve8fmqSE\n=Lhvm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T14:29:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/g