f5e287c9ba7deb8804664b621324c79c02b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/747d4284dfec34cf118944e583a14612f4d139c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T09:07:15Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T09:07:15Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(inventory): surface project/work-order lookup failures, consume paginated register\n\nCloses the three gaps raised on d9feece0.\n\n1. searchProjects/searchWorkOrders swallowed every error in\n   `catch { return []; }`, so an unreachable Projects module was\n   indistinguishable from an org with no open projects — the user saw\n   \"No active projects available\" and had no reason to retry. The errors\n   now propagate; the caller keeps the form usable.\n\n2. Loading state — the register page shows \"Loading projects…\" /\n   \"Loading work orders…\" in the select while each lookup is in flight,\n   with the control disabled instead of looking empty.\n\n3. Error state — a failed lookup renders \"Could not load projects.\" in\n   the select plus an inline retry button, so the fetch can be repeated\n   without reloading the page.\n\nAlso consumes the backend''s new paginated movement envelope: getMovements\ntakes limit/offset and returns { data, total, limit, offset, has_more },\naccepting a bare array from older deployments so the two contracts can\nroll out independently.\n\nTests: inventoryService.spec.ts swaps the old \"returns an empty array\nrather than throwing\" case for two rejection cases and adds envelope /\nbare-array / limit-offset coverage; the register page specs add failure,\nretry and work-order-failure scenarios; all getMovements mocks now return\nthe envelope.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2136ffb6ec3acbdae22d38d670ccaaa8f68b2643","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/2136ffb6ec3acbdae22d38d670ccaaa8f68b2643"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/747d4284dfec34cf118944e583a14612f4d139c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https