ers/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/182845e9a8f9a307d3d084b57df8a682753b086e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:07:39Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:07:39Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"test(inventory-fe): still-too-large downscale case uses a real 12 MB blob\n\nThe uploader re-wraps the compressor''s Blob in a new File, whose size comes\nfrom its bytes — a faked .size on the mock was lost, so the case never hit\nthe 10 MB rejection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R6bNiMB1b9vsa4n8JBY5Lk","tree":{"sha":"11058bf88294603002f0c392f1252335339e6f77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/11058bf88294603002f0c392f1252335339e6f77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/182845e9a8f9a307d3d084b57df8a682753b086e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/rec