User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/0493b20f1e3fc0d8027b1bf31a2e501b6912f06c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:43:23Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:43:23Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(inventory-fe): separate square category image and 16:5 category banner\n\nThe category editor asked for a 3:1 1200x400 picture as image_url, yet\nstorefront category tiles render that image square. Split it:\n\n- ''Category image — square 1:1, 1600×1600'' (image_url, category tiles)\n- ''Category banner — 16:5, 2400×750'' (banner_url, top of the category\n  page), sent only when changed so plain edits never touch the new column\n\nEach slot shows a size/shape badge graded against its own target via\nassessImageForSlot() — imageRatio.ts is generalised with a slot spec\nwhile assessProductImage and its exports are unchanged. Slots accept\nWebP and up to 10 MB (Core''s new image limit).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R6bNiMB1b9vsa4n8JBY5Lk","tree":{"sha":"000441e56145ae82cfd953374509c873cf76c7a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/000441e56145ae82cfd953374509c873cf76c7a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/0493b20f1e3fc0d8027b1bf31a2e501b6912f06c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/0493b20f1e3fc0d8027b1bf31a2e501b6912f06c","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKDA0OTNiMjBmMWUzZmMwZDgwMjdiMWJmMzFhMmU1MDFiNjkxMmYwNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/075a29517a3b16d7a8bce9f7efbaf7176bc3f0e6","sha":"075a29517a3b16d7a8bce9f7efbaf7176bc3f0e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/075a29517a3b16d7a8bce9f7efbaf7176bc3f0e6"}],"sha":"0493b20f1e3fc0d8027b1bf31a2e501b6912f06c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/0493b20f1e3fc0d8027b1bf31a2e501b6912f06c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/075a29517a3b16d7a8bce9f7efbaf7176bc3f0e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:41:56Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:41:56Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(inventory-fe): save photo dimensions and filter items whose photos need attention\n\n- Item create/edit send image_meta ({url,width,height}) for the photos\n  currently on the item: new uploads report their size from the\n  uploader, previously saved photos are measured when their thumbnail\n  loads, so older items gain meta on their next save.\n- MediaTab accumulates measurements in a ref so thumbnails loading in\n  the same tick do not overwrite each other.\n- Items list: ''Photos need attention'' toggle asks the API for\n  image_needs_attention=true (not limited to the first page) and rows\n  flagged by the API show a small warning chip. While the column does not\n  exist the API ignores the filter, so the page also filters locally.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R6bNiMB1b9vsa4n8JBY5Lk","tree":{"sha":"821e086f9ff052cec550852c63a94e9e4aea1b78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/821e086f9ff052cec550852c63a94e9e4aea1b78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/075a29517a3b16d7a8bce9f7efbaf7176bc3f0e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/075a29517a3b16d7a8bce9f7efbaf7176bc3f0e6","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKDA3NWEyOTUxN2EzYjE2ZDdhOGJjZTlmN2VmYmFmNzE3NmJjM2YwZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/70a3ec92aaa8e659f9a5b1ebc3f92ea3d527ff94","sha":"70a3ec92aaa8e659f9a5b1ebc3f92ea3d527ff94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/70a3ec92aaa8e659f9a5b1ebc3f92ea3d527ff94"}],"sha":"075a29517a3b16d7a8bce9f7efbaf7176bc3f0e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/075a29517a3b16d7a8bce9f7efbaf7176bc3f0e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/70a3ec92aaa8e659f9a5b1ebc3f92ea3d527ff94/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:39:35Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:39:35Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(inventory-fe): upload product photo masters at full quality\n\nMediaUploader re-encoded every raster to <=2048px / 0.85 MB, degrading\nmasters before they ever reached the storefront. Now:\n\n- files within 10 MB and 4096 px are uploaded byte-for-byte;\n- only larger ones are downscaled to 2400 px longest side (never below)\n  at quality 0.92, keeping the format (PNG stays PNG);\n- WebP is accepted; the hint reads ''PNG, JPG, SVG, WebP — up to 10 MB\n  each, originals kept'';\n- the natural size is measured before upload and reported via\n  onImageMeasured(url, w, h); ImageThumbnail reports previously saved\n  photos through a new onMeasured callback;\n- dropping several files no longer keeps only the last url.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R6bNiMB1b9vsa4n8JBY5Lk","tree":{"sha":"c8430c4a3c86313a56198c170fec9e8461ee4d0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/c8430c4a3c86313a56198c170fec9e8461ee4d0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/70a3ec92aaa8e659f9a5b1ebc3f92ea3d527ff94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/70a3ec92aaa8e659f9a5b1ebc3f92ea3d527ff94","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKDcwYTNlYzkyYWFhOGU2NTlmOWE1YjFlYmMzZjkyZWEzZDUyN2ZmOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/90edfd01ed18eafcb9eea5557df344728ef0acd1","sha":"90edfd01ed18eafcb9eea5557df344728ef0acd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/90edfd01ed18eafcb9eea5557df344728ef0acd1"}],"sha":"70a3ec92aaa8e659f9a5b1ebc3f92ea3d527ff94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/70a3ec92aaa8e659f9a5b1ebc3f92ea3d527ff94"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/90edfd01ed18eafcb9eea5557df344728ef0acd1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T08:26:25Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T08:26:25Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(inventory-fe): show product photo size/shape and storefront guidance\n\nMerchants had no way to see an uploaded photo''s resolution or aspect\nratio, so odd-shaped and small photos went straight to the storefront.\n\n- Each thumbnail measures the loaded image and shows a W×H · ratio badge\n  (new uploads and previously saved photos). Amber ⚠ with a tooltip when\n  the shortest side is under 800px or the shape is outside ~0.7–1.4\n  (fills square/3:4 storefront frames), e.g. 9:16 phone photos.\n- Thumbnails show the whole photo (contain) so the true shape is visible.\n- Uploader shows the recommended shape/size: square 1:1, ≥1200×1200,\n  product centred on a plain background; fashion portrait 3:4.\n- BDD specs for the ratio helper, badge states and guidance.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R6bNiMB1b9vsa4n8JBY5Lk","tree":{"sha":"e1d7a9dfde0031e40ec3e1ed2fdb469c91f13318","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/e1d7a9dfde0031e40ec3e1ed2fdb469c91f13318"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/90edfd01ed18eafcb9eea5557df344728ef0acd1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/90edfd01ed18eafcb9eea5557df344728ef0acd1","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKDkwZWRmZDAxZWQxOGVhZmNiOWVlYTU1NTdkZjM0NDcyOGVmMGFjZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/0236dcd746abda3680c2b83ca6ff2482c73ed488","sha":"0236dcd746abda3680c2b83ca6ff2482c73ed488","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/0236dcd746abda3680c2b83ca6ff2482c73ed488"}],"sha":"90edfd01ed18eafcb9eea5557df344728ef0acd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/90edfd01ed18eafcb9eea5557df344728ef0acd1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/0236dcd746abda3680c2b83ca6ff2482c73ed488/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T05:29:35Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T05:29:35Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(inventory-fe): sales-channel toggles on the category editor\n\nAdds CategoryChannelsPanel to the category detail editor: one switch per\nchannel (web, mobile, Neura AI, WhatsApp, Instagram, Facebook, POS), an\n\"inherited\" badge when the value comes from an ancestor rather than the\ncategory''s own row, and an \"apply to every subcategory\" cascade.\n\nNeura is its own switch rather than riding on the web-store one — that is\nthe whole point of the feature: stock a category on the shop while keeping\nthe AI agent out of it.\n\nThe seven channel glyphs are drawn as inline SVG instead of imported from\nlucide-react. Instagram/Facebook/Globe are not used anywhere else in this\nrepo, and a newly-introduced lucide icon that resolves to undefined under\nvitest crashes the whole component and reds the pre-push gate.\n\nGated on submodule:inventory:channel_visibility.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e8435d5fa2c0a93eb711c45a451b6706259cfbe2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/e8435d5fa2c0a93eb711c45a451b6706259cfbe2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/0236dcd746abda3680c2b83ca6ff2482c73ed488","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"htt