s","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/8ff3867d764aaa6983e9b530d86254538fbff033/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T05:21:00Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T05:21:00Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"ci(dev): build this remote against the real @so360 packages\n\nThe dev build was using .ci-stubs, which no longer export what the app\nimports (CrossLinkChip, FeatureRoute, useCurrentEntity, DocumentData),\nso it failed with TS2305/TS2307/TS2614. needs_shell_packages makes dev\nclone shell-fe and build the packages, as prod already does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R6bNiMB1b9vsa4n8JBY5Lk","tree":{"sha":"a03bf75b01f99fbad7776d2f2b928a351075dd2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/a03bf75b01f99fbad7776d2f2b928a351075dd2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/8ff3867d764aaa6983e9b530d86254538fbff033","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/8ff3867d764aaa6983e9b530d86254538fbff033","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKDhmZjM4NjdkNzY0YWFhNjk4M2U5YjUzMGQ4NjI1NDUzOGZiZmYwMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/d149e95c253c02476149ca5aab94e966566d4585","sha":"d149e95c253c02476149ca5aab94e966566d4585","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/d149e95c253c02476149ca5aab94e966566d4585"}],"sha":"8ff3867d764aaa6983e9b530d86254538fbff033","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/8ff3867d764aaa6983e9b530d86254538fbff033"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/d149e95c253c02476149ca5aab94e966566d4585/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:44:06Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:44:06Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"ci(dev): restore the dev tier — isolated tree, prod-parity ports, develop trigger\n\nThe dev deploy step was gated on refs/heads/main while every caller pushes\ndevelop, so each dev deploy has been a green no-op since ~May 2026. Re-arm it:\n\n- trigger on develop/qa (+ workflow_dispatch) instead of a dead branch\n- dev/staging ports now mirror production (dev = prod - 2000), which also\n  clears three dev port collisions (sign/tools 6045, chat/partner 6046,\n  folio/connect 6048)\n\nThe reusable workflows now remap dev/staging deploys into /github/neonbee-dev,\naway from the prod-HA tree they used to share.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R6bNiMB1b9vsa4n8JBY5Lk","tree":{"sha":"c6d0b694ce3e74444ef4eb9791daab271a23e2a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/c6d0b694ce3e74444ef4eb9791daab271a23e2a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/d149e95c253c02476149ca5aab94e966566d4585","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/d149e95c253c02476149ca5aab94e966566d4585","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKGQxNDllOTVjMjUzYzAyNDc2MTQ5Y2E1YWFiOTRlOTY2NTY2ZDQ1ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/7e1b223a0ddddaf05bd94fb97447ca96d7117aa4","sha":"7e1b223a0ddddaf05bd94fb97447ca96d7117aa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/7e1b223a0ddddaf05bd94fb97447ca96d7117aa4"}],"sha":"d149e95c253c02476149ca5aab94e966566d4585","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/d149e95c253c02476149ca5aab94e966566d4585"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/7e1b223a0ddddaf05bd94fb97447ca96d7117aa4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T13:51:14Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T13:51:14Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"test(inventory): BDD coverage for the Project selector fix in Stock Input/Output\n\nPins the behaviour of the P0 fix (Pulse 62d04ceb): the Project selector opens,\nloads via searchProjects(), and is selectable in both Stock Input and Stock\nOutput; the Work Order list narrows to the selected project; changing or\nclearing the Project resets an incompatible/stale Work Order selection; and\nan unlinked stock-in (no project/work order) still succeeds — no regression.\n\nNo production code changed in this repo — StockMovementRegisterPage.tsx\nalready wires Project selection, population and the dependent-field reset\ncorrectly (see prior commits 3234228/2367124/1ab6c41). The remaining gap was\nserver-side (see so360-inventory-be commit 816d6252) and Work Order list\nfiltering, which is still client-side because Manufacturing''s public\nGET /orders endpoint has no project_id filter — flagged separately, out of\nthis repo''s scope.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TVKnnEWz47Rrx5VxPutpL1","tree":{"sha":"1bfc1e1d75cb432bbcc1d45454e29b7a32ba61b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/1bfc1e1d75cb432bbcc1d45454e29b7a32ba61b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/7e1b223a0ddddaf05bd94fb97447ca96d7117aa4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/7e1b223a0ddddaf05bd94fb97447ca96d7117aa4","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKDdlMWIyMjNhMGRkZGRhZjA1YmQ5NGZiOTc0NDdjYTk2ZDcxMTdhYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/7f0a6935b20b478f053f3b72e61ebf3050798bad","sha":"7f0a6935b20b478f053f3b72e61ebf3050798bad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/7f0a6935b20b478f053f3b72e61ebf3050798bad"}],"sha":"7e1b223a0ddddaf05bd94fb97447ca96d7117aa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/7e1b223a0ddddaf05bd94fb97447ca96d7117aa4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/7f0a6935b20b478f053f3b72e61ebf3050798bad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:25:56Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:25:56Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(inventory): block save on out-of-range numeric attribute values\n\nMax Weight Capacity and similar numeric attributes had no min/max\ninput constraint on the FE, so negative or out-of-range values sailed\nthrough to save. Wires the new min_value/max_value bounds from the\nbackend into the numeric/currency attribute inputs (HTML min/max +\ninline error) and gates ItemCreatePage''s save/tab-navigation on the\nsame check used server-side.\n\nPulse: 3aafa377\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TVKnnEWz47Rrx5VxPutpL1","tree":{"sha":"a132101f908d753227f8814ffc2d0029ba16a249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/a132101f908d753227f8814ffc2d0029ba16a249"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/7f0a6935b20b478f053f3b72e61ebf3050798bad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/7f0a6935b20b478f053f3b72e61ebf3050798bad","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKDdmMGE2OTM1YjIwYjQ3OGYwNTNmM2I3MmU2MWViZjMwNTA3OThiYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/a83d4fc7f74df23b4c87f3f3e6a87e1024f39103","sha":"a83d4fc7f74df23b4c87f3f3e6a87e1024f39103","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/a83d4fc7f74df23b4c87f3f3e6a87e1024f39103"}],"sha":"7f0a6935b20b478f053f3b72e61ebf3050798bad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/7f0a6935b20b478f053f3b72e61ebf3050798bad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/a83d4fc7f74df23b4c87f3f3e6a87e1024f39103/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:39:05Z","email":"165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com","name":"praveen-vr-moonhive"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:39:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(dates): resolve invoice and opening-balance dates in the org timezone (#25)\n\n* fix(dates): resolve invoice and opening-balance dates in the org timezone\n\nThe last three production uses of `toISOString().split(''T'')[0]` in this repo.\n\n  CreateInvoiceModal   vendor invoice date (initial + form reset)\n  OpeningBalancePage   `today`, used as the opening-balance date\n\nA vendor invoice date is a document date, and an opening balance dated a day\nearly lands in the wrong stock period — for an org ahead of UTC both defaulted\nto YESTERDAY during local early hours.\n\nCreateInvoiceModal already had useInventoryFormatters in scope;\nOpeningBalancePage had none and gets it.\n\nTest seams: the primitives were added to src/test/__mocks__/formatters.ts\n(which vitest.config.ts aliases ''@so360/formatters'' to) and to the 20 specs\nthat mock the formatters hook with closed-list factories. Duplicate-key scan\nrun over all of them before pushing — clean.\n\ninventory-fe now has zero production toISOString().split(''T'')[0] sites.\n\nNot verified locally — tests run on the Mac Mini / CI gate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(test): expose the date primitives ON the formatters hook, not just as exports\n\nGate: \"formatters.businessToday is not a function\" in specs that do NOT mock\nformatters at all — they resolve through vitest.config.ts''s alias to\nsrc/test/__mocks__/formatters.ts.\n\nMy mistake: I appended the four primitives to that file as standalone exports\nbut never added them to the object useFormatters RETURNS. A bare export\nsatisfies a direct `import { businessToday }`, which is how earlier repos used\nit, but components here call `formatters.businessToday()` — so the key simply\nwas not there. Two different consumption shapes, and I only wired one.\n\nAlso hoisted the primitives block ABOVE the hook. They are `const` arrow\nfunctions, so unlike function declarations they do not hoist; referencing them\nfrom a hook defined earlier in the file would have been a temporal-dead-zone\nerror at call time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"63ec95bce8b77788edb4df72972046450f99c836","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/63ec95bce8b77788edb4df72972046450f99c836"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/a83d4fc7f74df23b4c87f3f3e6a87e1024f39103","verification":{"payload":"tree 63ec95bce8b77788edb4df72972046450f99c836\nparent 1ab6c41de1dd98dba2cd3694801f972a8aa25db6\nauthor praveen-vr-moonhive <165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com> 1789130345 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789130345 +0400\n\nfix(dates): resolve invoice and opening-balance dates in the org timezone (#25)\n\n* fix(dates): resolve invoice and opening-balance dates in the org timezone\n\nThe last three production uses of `toISOString().split(''T'')[0]` in this repo.\n\n  CreateInvoiceModal   vendor invoice date (initial + form reset)\n  OpeningBalancePage   `today`, used as the opening-balance date\n\nA vendor invoice date is a document date, and an opening balance dated a day\nearly lands in the wrong stock period — for an org ahead of UTC both defaulted\nto YESTERDAY during local early hours.\n\nCreateInvoiceModal already had useInventoryFormatters in scope;\nOpeningBalancePage had none and gets it.\n\nTest seams: the primitives were added to src/test/__mocks__/formatters.ts\n(which vitest.config.ts aliases ''@so360/formatters'' to) and to the 20 specs\nthat mock the formatters hook with closed-list factories. Duplicate-key scan\nrun over all of them before pushing — clean.\n\ninventory-fe now has zero production toISOString().split(''T'')[0] sites.\n\nNot verified locally — tests run on the Mac Mini / CI gate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(test): expose the date primitives ON the formatters hook, not just as exports\n\nGate: \"formatters.businessToday is not a function\" in specs that do NOT mock\nformatters at all — they resolve through vitest.config.ts''s alias to\nsrc/test/__mocks__/formatters.ts.\n\nMy mistake: I appended the four primitives to that file as standalone exports\nbut never added them to the object useFormatters RETURNS. A bare export\nsatisfies a direct `import { businessToday }`, which is how earlier repos used\nit, but components here call `formatters.businessToday()` — so the key simply\nwas not there. Two different consumption shapes, and I only wired one.\n\nAlso hoisted the primitives block ABOVE the hook. They are `const` arrow\nfunctions, so unlike function declarations they do not hoist; referencing them\nfrom a hook defined earlier in the file would have been a temporal-dead-zone\nerror at call time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo/ZpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAg3gQAEiuUpeaJrMEPj2m/Wj7O0+U\n4fShm+yCkeFy/JZr/r+MBrfPzNhb3UJaRHEAj7a4kAWjdOgyFJ+KGQZ2H83dGGFC\nx27RzKxmHel2SBS/RzQZawGLe2yhK8Ob6r/M48z/F/pQngRUa7C9fV2SDtGSP0Tp\n507sdRClE94AUHFcl/FOk3eER1r2Ks1g3nr0cFG9BXg5WamnD+dDbHK/EJiggckD\nJ1rq2R28HZovLyGJjBdCcGVEN/TbHs2G1wS6HaLJE9zmV5XDSUDdjKWIApCVfSA3\nudomFNlTe87F+V5uyEbyeZcrVIg7kzUyUW3GkS0BHslTFCCQoJv5iv0OLg3OqAri\nxlyG1sbFD5rCykHySDFUKRocQn4Ta2enDTCq8UShPAjG17wu8Kgt505N+BSCG6Vx\nBIoOAw8nlCaXj7opynWev0L4RMb5q0KAq+pBoTIFOew9+dQcdZqmKFP5R0oNXHps\nfZU1JSGiD0xBc/A8Y7h0Ms2stT3BeIKu6AO7jrZfv0G/HXz1YEuWPvUXNNE+sy0z\n+Yjii7iXCo/DGqtqrpuX0teD3up4esxrZMbLV0M4cUtQ3mSVLdNs+LD8rQNHaqSS\nkpwD694BdsAMzb8h5kZT61nBkdKc+LPbIIDOE/kJ1wtdhvDWZnaDB1bvtNoOCKbm\nGEggVn8Ht5bb85+eDur9\n=yJ8m\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-11T12:39:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/a83d4fc7f74df23b4c87f3f3e6a87e1024f39103","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKGE4M2Q0ZmM3Zjc0ZGYyM2I0Yzg3ZjNmM2U2YTg3ZTEwMjRmMzkxMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/1ab6c41de1dd98dba2cd3694801f972a8aa25db6","sha":"1ab6c41de1dd98dba2cd3694801f972a8aa25db6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/1ab6c41de1dd98dba2cd3694801f972a8aa25db6"}],"sha":"a83d4fc7f74df23b4c87f3f3e6a87e1024f39103","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/a83d4fc7f74df23b4c87f3f3e6a87e1024f39103"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/1ab6c41de1dd98dba2cd3694801f972a8aa25db6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T15:56:46Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T15:56:46Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(inventory): Project dropdown options were blank, not a colour issue\n\nReal root cause of the \"invisible\" Project options: the Projects API''s\nproject-name field is `title` (so360-projects-be CreateProjectDto/`projects`\ntable), not `name`. StockMovementRegisterPage rendered `{p.name}` for every\n<option>, which was always undefined, so the options were genuinely empty\nstrings — not white-on-white text. The <option> bg/text classes added\npreviously were harmless but did not address this.\n\nRender `p.title` (falling back to `p.name` for any caller that already\nprovides it) in the New Transaction modal''s Project select, the Filters\npanel''s Project select, and the project_name_snapshot sent with the\ntransaction. Updated BDD fixtures that mocked the wrong `name` shape (which\nis exactly how this shipped green) to use `title`, and added a regression\ntest asserting project_name_snapshot carries the real title.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bebe175617307d3b5737a52470d8e43f0096530a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/bebe175617307d3b5737a52470d8e43f0096530a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/1ab6c41de1dd98dba2cd3694801f972a8aa25db6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/1ab6c41de1dd98dba2cd3694801f972a8aa25db6","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKDFhYjZjNDFkZTFkZDk4ZGJhMmNkMzY5NDgwMWY5NzJhOGFhMjVkYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/2367124997bb8bb797f759b7adf6213f27000d76","sha":"2367124997bb8bb797f759b7adf6213f27000d76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/2367124997bb8bb797f759b7adf6213f27000d76"}],"sha":"1ab6c41de1dd98dba2cd3694801f972a8aa25db6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/1ab6c41de1dd98dba2cd3694801f972a8aa25db6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/2367124997bb8bb797f759b7adf6213f27000d76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T15:09:09Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T15:09:09Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(inventory): Project dropdown options invisible (text colour = bg)\n\nThe Project <select> in the Stock Out/Transfer modal relies on Tailwind\nclasses applied to the <select> itself, but native dropdown popups don''t\nreliably inherit that styling per-<option> — the open list rendered with\nthe browser''s default light popup background and the same light text\ncolour (text-slate-50), making every option unreadable even though the\nprojects were loading correctly (visible in the DOM/closed value).\n\nSet bg-slate-800/text-slate-50 explicitly on each <option>.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60aa587fc679e2a3e28007d4740e9885a262e400","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/60aa587fc679e2a3e28007d4740e9885a262e400"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/2367124997bb8bb797f759b7adf6213f27000d76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/2367124997bb8bb797f759b7adf6213f27000d76","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKDIzNjcxMjQ5OTdiYjhiYjc5N2Y3NTliN2FkZjYyMTNmMjcwMDBkNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/3234228fba6f3b9fddad5d91b25add17ef9e91c0","sha":"3234228fba6f3b9fddad5d91b25add17ef9e91c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/3234228fba6f3b9fddad5d91b25add17ef9e91c0"}],"sha":"2367124997bb8bb797f759b7adf6213f27000d76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/2367124997bb8bb797f759b7adf6213f27000d76"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/3234228fba6f3b9fddad5d91b25add17ef9e91c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T14:33:51Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T14:33:51Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(inventory): load real projects in Stock Out modal, send transaction_type\n\nTwo bugs in the New Transaction / Stock Out modal:\n\n1. searchProjects() called `${origin}/v1/projects`, but so360-projects-be has\n   no global prefix/versioning — its controller is mounted at `/projects`.\n   Every call 404''d, the catch swallowed it, and the dropdown always showed\n   \"No active projects available\" even when projects existed in the Projects\n   module. Fixed the URL to `/projects`.\n\n2. The modal collected form.transaction_type (stock_in/stock_out/adjustment)\n   but never sent it to createAdjustment(), so the backend had no way to\n   distinguish a stock-in from a plain adjustment. Now threaded through so\n   the backend can store the correct movement_type (companion fix in\n   so360-inventory-be).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8213506336a0bb967bc37605e44642f238a340b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/8213506336a0bb967bc37605e44642f238a340b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/3234228fba6f3b9fddad5d91b25add17ef9e91c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/