97b58a5afec97fd89a9d4d8a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:02:25Z","email":"praveenvr@Praveens-MacBook-Air-3.local","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:02:25Z","email":"praveenvr@Praveens-MacBook-Air-3.local","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(inventory): integrate SKU auto-generation with manual override\n\n- add getNumberingSettings and getNextNumber methods to InventoryService\n- auto-generate sequential SKU in ItemCreatePage when item name is entered and auto-generation is enabled\n- preserve manual SKU override and prevent item name updates from clobbering manual values\n- display Auto-generated / Manual Override badge in BasicInfoTab\n- add BDD unit test suite for SKU auto-generation and override behavior","tree":{"sha":"d4fc0639c4b6e4f65e7d92002b749711a948e3fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/d4fc0639c4b6e4f65e7d92002b749711a948e3fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/a4a48908a1bf202097b58a5afec97fd89a9d4d8a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/a4a48908a1bf202097b58a5afec97fd89a9d4d8a","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKGE0YTQ4OTA4YTFiZjIwMjA5N2I1OGE1YWZlYzk3ZmQ4OWE5ZDRkOGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/b34b19e31147602a40fbb28b0aa4ed4d649139c1","sha":"b34b19e31147602a40fbb28b0aa4ed4d649139c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/b34b19e31147602a40fbb28b0aa4ed4d649139c1"}],"sha":"a4a48908a1bf202097b58a5afec97fd89a9d4d8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/a4a48908a1bf202097b58a5afec97fd89a9d4d8a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/b34b19e31147602a40fbb28b0aa4ed4d649139c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:42:49Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:42:49Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(quota): surface 402 quota-exceeded responses to the Shell upgrade modal\n\nWire the shared quota-exceeded contract from @so360/shell-context into the\nInventory API clients. This MFE uses fetch (no axios), so notifyQuotaExceeded()\nis the fetch-side equivalent of installQuotaExceededInterceptor(): every 402\nfrom inventoryService (request helper plus the warehouse/location, Core\nproducts/business-settings, bulk-import and raw-URL fetches), mediaService,\nvendorService, rfqService, qualityService, procurementService and\nprocurementInsightsService dispatches __so360_quota_exceeded\n(detail = resolution ?? body) and the call still fails as before.\n\n- src/services/quotaExceeded.ts: fetch-side 402 -> event helper\n- inventoryService.ts (15 fetch sites), mediaService.ts (2), vendorService,\n  rfqService, qualityService, procurementService, procurementInsightsService\n  (1 each): one-line hook after each fetch\n- vitest __mocks__/shell-context stub now mirrors QUOTA_EXCEEDED_EVENT and\n  buildQuotaExceededDetail\n- BDD spec: 402 with/without resolution dispatches, 500 does not\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R6bNiMB1b9vsa4n8JBY5Lk","tree":{"sha":"bcb8c25c92b159b9879d7c53a99df73bde9b1897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/bcb8c25c92b159b9879d7c53a99df73bde9b1897"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/b34b19e31147602a40fbb28b0aa4ed4d649139c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/b34b19e31147602a40fbb28b0aa4ed4d649139c1","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKGIzNGIxOWUzMTE0NzYwMmE0MGZiYjI4YjBhYTRlZDRkNjQ5MTM5YzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/45cd81b9de285d8485054096d3b92261b519cba9","sha":"45cd81b9de285d8485054096d3b92261b519cba9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/45cd81b9de285d8485054096d3b92261b519cba9"}],"sha":"b34b19e31147602a40fbb28b0aa4ed4d649139c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/b34b19e31147602a40fbb28b0aa4ed4d649139c1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/45cd81b9de285d8485054096d3b92261b519cba9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T05:35:31Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T05:35:31Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(inventory-fe): stop the secrets scan tripping on a VITE_ variable name\n\nThe gate failed on the guard spec added in 35fd358: gitleaks''\ngeneric-api-key rule matched `<ident>.VITE_SO360_INVENTORY_API`, a\nminified property access quoted in a comment while explaining the build\nbug. There was no secret — only a variable dereference.\n\nDescribes the minified line instead of pasting it, and adds the\n.gitleaks.toml this repo was missing (siblings already carry one) with a\nnarrowly scoped allowlist. The regex matches only the DEREFERENCE shape,\n`<ident>.VITE_NAME`, so a real `VITE_X=<value>` assignment is still\ncaught. VITE_* names are public by construction — Vite inlines their\nvalues into the client bundle, so nothing genuinely secret can carry\nthat prefix.\n\nVerified with gitleaks 8.30.1 locally (same version as the gate): the\nfinding is gone against FULL history, not just the shallow checkout CI\nscans.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BEj2A2FJuYMMwmuYpGu1ce","tree":{"sha":"7dd4719516c40bc736c19e76079a392acd1ed288","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/7dd4719516c40bc736c19e76079a392acd1ed288"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/45cd81b9de285d8485054096d3b92261b519cba9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/45cd81b9de285d8485054096d3b92261b519cba9","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKDQ1Y2Q4MWI5ZGUyODVkODQ4NTA1NDA5NmQzYjkyMjYxYjUxOWNiYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/35fd35837e6352139839902182488c139bdd7b8a","sha":"35fd35837e6352139839902182488c139bdd7b8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/35fd35837e6352139839902182488c139bdd7b8a"}],"sha":"45cd81b9de285d8485054096d3b92261b519cba9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/45cd81b9de285d8485054096d3b92261b519cba9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/35fd35837e6352139839902182488c139bdd7b8a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T04:36:26Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T04:36:26Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(inventory-fe): restore build-time API origins in production bundles\n\n`(import.meta as any)?.env` compiles to `import.meta?.env`, which Vite\nnever pattern-matches. The build-time env was therefore replaced by\nnothing, the captured object was empty, and every origin fell through to\nits localhost dev port.\n\nThe deployed procurement chunk showed this directly:\n\n  s = e && e.VITE_SO360_INVENTORY_API || t.VITE_SO360_INVENTORY_API\n      || t.VITE_API_BASE_URL || \"http://localhost:3006\"\n\nwith `t` empty. The shell injects a window global for CORE but not for\nINVENTORY, so nothing upstream covered it and production Procurement\n(PO/PR/RFQ/quality/insights) called localhost:3006 on every user''s\nmachine. inventoryService and vendorService escaped only because they\ncarry a *.neonbee.app hostname fallback.\n\nSwitches all 8 sites to the substitutable bare `import.meta.env`, and\nreplaces the dynamic `env[winKey]` cross-service lookup with an explicit\nmap read by full literal key — a variable key gives Vite nothing to\nmatch, which is the same assumption that broke this.\n\nAdds a structural BDD guard: the defect is invisible in review because\nthe source reads correctly and only the built artifact is wrong.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BEj2A2FJuYMMwmuYpGu1ce","tree":{"sha":"355a93e0042bafd948defef8dfde5c3d8cbd5d21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/355a93e0042bafd948defef8dfde5c3d8cbd5d21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/35fd35837e6352139839902182488c139bdd7b8a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/35fd35837e6352139839902182488c139bdd7b8a","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKDM1ZmQzNTgzN2U2MzUyMTM5ODM5OTAyMTgyNDg4YzEzOWJkZDdiOGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/d3bf6dddf1ca3d7d8d9e7a6a570103e55582bf47","sha":"d3bf6dddf1ca3d7d8d9e7a6a570103e55582bf47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/d3bf6dddf1ca3d7d8d9e7a6a570103e55582bf47"}],"sha":"35fd35837e6352139839902182488c139bdd7b8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/35fd35837e6352139839902182488c139bdd7b8a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/d3bf6dddf1ca3d7d8d9e7a6a570103e55582bf47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T20:01:37Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:06:25Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(inventory): correct stock-balance maths and enforce field-level validation\n\nCloses the Inventory UI defect batch reported on 2026-08-24.\n\nRecord Stock Transaction\n- Fixes the balance arithmetic. A quantity of -8 typed into a Stock In was\n  silently Math.abs()-ed to +8, so a current balance of 5 previewed as 13.\n  Only an Adjustment carries a sign now; for every other type a negative\n  entry is a data-entry error, and the projection refuses to render until\n  the quantity is valid rather than showing a wrong number.\n- Every field carries its own error message beneath it (item, warehouse,\n  destination, quantity, reason, party/reference, project, work order),\n  driven by one fieldErrors map that the submit handler also reads.\n- A transaction reason is now required for everything except a transfer.\n- Party / Reference is validated and is mandatory for supplier, vendor and\n  customer movements, so `((^*&%` can no longer be an audit reference.\n- Project and Work Order dropdowns say \"No active projects available.\" /\n  \"No active work orders available.\" instead of offering only \"Not linked\";\n  closed projects and completed work orders are filtered out, and work\n  orders show number, description and status.\n\nMovement register\n- New Transaction Type column with colour-coded badges, so Transfers and\n  Adjustments are distinguishable at a glance.\n- Transfers show their route (source → destination) by pairing both legs on\n  their shared reference number.\n- Adjustment reasons are spelled out, and the balance reads before → delta →\n  after (100 → -5 → 95).\n\nWarehouses\n- One creation entry point: the empty-state tile now appears only when no\n  warehouse exists; the header button owns creation otherwise.\n- Create and edit forms validate every field with messages beside them.\n- A deleted warehouse disappears immediately and stays gone even if the\n  server-cached list still returns it on the next refetch.\n\nStorage locations and items\n- Location Name / Location Code validated (`)*&(^`, `_( )*_` rejected).\n- Register New Item requires SKU, Unit of Measure, Category and\n  Classification, and validates name, SKU, barcode and brand.\n\nRules live in src/utils/validators.ts, mirroring the backend''s\nbusiness-text.validator.ts.\n\nTests: 1548 passing (110 suites), including 4 new BDD suites; validators.ts\nis at 100% statement/branch/function/line coverage.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b4522f2cfa74dc18e595ef4303a95e8bc3f559a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/9b4522f2cfa74dc18e595ef4303a95e8bc3f559a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/d3bf6dddf1ca3d7d8d9e7a6a570103e55582bf47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/d3bf6dddf1ca3d7d8d9e7a6a570103e55582bf47","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKGQzYmY2ZGRkZjFjYTNkN2Q4ZDllN2E2YTU3MDEwM2U1NTU4MmJmNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/54c642ae367cd6f6ed46a96165c929f7a25db191","sha":"54c642ae367cd6f6ed46a96165c929f7a25db191","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neo