/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/c3f69b6b3a59d3d9765098d6f839df0d8fc9045a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T07:23:13Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T07:23:13Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(procurement): sales demand page and the document trail panel\n\n- SalesDemandPage: confirmed customer orders with their material\n  position — what each line needs, what stock covers, what is already on\n  order and what is still short — and one click to raise the requisition\n  for the gap, so a customer order is never re-keyed by hand. Defaults to\n  hiding orders that are already covered\n- ProcurementTrace: a reusable panel that walks the whole chain\n  (requisition → RFQ → order → receipt → inspection → invoice → return),\n  marks where you are and navigates to any other document. Now on the PO\n  and GRN detail pages. It is context, never the point of the page, so\n  any failure hides the panel instead of breaking the screen\n\nShips with SalesDemandPage.test.tsx and trace mocks on the detail specs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"65154e6129696ea7a5522dcbeb7fee3fc5ca7c85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/65154e6129696ea7a5522dcbeb7fee3fc5ca7c85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/c3f69b6b3a59d3