ts{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/ba351966fcdecf009bea72245ada36493677ef8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T13:52:03Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T13:52:03Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(procurement): ERP phase 5 UI — dashboard, reports and vendor performance\n\n- ProcurementDashboardPage: ordered the way a buyer''s day runs — alerts\n  that need a decision (each one clickable straight through to the queue\n  that resolves it), then the pipeline counts, then process health, then\n  where the money goes. Trends degrade quietly if unavailable\n- ProcurementReportsPage: all 14 reports behind one screen with date\n  filtering, columns derived from the returned rows, currency-aware\n  formatting and a CSV export of exactly what is on screen\n- VendorPerformancePage: the scorecard, colour-graded by how good each\n  number is, re-rankable by spend, delivery, quality or rejection rate\n  (where lower is better)\n- PR list now shows where a requisition came from — manufacturing order,\n  project, work order or sales order — since origin beats description\n  when triaging the queue\n\nShips with specs for all three pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b4f2e42462773e87e53830a0b89a688718ef21b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/9b4f2e42462773e87e53830a0b89a688718ef21b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/ba351966fcdecf009bea72245ada36493677ef8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/ba351966fcdecf009bea72245ada36493677ef8e","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKGJhMzUxOTY2ZmNkZWNmMDA5YmVhNzIyNDVhZGEzNjQ5MzY3N2VmOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/7e270123f7a85dc6f4cf9b562dd16e0e8d7f41c3","sha":"7e270123f7a85dc6f4cf9b562dd16e0e8d7f41c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/7e270123f7a85dc6f4cf9b562dd16e0e8d7f41c3"}],"sha":"ba351966fcdecf009bea72245ada36493677ef8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/ba351966fcdecf009bea72245ada36493677ef8e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/7e270123f7a85dc6f4cf9b562dd16e0e8d7f41c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T13:34:26Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T13:34:26Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(procurement): ERP phase 3 UI — quality inspection queue and vendor returns\n\n- QualityInspectionPage: the queue of receipts holding stock. Recording a\n  result is what releases it, so the form defaults accepted to everything\n  submitted, reveals defect code and reason as soon as units are rejected,\n  shows running accepted/rejected totals and blocks a result that exceeds\n  what was handed to QC\n- VendorReturnsPage: raise a return straight off a receipt with lines\n  pre-filled from what was rejected on arrival, walk it through\n  approve -> dispatch -> settle, and collect the vendor''s credit note\n  before settling rather than letting the API refuse it\n- The never-stocked flag is surfaced per line so returning goods that were\n  taken into inventory correctly posts them back out\n- Routes registered under /quality and /returns (and their /procurement\n  equivalents), gated by submodule:inventory:quality / :returns\n\nShips with QualityInspectionPage.test.tsx and VendorReturnsPage.test.tsx.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"676f12464dcab9c5d856b5ba7602e4c89a637f6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/676f12464dcab9c5d856b5ba7602e4c89a637f6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/7e270123f7a85dc6f4cf9b562dd16e0e8d7f41c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"h