ser_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/e62c657b6b3e66e519c50ec0e4a3e1a506bd6e41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T13:01:40Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T13:01:40Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(procurement): ERP phase 2 UI — RFQ list, detail and quotation comparison\n\n- RFQListPage: create an RFQ standalone or from an approved requisition,\n  pick invitees from the vendor master, and track invited / quoted /\n  awarded at a glance\n- RFQDetailPage: send to vendors, see who responded, and record a\n  quotation against pre-filled RFQ lines so only prices are typed\n- RFQComparisonPage: side-by-side matrix across every commercial axis a\n  buyer decides on — landed total, lead time, terms, warranty, MOQ,\n  validity, quality rating and per-line prices — with the cheapest,\n  fastest and best-rated badged, expired quotes locked out of awarding,\n  and an award justification captured before the PO is raised\n- Routes registered under both /rfq and /procurement/rfq, gated by\n  submodule:inventory:rfq\n\nShips with rfqService.spec.ts and RFQComparisonPage.test.tsx.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d01ab9bcc377cc64817b43fd0eb50be7ebc1e8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/8d01ab9bcc377cc64817b43fd0eb50be7ebc1e8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/e62c657b6b3e66e519c50ec0e4a3e1a506bd6e41","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following