omment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T06:52:49Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(inventory-fe): stock movement register page\n\nReplaces the split Stock Adjustments / Stock Transfers screens with one\nsectioned register at /inventory/movements: Transaction Information →\nItem Details → Movement Details → Allocation → Remarks.\n\n- Stock In / Stock Out / Adjustment / Transfer in a single form, with the\n  visible fields following the chosen type.\n- Item picked via a debounced typeahead against the existing search\n  endpoint instead of loading the whole catalogue up front.\n- Live current/updated balance for the chosen item and warehouse, with\n  insufficient stock highlighted and submit blocked unless the org allows\n  negative inventory.\n- Transaction date defaults to today; backdated and future dates are\n  flagged and blocked according to the org''s settings.\n- Allocation section links a project, work order and issued-to /\n  received-from source; work order or project is required for production\n  and project-site movements.\n- Register list shows reference number, running balance, allocation and\n  remarks, with a filter panel wired to the new server-side filters.\n- /adjustments and /transfers now redirect here so existing notification\n  links and bookmarks keep working.\n\nTests: new StockMovementRegisterPage.bdd.test.tsx (12 scenarios); the two\nApp route specs now mock the register page. Suite green on the pre-push\ngate: 98 files / 1195 tests, tsc clean.","tree":{"sha":"f05d98c70db776e7578c149428e8003d1b028a44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/f05d98c70db776e7578c149428e8003d1b028a44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/d42c83aeb53bc0451b6e1dc2e37cc5d7ddc267f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercon