moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/4d1529f22ac79e39772705e90d22ae222d8f8f24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T06:19:16Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T06:19:16Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(light-mode): text contrast + silent errors + tab overflow in Inventory\n\nLight-mode text contrast (CSS — covers entire module at once):\n- Add .light overrides for text-slate-50/100/200/300/400 in index.css so\n  headings, item names, and form labels remain readable on light backgrounds\n  instead of rendering near-invisible white-on-white\n\nSilent API failures — add error state + user-visible banner:\n- ContractsPage: catch now sets error state; rose banner shown on failure\n  (previously: stuck on \"Loading contracts…\" forever with no feedback)\n- POListPage: fetchData catch sets fetchError; rose banner rendered above PO list\n- PRListPage: fetchData catch sets fetchError; rose banner rendered above PR list\n- OpeningBalancePage: fetchInitialData catch wires existing setError()\n  (state + display were already there; catch only logged to console)\n\nTab overflow discoverability (ItemDetailPage):\n- Remove scrollbar-hide from 9-tab view bar so native scrollbar appears\n  when tabs overflow — fixes invisible \"Sales History\" tab on narrow viewports\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c53ecbfec049b9f863ab109