or":{"date":"2026-06-19T11:10:34Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T11:10:34Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"feat(bulk-import): 4-step bulk import UI with info tooltip\n\n- BulkImportPage: 4-step state machine (CSV → Images → Preview → Result)\n- StepIndicator, CsvUploadStep, ImageUploadStep, PreviewTableStep, ImportResultStep\n- Image-to-row merging by slugified SKU after upload\n- Preview table with green/amber/red row colour coding\n- Result screen with per-item links and partial-failure report\n- \"Bulk Import\" button in ItemsPage header with Info icon + 3-step hover tooltip\n  explaining CSV preparation, SKU-matched image naming, and the import flow\n- Route items/bulk-import gated behind action:inventory:bulk_import FeatureGate\n- 3 new inventoryService methods: bulkImportParseCsv, bulkImportUploadImages,\n  bulkImportCommit (multipart fetch, bypasses JSON request helper)\n- BDD specs: StepIndicator, CsvUploadStep, ImageUploadStep, PreviewTableStep,\n  ImportResultStep, BulkImportPage orchestration (40 scenarios)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d862ddceccf1d308e8e4d42f71ccffdcc2e29b8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/d862ddceccf1d308e8e4d42f71ccffdcc2e29b8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/309b3e9beb01f1a6e758b9d49fa0a022d8b92a88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gi