l":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/e61c41a772342f4878ae7c10b22aae3ef8c8de68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T16:15:56Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T16:15:56Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(procurement): fix PR creation 400 — stale closure, missing date guard, error surfacing\n\nRoot causes:\n- Stale closure in onChange handlers sent required_date:'''' when user filled date\n  then description; @IsDateString() rejects empty string → consistent 400\n- No explicit required_date guard before API call meant HTML required could be\n  bypassed in edge cases\n- procurementService swallowed NestJS ValidationPipe array messages (joined now)\n- estimated_unit_price NaN coerced cleanly to undefined instead of null\n\nChanges:\n- Use functional setState (prev =>) in both onChange handlers to eliminate stale closure\n- Add required_date pre-flight check in handleSubmit before all API calls\n- Join array error messages from NestJS ValidationPipe with '', ''\n- parseFloat(String(...)) || undefined for estimated_unit_price\n- Reset formData + items on modal close\n- BDD: date-guard, stale-closure-date-then-desc, stale-closure-desc-then-date tests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"daffe0a3aa59a9ac3cc689fb0024edce90774254","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/daffe0a3aa59a9ac3cc689fb0024edce90774254"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/e61c41a772342f4878ae7c10b22aae3ef8c8de68","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-m