aveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/878fa8a8bd845502810d3862a1db79a6e3fdf157/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T07:04:48Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T07:04:48Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(vendors/spec): reset mock queues between tests + fix text assertions\n\nvi.clearAllMocks() does not clear mockResolvedValueOnce queues —\nleftover 3-item queue from CRUD test polluted QuotaGate test (got 3,\nexpected 7). Switch to vi.resetAllMocks() in beforeEach to flush all\nqueued return values between tests.\n\nAlso fix vendor name assertions: CSS `uppercase` is visual-only; DOM\ntext nodes contain ''Vendor 1'' not ''VENDOR 1''.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dcc208cf649957db910cebeef412e28b29fc7807","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/dcc208cf649957db910cebeef412e28b29fc7807"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/878fa8a8bd845502810d3862a1db79a6e3fdf157","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}",