"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commits/8ec905a6604084bba38f031d86aa8b13652011c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T05:16:08Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T05:16:08Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(procurement): resolve 400 on PR creation from empty item_id + add BDD guards\n\nRoot causes fixed:\n- item_id: '''' sent on unselected rows failed @IsUUID() backend validation (empty\n  string is not undefined, so @IsOptional() didn''t skip the check)\n- Generic ''Failed to create PR'' swallowed the actual backend error message\n- No pre-submit validation allowed zero-item or unselected-row payloads to reach API\n\nChanges:\n- Map item_id via `it.item_id || undefined` to avoid empty-string UUID rejection\n- Surface error.message from caught Error in alert fallback\n- Guard: block submit when items.length === 0\n- Guard: block submit when any item row has no product selected (item_id falsy)\n- Guard: block submit when any item has quantity ≤ 0\n\nTests (PRListPage.test.tsx):\n- Fix ItemSearchSelector mock: was passing {item_id} but handler reads {id, sku}\n- Fix existing submit test: must add + select item to satisfy new guards\n- Add 6 new BDD specs covering all three root-cause branches + fallback error path\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7b613878ac8cf58b4cd95a623b71b8c34619ca5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/trees/d7b613878ac8cf58b4cd95a623b71b8c34619ca5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/git/commits/8ec905a6604084bba38f031d86aa8b13652011c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inventory-fe/commit/8ec905a6604084bba38f031d86aa8b13652011c5","node_id":"C_kwDORv4DgdoAKDhlYzkwNWE2NjA0MDg0YmJhMzhmMDMxZDg2YWE4YjEzNjUyMDExYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-inv