4,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/commits/953dd5eecdc965c0f45724d3dfe8dc3830d47d6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:42:39Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:42:39Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"ci(dev): restore the dev tier — isolated tree, prod-parity ports, develop trigger\n\nThe dev deploy step was gated on refs/heads/main while every caller pushes\ndevelop, so each dev deploy has been a green no-op since ~May 2026. Re-arm it:\n\n- trigger on develop/qa (+ workflow_dispatch) instead of a dead branch\n- dev/staging ports now mirror production (dev = prod - 2000), which also\n  clears three dev port collisions (sign/tools 6045, chat/partner 6046,\n  folio/connect 6048)\n\nThe reusable workflows now remap dev/staging deploys into /github/neonbee-dev,\naway from the prod-HA tree they used to share.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R6bNiMB1b9vsa4n8JBY5Lk","tree":{"sha":"3b16d00db26d0779d7bd6a04f222115d57859e5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/git/trees/3b16d00db26d0779d7bd6a04f222115d57859e5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/git/commits/953dd5eecdc965c0f45724d3dfe8dc3830d47d6c","verification":