cation gate\n\nRuns unit tests, lint, audit, license and secret checks on every PR\nbefore merge. The reusable has no deploy job by construction, so a PR\ncannot reach a VM.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a083b01a8b34c6b96555b226c69bd14f3eb6eb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/git/trees/0a083b01a8b34c6b96555b226c69bd14f3eb6eb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/git/commits/6644ce88a0f0e51118bf389994d3c11ee0ad5f7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/commit/6644ce88a0f0e51118bf389994d3c11ee0ad5f7e","node_id":"C_kwDORv4EqdoAKDY2NDRjZTg4YTBmMGU1MTExOGJmMzg5OTk0ZDNjMTFlZTBhZDVmN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/commit/52ab3d27993f15d8524929ccea33f7000f4627ef","sha":"52ab3d27993f15d8524929ccea33f7000f4627ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/commits/52ab3d27993f15d8524929ccea33f7000f4627ef"}],"sha":"6644ce88a0f0e51118bf389994d3c11ee0ad5f7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/commits/6644ce88a0f0e51118bf389994d3c11ee0ad5f7e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/commits/52ab3d27993f15d8524929ccea33f7000f4627ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T16:44:31Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T16:44:31Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(flow): gate pages on role permissions, not just plan feature flags\n\nYesterday''s sweep gated Flow action buttons, but every page stayed reachable:\nroutes were wrapped only in FlagGuard, which answers \"is this feature in the\nplan\", never \"may this user open it\". Any user holding a single Flow permission\ncould open the workflow designer, the instance list and the approval policy\neditor — by nav or by typing the URL.\n\nAdds PermissionGuard beside the existing FlagGuard and wraps all 7 non-landing\nroutes. The two compose rather than replace: a page needs the plan flag AND the\nrole code. Approval policies are gated on workflows.update rather than a read\ncode because the page exists only to edit them.\n\nThe Flow dashboard stays ungated on purpose — the Shell''s module filter has\nalready established the user belongs in Flow, and gating the module''s default\nroute would strand them on an empty page. The approval dashboard is likewise\nungated: it is the approver''s own work queue, scoped server-side to what was\nrouted to them.\n\nFail-closed while entitlements resolve, with an explanatory notice on denial so\n\"not allowed\" is distinguishable from \"broken\".\n\nApp.spec.tsx''s default shell mock predated entitlements and returned no\npermission fields, so the guard correctly withheld the routed pages it asserts\non; the default is now unrestricted and 5 new specs drive the real code paths.\n385 specs green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d6f35148ea23acefa74488625d57b4e0e685dc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/git/trees/7d6f35148ea23acefa74488625d57b4e0e685dc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/git/commits/52ab3d27993f15d8524929ccea33f7000f4627ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_us