subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/commits/94bce501f83dcadc2bb608bbfad7a82b808a66d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T14:46:29Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T14:46:29Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(flow): gate flow creation on workflows.create role permission, fail-closed\n\nCreate-flow was gated only on a plan flag (fail-open); now also requires\nworkflows.create via live Shell entitlements. instances:start / approval:simulate\n/ approval:action have no matching role code and stay flag-only. Owner/admin\nwildcard retains access. Spec updated. NOTE: flow-fe has no local node_modules —\nCI-gate-verified only; change is mechanically identical to the verified CRM pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af9d4aa6622294638cd87af1b9298fd1653b0376","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/git/trees/af9d4aa6622294638cd87af1b9298fd1653b0376"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/git/commits/94bce501f83dcadc2bb608bbfad7a82b808a66d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.