_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/commits/635e6a25ea0233be264de7d248a61d30263745bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T11:27:28Z","email":"165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com","name":"praveen-vr-moonhive"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T11:27:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(build): declare @so360/cross-link file dep to fix prod build (#15)\n\n@so360/design-system now imports @so360/cross-link (CrossLinkChip), but\nthis MFE didn''t declare it, so Rollup fails to resolve the transitive\nimport during build. Add it as a file: dep mirroring the other @so360\npackages (same fix already applied to so360-crm-fe / so360-inventory-fe)\nand sync the lockfile.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5dda27f7d5300aeee72e929b1f1b40544e7bb0d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/git/trees/5dda27f7d5300aeee72e929b1f1b40544e7bb0d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-flow-fe/git/commits/635e6a25ea0233be264de7d248a61d30263745bd","verification":{"payload":"tree 5dda27f7d5300aeee72e929b1f1b40544e7bb0d3\nparent 8049f430e4a89fc9e7dd4260e47d34902d4d8469\nauthor praveen-vr-moonhive <165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com> 1780313248 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780313248 +0400\n\nfix(build): declare @so360/cross-link file dep to fix prod build (#15)\n\n@so360/design-system now imports @so360/cross-link (CrossLinkChip), but\nthis MFE didn''t declare it, so Rollup fails to resolve the transitive\nimport during build. Add it as a file: dep mirroring the other @so360\npackages (same fix already applied to so360-crm-fe / so360-inventory-fe)\nand sync the lockfile.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHWygCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUXMQAKRifI6qGeBJ4wj/rPOwrdig\nkVEHVjK3lyHogcjgw67d0+03J5vU5MdbwEhT94RaMuvB9ubdSULGYyKv5dXbxafr\nWVi8tfoCkXpJjwYCb5WCBQ4ae5y5VyGfTScn2xpuWoa30gkOl/fahtEnv0zrIbO4\n/7rqgk5U7D7SFCccZLm+0mS8MvS+DxRArNNTJwni6sa8VymISbB0uqNw0nIYNo9J\npi6XMaywoSa592lFAWVTdrBhOCo7RQvoS8wQMq+Tr2jq+NN1UsuvD2T3sAe3rJu8\nWMikCNeJ5s0qx6izx7w56toeyxBhsabvsL9XAsW2rZM1PF3Uw0lbmMQzZxVz7HgC\ngyKRHD8uiTYfiM0ajW073KKNvMW6+9SumXZt4vJ1CNeytxCbmbIAA0q0iifg30g7\n5tAifigDvubFTUJN/gxoyIRzerKEFIjEhvDrB0LFswcqgcBhDRbNKmWEs0uJqDpR\ny43dHz1f3mJye5Qab1B6RwbI7UxZ7eiGbIYkVuNdt2L7FdVK67ziqFHN+rpBINL1\nz2A7Sz2C8oPWvBKrPju8QxsawlnoEs5b8KHOqIYszekFsh+YElz26QHF2frEhDVE\njlGsYz3nLOPsuwTDheGwRfMrCIF/0LsCqC5fi+DZu7X6IZrb04zE7b8GcmevrYfA\naumregQ5wk7Yxii1wsHK\n=xio1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-01T11:27:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}