en-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commits/65e35fd4cd6d143fefe316c307803da5bbea72ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:44:37Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:44:37Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"ci(dev): restore the dev tier — isolated tree, prod-parity ports, develop trigger\n\nThe dev deploy step was gated on refs/heads/main while every caller pushes\ndevelop, so each dev deploy has been a green no-op since ~May 2026. Re-arm it:\n\n- trigger on develop/qa (+ workflow_dispatch) instead of a dead branch\n- dev/staging ports now mirror production (dev = prod - 2000), which also\n  clears three dev port collisions (sign/tools 6045, chat/partner 6046,\n  folio/connect 6048)\n\nThe reusable workflows now remap dev/staging deploys into /github/neonbee-dev,\naway from the prod-HA tree they used to share.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R6bNiMB1b9vsa4n8JBY5Lk","tree":{"sha":"efb2e75900d5d394640cb59bb26782019d816ce5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/git/trees/efb2e75900d5d394640cb59bb26782019d816ce5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/git/commits/65e35fd4cd6d143fefe316c307803da5bbea72ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commit/65e35fd4cd6d143fefe316c307803da5bbea72ad","node_id":"C_kwDORv4E2toAKDY1ZTM1ZmQ0Y2Q2ZDE0M2ZlZmUzMTZjMzA3ODAzZGE1YmJlYTcyYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commit/584f03dba7f1d18d3defbf2e7a12301cde26a150","sha":"584f03dba7f1d18d3defbf2e7a12301cde26a150","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commits/584f03dba7f1d18d3defbf2e7a12301cde26a150"}],"sha":"65e35fd4cd6d143fefe316c307803da5bbea72ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commits/65e35fd4cd6d143fefe316c307803da5bbea72ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commits/584f03dba7f1d18d3defbf2e7a12301cde26a150/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T15:59:18Z","email":"165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com","name":"praveen-vr-moonhive"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T15:59:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(insight): fail CLOSED on Insight dashboard KPI permissions (#16)\n\n* fix(insight): fail CLOSED on Insight dashboard KPI permissions\n\ncanViewFinancials and canViewWorkforce led with `!hasPermCheck ? true : …`,\nwhere hasPermCheck was false whenever the shell bridge could not be resolved\n(MFE mounted standalone, or host context still undefined). The ABSENCE of a\npermission system was therefore read as full clearance, and the finance and\nworkforce segment tabs rendered org-wide revenue and headcount for any user.\n\nInsight was the outlier: the sibling MFE dashboards (projects-fe,\npeople-connect-fe, timesheet-fe) already require a positive answer. This\naligns Insight with them. Unknown must mean denied.\n\nPart of Task 3 (dashboard access controlled by RBAC, not by fallback).\n\nNot verified locally — tests run on the Mac Mini pre-push gate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(insight): align specs with fail-closed KPI gating\n\nThe gate caught this correctly: `InsightDashboard.spec.tsx > … When initialTab\nis revenue / Then shows segment tab content` failed because the default mock\nshell was `{ effectiveFlagsLoaded, isFeatureEnabled }` with NO permission API.\nUnder the old fail-open gates that mock rendered every tab; now it resolves to\n\"denied\", so the revenue tab is correctly filtered out.\n\nThe spec was encoding the defect, not a requirement. Fixes:\n\n- Default mock is now authorizedShell() (adds isAdmin: true) — the right\n  baseline for the ~30 tests that are about rendering, not permissions. The\n  dedicated permission suites still override it with restricted shells.\n- Added two regression guards that pin the new contract:\n    * no permission API on the bridge at all -> financial tabs stay HIDDEN\n      (this is the exact case the old `!hasPermCheck ? true : …` fallback got\n      wrong, and the reason org-wide revenue leaked)\n    * isAdmin -> financial tabs shown without explicit codes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"562885dad6ec29b9ef7ba0d417cff984f9e2eb89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/git/trees/562885dad6ec29b9ef7ba0d417cff984f9e2eb89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/git/commits/584f03dba7f1d18d3defbf2e7a12301cde26a150","verification":{"payload":"tree 562885dad6ec29b9ef7ba0d417cff984f9e2eb89\nparent e6deb3b07e698176279753a063614d4e3c98a9c9\nauthor praveen-vr-moonhive <165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com> 1789055958 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789055958 +0400\n\nfix(insight): fail CLOSED on Insight dashboard KPI permissions (#16)\n\n* fix(insight): fail CLOSED on Insight dashboard KPI permissions\n\ncanViewFinancials and canViewWorkforce led with `!hasPermCheck ? true : …`,\nwhere hasPermCheck was false whenever the shell bridge could not be resolved\n(MFE mounted standalone, or host context still undefined). The ABSENCE of a\npermission system was therefore read as full clearance, and the finance and\nworkforce segment tabs rendered org-wide revenue and headcount for any user.\n\nInsight was the outlier: the sibling MFE dashboards (projects-fe,\npeople-connect-fe, timesheet-fe) already require a positive answer. This\naligns Insight with them. Unknown must mean denied.\n\nPart of Task 3 (dashboard access controlled by RBAC, not by fallback).\n\nNot verified locally — tests run on the Mac Mini pre-push gate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(insight): align specs with fail-closed KPI gating\n\nThe gate caught this correctly: `InsightDashboard.spec.tsx > … When initialTab\nis revenue / Then shows segment tab content` failed because the default mock\nshell was `{ effectiveFlagsLoaded, isFeatureEnabled }` with NO permission API.\nUnder the old fail-open gates that mock rendered every tab; now it resolves to\n\"denied\", so the revenue tab is correctly filtered out.\n\nThe spec was encoding the defect, not a requirement. Fixes:\n\n- Default mock is now authorizedShell() (adds isAdmin: true) — the right\n  baseline for the ~30 tests that are about rendering, not permissions. The\n  dedicated permission suites still override it with restricted shells.\n- Added two regression guards that pin the new contract:\n    * no permission API on the bridge at all -> financial tabs stay HIDDEN\n      (this is the exact case the old `!hasPermCheck ? true : …` fallback got\n      wrong, and the reason org-wide revenue leaked)\n    * isAdmin -> financial tabs shown without explicit codes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqotPWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAw8wQAF+ycQkTJk54Q+/pNF3qr24r\n/ADrZCQzIBMmknbKWU73n/LW1Mu0DtaeC7No+YpFHPkkZxogdFAr1VV3WSBioip6\nYyDTPmpv9sbVFpcdm1aovONdl1Ufd6cvBexSwNJAPpbyFUQhMlst3bmYkhvtVunE\n2mcl4owa6btZB98h2ZBab+Kt3w/zXseUg5Pqe8pbBRCh4lJanTFayoSxWUiWrzC5\nLYHxb742qhJWboDL97tdhU00upH5tIuLZQOiJGXbE2vVyS9jN+34UsfCjaNroOAj\n8q4Ux6i2SV8YHG/+pYVBuAcYh0WJWS4vNzX87LqtKP5rfN0wNNjDjBspkx09xxG4\nB3AfDpcfPxPZbIEgFLcewPvqQ0zti2QtKJPsZoYSQXS31+3faSQBygsLNey6veYT\nRPEaUOL33uyqlHh2pNCwoaKozGcxKHcclBrfhtb8OnN0H3yE/T6a1dYEEB/wiFL0\nBtJ2hfSlCt9R7dwIu7RWzdKwWwyy5aW5fQbBoTBhVOUsaCX18VT4rDzdi2pEiC7a\nYibUJhkEIZlh5qm8OAlrE2YgARxC5JkW1iGPcJU46/q1mvKpDOeJxYsdQ2xFhMPb\nnvCTZ7/23LvpohMrX2CDu8Rm3beqYeN/g4OjwmFdqHFPS1EUrsIKqY4KizDRKbuR\nfzXkcIhy1QAeMBVdFzpE\n=9B4Z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T15:59:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.c