-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commit/e51f1a2a2426221c701828271b50dd495ca05122","node_id":"C_kwDORv4E2toAKGU1MWYxYTJhMjQyNjIyMWM3MDE4MjgyNzFiNTBkZDQ5NWNhMDUxMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commit/a7097abbf84d2b92f64758f88219461dc03f5ab6","sha":"a7097abbf84d2b92f64758f88219461dc03f5ab6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commits/a7097abbf84d2b92f64758f88219461dc03f5ab6"}],"sha":"e51f1a2a2426221c701828271b50dd495ca05122","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commits/e51f1a2a2426221c701828271b50dd495ca05122"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commits/a7097abbf84d2b92f64758f88219461dc03f5ab6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T12:03:38Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T12:03:38Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(insight): graceful Manufacturing tab failures + correct BE resolution\n\nThe Manufacturing tab fetched `/manufacturing-api/...` relative to the page\norigin. That proxy only exists on insight-fe''s own dev/preview server — inside\nthe Shell host the path hits the SPA fallback, which answers 200 text/html.\n`res.json()` then threw, and the raw parser error (plus a hardcoded \"port 3034\"\nhint) was painted straight onto the dashboard.\n\n- Add `services/manufacturingApi.ts`: resolves the backend base URL from\n  window override → build env → hostname-derived cloud gateway → localhost:3034,\n  validates content-type before parsing, and logs status codes / parser errors\n  / upstream bodies to the console only.\n- Callers now receive a single business-friendly message; the UI shows\n  \"Manufacturing data is currently unavailable. Please try again later.\" with a\n  Retry action, and no port, host, or parser detail.\n- Send the Shell''s bearer token — manufacturing-be guards the report routes with\n  ModuleAccessGuard + PermissionsGuard and was returning 401 regardless.\n- A failing poll no longer wipes loaded tiles; it degrades to an inline banner\n  and self-heals on the next successful 30s tick.\n- AtAGlanceView''s Manufacturing card uses the same client.\n- BDD specs for base-URL resolution, HTML-instead-of-JSON, HTTP errors, network\n  failure, auth headers, no-detail-leak, and Retry recovery.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5aacc54014fa00cdf8986cd68f0c21a6080f37c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/git/trees/5aacc54014fa00cdf8986cd68f0c21a6080f37c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/git/commits/a7097abbf84d2b92f64758f88219461dc03f5ab6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}}