:"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commits/09727ab8fc0a02b46ba95e62f273b0a516b61aab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T14:29:10Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T14:29:10Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(insight): add useShell to AtAGlanceView spec''s shell-context mock\n\nAtAGlanceView.spec.tsx''s inline vi.mock(''@so360/shell-context'', ...) didn''t\nexport useShell, so it threw as soon as ManufacturingAtAGlanceCard (now\nusing useShell().currentOrg for its dynamic org fix) rendered — vitest\nthrows for any hook a component imports that the mock factory doesn''t define.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f765c4e23adf64eb8be1d84ba741dce3373f2897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/git/trees/f765c4e23adf64eb8be1d84ba741dce3373f2897"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/git/commits/09727ab8fc0a02b46ba95e62f273b0a516b61aab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commit/09727ab8fc0a02b46ba95e62f273b0a516b61aab","node_id":"C_kwDORv4E2toAKDA5NzI3YWI4ZmMwYTAyYjQ2YmE5NWU2MmYyNzNiMGE1MTZiNjFhYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commit/afcf969b1ad8b0fb8310aa7d626d87f2c7a78130","sha":"afcf969b1ad8b0fb8310aa7d626d87f2c7a78130","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commits/afcf969b1ad8b0fb8310aa7d626d87f2c7a78130"}],"sha":"09727ab8fc0a02b46ba95e62f273b0a516b61aab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commits/09727ab8fc0a02b46ba95e62f273b0a516b61aab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commits/afcf969b1ad8b0fb8310aa7d626d87f2c7a78130/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T14:19:35Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T14:19:35Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(insight): Manufacturing widgets use the logged-in org, not a hardcoded UUID\n\nManufacturingSegment.tsx and AtAGlanceView.tsx''s ManufacturingAtAGlanceCard\nboth hardcoded a single tenant/org UUID pair for their X-Tenant-Id/X-Org-Id\nheaders, so every user on every org saw the SAME hardcoded org''s manufacturing\ndata (or none, if that org didn''t match the logged-in one) regardless of who\nwas actually logged in. Both now derive tenant/org dynamically from\nuseShell().currentOrg, matching every other segment in this app; show an\nexplicit \"no active organization\" error instead of silently fetching under\nthe wrong org when currentOrg isn''t yet available.\n\nUpdates the shared shell-context test mock to include a currentOrg fixture,\nand adds specs locking in the dynamic-org header behavior and the\nno-org error path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31c51c11ac032dc219af2366ddd010d5d468b31c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/git/trees/31c51c11ac032dc219af2366ddd010d5d468b31c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/git/commits/afcf969b1ad8b0fb8310aa7d626d87f2c7a78130","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165479734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.