34,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commits/d2802a526565fc69042c1e2f7c900d4483e1ebed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:47:07Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:47:07Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(insight): make formatters test mock match real Intl-backed contract\n\nThe shared @so360/formatters vitest stub used naive string interpolation\n(formatCurrency: v => `$${v}`, formatPercentage: n => `${n}%`) instead of\nmirroring the real package''s Intl-based behavior (currency grouping/decimals,\npercent expecting a 0-1 fraction). This masked the exact class of formatting\nbug this branch fixes and made new KPICard assertions fail against real output.\nRewrote the stub to use real Intl.NumberFormat semantics; updated KPICard.spec\nassertions to match (grouped/decimal currency, 1-decimal trend percentage,\ncombined \"<value> <unit>\" text for time-kind KPIs).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c1f280fb45a88bde901d948449995116660058c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/git/trees/c1f280fb45a88bde901d948449995116660058c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/git/commits/d2802a526565fc69042c1e2f7c900d4483e1ebed","verification":{"payload":null,