{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveen-vr-moonhive","id":165479734,"login":"praveen-vr-moonhive","node_id":"U_kgDOCd0FNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commits/ec34c012eab1f087b454e0ca0a7106273c1ca95b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T03:14:43Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T04:02:52Z","email":"praveen.vr@moonhive.in","name":"Praveen VR"},"message":"fix(insight): bound the API response cache to stop unbounded memory growth\n\nThe module-level apiCache Map stored full API payloads keyed by segment/chart/\nKPI/signal-filter permutations. Expired entries were only reclaimed on re-read,\nso over a long session unread keys accumulated for the whole session — a leak.\n\nExtract a reusable bounded TTL cache (createTtlCache) that evicts expired entries\nand hard-caps at 100 entries (oldest-first), and route insightApi through it.\n\nAdds ttlCache.spec.ts (BDD): TTL expiry, expired-pruning, capacity eviction,\nprefix invalidation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9faae97d564c603540b15904701426c6e6321c41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/git/trees/9faae97d564c603540b15904701426c6e6321c41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so3