tarred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveen-vr-moonhive","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/commits/d5a2a8eea70daca3555d6ef257cfb9e62f1d20f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T18:36:53Z","email":"165479734+praveen-vr-moonhive@users.noreply.github.com","name":"praveen-vr-moonhive"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T18:36:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: add BDD unit tests for insight-fe chart components, segment components and utilities (#12)\n\nEnhances coverage for 5 thin spec files and adds new types/insight.spec.ts:\n- useSyncExternalStore.spec.ts: expanded from 1 to 6 tests covering store subscription, state updates, string/object snapshots, serverSnapshot\n- chartUtils.spec.ts: added THEME_COLORS, formatDateTime, getResponsiveContainerProps, getLegendStyle, generateLabels, getMinMaxValues, heatmap boundary tests\n- index.spec.ts (barrel): expanded to verify each export is a function and utilities return correct values\n- moduleMapping.spec.ts: added full dependency coverage including dailystore/inbox/flow, length assertions, manufacturing key absence\n- neuraPromptBuilder.spec.ts: exact string assertions, manufacturing/uppercase/empty fallbacks, context parameter passthrough\n- types/insight.spec.ts (new): 40+ BDD tests covering SignalSeverity enum, KPI, Signal, RecommendedAction, SignalsSummary, Dashboard, ModuleInsights, SignalsResponse, SegmentSummary, SegmentDetail, TrendData types\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2bd4528603a61906708962ba65c33fc6c0e15496","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Neonbee-ai/so360-insight-fe/git/trees/2bd4528603a61906708962ba65c33fc6c0e15496"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos