date":"2026-08-23T22:06:00Z","email":"danielrosscarter@gmail.com","name":"monobyte"},"message":"feat: take the shared app-state lock and echo the host''s etag (sero#428)\n\nThe Sero host now locks <stateFile>.lock around every mutation of the\napp-state file. All extension read-modify-writes of state.json now run\nunder the same cross-process lock via withStateLock from\n@sero-ai/extension-runtime, with gog CLI fetches kept outside the lock.\nBumps runtimeAbi to 3 and @sero-ai/app-runtime to ^0.4.1 for the new\netag-aware appState bridge.","tree":{"sha":"c80b847600765484eb9590768e08b5e50169b178","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero-google-plugin/git/trees/c80b847600765484eb9590768e08b5e50169b178"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero-google-plugin/git/commits/bb7dcf5cbeeaf0cd8bdd9d7be196d46dea9ab695","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/monobyte","id":128296,"login":"monobyte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODI5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sero-labs/sero-google-plugin/commit/bb7dcf5cbeeaf0cd8bdd9d7be196d46dea9ab695","no