s). Salida en .coordination/docs-negocio/.\n- Skill business-docs (tipos, estructura, regla de oro, pipeline HTML -> PDF/DOCX).\n- Plantilla templates/doc-negocio/documento-negocio.html.\n- product-owner extendido con la nueva capacidad.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"88de864cb330e4bb02af6ac51fa370db074a9da4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/trees/88de864cb330e4bb02af6ac51fa370db074a9da4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/commits/9c30b1c3ab7df27fd0a4881114977ae0000fdc52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235109472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos-fuentes-rojas","id":235109472,"login":"carlos-fuentes-rojas","node_id":"U_kgDODgN8YA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commit/9c30b1c3ab7df27fd0a4881114977ae0000fdc52","node_id":"C_kwDORv6JqtoAKDljMzBiMWMzYWI3ZGYyN2ZkMGE0ODgxMTE0OTc3YWUwMDAwZmRjNTI","parents"