strar y re-ejecutar)\n\nCada flujo es una carpeta ordenada en .coordination/flows/{dominio}/{flujo}/ con un\ncoordinador delgado (FLUJO.md), referencias sin secretos (usuarios por paso, SQL de\nverificacion con Esperado), runbook con pasos numerados y steps.yaml opcional.\n\n- /flow: crear (scaffold + entrevista), grabar (recorrer capturando pasos, locators y\n  evidencia), listar, verificar (precondiciones en solo lectura), ejecutar (fases con\n  plan primero, puntos de parada antes de cada escritura sensible, cambios de BD\n  guardados por el dba con rollback, verificacion y evidencia).\n- Skill flow-recording con la anatomia y las reglas duras (un browser compartido, a la\n  primera falla detener, OK del usuario en el momento, secretos por nombre de variable).\n- Los flujos se versionan; la evidencia de cada corrida va aparte (gitignored).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de44105af9a730a8c78dd9c36f99d353091f5d0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/trees/de44105af9a730a8c78dd9c36f99d353091f5d0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/commits/8f43d80626d4dc514a52eb366662bbdf400f5550","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235109472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos-fuentes-rojas","id":235109472,"login":"carlos-fuentes-rojas","node_id":"U_kgDODgN8YA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.