s://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commits/3edf0a24c3851448ca79ae56756972538a0dba44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T23:23:31Z","email":"carlos.fuentes@faast.app","name":"Carlos Fuentes Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T23:23:31Z","email":"carlos.fuentes@faast.app","name":"Carlos Fuentes Rojas"},"message":"feat(dev-team): v2.14.0 — estandar de despliegue FAAST + descubrimiento seguro de servidor\n\nSkill deployment-standard con el estandar de dockerizacion (9 reglas duras: un puerto\ninterno, non-root por UID del host, healthcheck real, cero secretos en imagen,\nmulti-stage, dockerignore, logs a stdout, provenance + tag sha permanente, init),\nfamilias de Dockerfile, convenciones de compose y .env por instancia, version por\nversion.txt, carpeta de despliegue ADR-002 y cutover PM2->Docker.\n\n- /deploy: local (con BD local Docker o remota), inventario (descubrir que corre en un\n  servidor en SOLO LECTURA, sin romper nada), servidor (despliegue guiado con plan y\n  confirmacion), bd, cutover, estandar. Regla de oro: descubrir en solo lectura,\n  cambiar solo con plan + confirmacion; nunca borrar lo de otros ni tumbar compartido.\n- infra extendido con el estandar y la operacion segura; /deploy-check valida R1-R9.\n- Plantillas templates/deploy/ (inventario de servidores, checklist del estandar).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4432c42e7ee61ae89864a10411ce5fee64d15322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/trees/4432c42e7ee61ae89864a10411ce5fee64d15322"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/commits/3edf0a24c3851448ca79ae56756972538a0dba44","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"ver