ttps://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commit/92826f0c8d461b39a491014af0a0540eb91d6db0","node_id":"C_kwDORv6JqtoAKDkyODI2ZjBjOGQ0NjFiMzlhNDkxMDE0YWYwYTA1NDBlYjkxZDZkYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commit/a04f20c129aac9dabb5e01cc27e442fc8081b116","sha":"a04f20c129aac9dabb5e01cc27e442fc8081b116","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commits/a04f20c129aac9dabb5e01cc27e442fc8081b116"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commit/af56a3b087287ccd29fca08f55508bc5936e180f","sha":"af56a3b087287ccd29fca08f55508bc5936e180f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commits/af56a3b087287ccd29fca08f55508bc5936e180f"}],"sha":"92826f0c8d461b39a491014af0a0540eb91d6db0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commits/92826f0c8d461b39a491014af0a0540eb91d6db0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235109472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos-fuentes-rojas","id":235109472,"login":"carlos-fuentes-rojas","node_id":"U_kgDODgN8YA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commits/af56a3b087287ccd29fca08f55508bc5936e180f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T15:34:58Z","email":"carlos.fuentes@faast.app","name":"Carlos Fuentes Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T15:34:58Z","email":"carlos.fuentes@faast.app","name":"Carlos Fuentes Rojas"},"message":"fix(dev-team): v2.6.11 — coordinación canónica: fin de las .coordination duplicadas\n\nIncidente real (Confirming2.0, recurrente 2 veces): sesiones abiertas en el repo\nescribían handoffs/activity en una .coordination huérfana dentro del repo, en vez\nde la canónica del paraguas — la limpieza manual no evitaba la reincidencia.\n\nSolución estructural:\n- La .coordination CANÓNICA es la que tiene config.json; una sin config.json es\n  un desvío y solo se usa como último recurso\n- Nuevo puntero .coordination-root (una línea: ruta a la carpeta paraguas) en la\n  raíz de repos que viven fuera del paraguas — hooks y agentes lo siguen SIEMPRE\n- log-activity.py e inject-team-protocol.sh resuelven: puntero → .coordination\n  con config.json → huérfana como fallback\n- La auto-migración jamás engorda un desvío (solo actúa sobre la canónica)\n- Al caer en una huérfana, la sesión recibe instrucción de reparo (fusionar,\n  eliminar, crear puntero — con OK del usuario)\n- onboard crea los punteros (y gitignorea .coordination/ en repos multi)\n- GUIDE: troubleshooting del síntoma\n\nProbado replicando el caso real: puntero resuelve canónica, actividad va al\nparaguas, huérfana intacta, migración no la engorda, aviso de reparo presente ✔\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80da215e05f06c8cefd15c61c45c87aacf43f2f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/trees/80da215e05f06c8cefd15c61c45c87aacf43f2f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/commits/af56a3b087287ccd29fca08f55508bc5936e180f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235109472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos-fuentes-rojas","id":235109472,"login":"carlos-fuentes-rojas","node_id":"U_kgDODgN8YA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commit/af56a3b087287ccd29fca08f55508bc5936e180f","node_id":"C_kwDORv6JqtoAKGFmNTZhM2IwODcyODdjY2QyOWZjYTA4ZjU1NTA4YmM1OTM2ZTE4MGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commit/a04f20c129aac9dabb5e01cc27e442fc8081b116","sha":"a04f20c129aac9dabb5e01cc27e442fc8081b116","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commits/a04f