6-07-21T18:19:12Z","email":"carlos.fuentes@faast.app","name":"Carlos Fuentes Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T18:19:12Z","email":"carlos.fuentes@faast.app","name":"Carlos Fuentes Rojas"},"message":"feat(dev-team): v2.6.9 — auto-migración de proyectos viejos al abrir sesión\n\nEl hook SessionStart, además de inyectar el protocolo, deja el proyecto al día\nautomáticamente (idempotente, fail-silent):\n- Crea estructura faltante: wiki/ (con esquema del plugin + index + .ingested.log),\n  metrics/, evidence/, pases/, handoffs/archive/, test-plans/\n- Detecta claves faltantes del config (git.defaultBranch, git.identity,\n  tracker.reviewer) → la sesión las completa CON el usuario cuando un flujo las\n  necesite y las persiste\n- Wiki vacía → la sesión ofrece UNA VEZ /dev-team:wiki ingest (nunca lo corre solo)\nProbado: proyecto viejo migrado en 1ª corrida, idempotente en la 2ª, silencioso\nsin .coordination ✔\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c315e476764f735ca8895a6899734fdeb7a268f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/trees/0c315e476764f735ca8895a6899734fdeb7a268f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/commits/016e45bcc5e1e8433e82c1e7b71070528537fca4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235109472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos-fuentes-rojas","id":235109472,"login":"carlos-fuentes-rojas","node_id":"U_kgDODgN8YA","organizations_url"