io a\nfin (que escribes exactamente → que hace el equipo → que recibes): proyecto\nnuevo desde idea y desde documento, onboard, feature completa, mockups con\nui-designer, bug de un repo, DEBUG TRANSVERSAL de varios repos, pruebas, BD\n(health/comparación/scripts), pase a ambiente, seguridad, wiki, oficina y\nmétricas, sprint Scrum completo y configuración de modelos. Más: conceptos base,\nlas 15 reglas del equipo, referencia de comandos, configuración documentada,\nhigiene de consumo, solución de problemas y FAQ.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a68afa8d1d5749d7f428c75cc0becc5eac242999","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/trees/a68afa8d1d5749d7f428c75cc0becc5eac242999"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/commits/b0821d155c046e47447c611bf2be46fbba613ef4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235109472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos-fuentes-rojas","id":235109472,"login":"carlos-fuentes-rojas","node_id":"U_kgDODgN8YA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/subscriptions","type":"Us