me de conformidad\n\n- qa: precondicion inalterable de validacion — (a) ambiente desplegado: exige el\n  informe de conformidad del despliegue (componentes+version exacta, ambiente,\n  features/fixes incluidos, health verificado) con formato minimo definido;\n  (b) desa: stack COMPLETO levantado y healthy (dev server no cuenta). Ambiente\n  preferente: qa siempre que este disponible. Sin informe/stack: blocked + aviso\n  al Lead. Flujo FIJO E INALTERABLE: nadie puede saltarlo ni relajarlo; solo\n  cambia con actualizacion del plugin aprobada por el owner\n- qa-frontend/qa-backend: paso 0 de \"Antes de cada tarea\" verifica la regla\n- backend/frontend: el handoff a QA debe incluir el informe de conformidad\n- infra: informe de conformidad obligatorio tras CADA deploy (deploy sin informe\n  = deploy incompleto)\n- lead: nunca pide validacion a QA sin el informe; devuelve la entrega si falta\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7a985e087c4640bcba4e822e09b067bedb7667d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/trees/d7a985e087c4640bcba4e822e09b067bedb7667d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/commits/8d4f9d238a2ee9c060ee558d9757b38ac1e02ec5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235109472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos-fuentes-rojas","id":235109472,"login":"carlos-fuentes-rojas","node_id":"U_kgDODgN8YA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-f