ir migraciones no\n  idempotentes ya mergeadas (un corrector con numero mas alto es inalcanzable si el\n  runner para en el primer fallo); auditar TODOS los CHECK constraints acumulativos\n  contra datos reales en una sola pasada antes del primer bootstrap de un ledger de\n  migraciones contra una BD ya instalada.\n- lead: refuerzo explicito de no saltear el paso \"PO formaliza\" del triage de bugs\n  ni siquiera cuando la causa tecnica ya se conoce.\n- qa / qa-frontend / product-owner: convencion exacta y battle-tested de la rama\n  `evidence` unica y permanente en GitHub (issues/ + smokes/, numeracion secuencial,\n  INDEX.md, embeds obligatorios raw+blob) — reemplaza la guia generica anterior de\n  \"commitear en el repo de e2e o en evidence/\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f1b305e1cc06ac1a6ace41fe4e46d8a8fec66d73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/trees/f1b305e1cc06ac1a6ace41fe4e46d8a8fec66d73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/commits/ec8aee977148d54f482098331e08d8788d018fa3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235109472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos-fuentes-rojas","id":235109472,"login":"carlos-fuentes-rojas","node_id":"U_kgDODgN8YA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-