ción/handoff YA trae el contexto → EMPEZAR de inmediato, sin relecturas\n2. Si falta contexto → UNA lectura: la página wiki del tema\n3. config.json solo si se necesita topología/tracker; archive/ solo si la wiki no alcanza\nEl checklist \"Antes de cada tarea\" aplica únicamente a lo no resuelto en el prompt.\n\nMenos latencia percibida y menos tokens por invocación.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d7924d7ac65be97da0082fc6987388d1f64d81b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/trees/1d7924d7ac65be97da0082fc6987388d1f64d81b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/commits/a71731a422e2446e06446ed943f11237a8cdfa41","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235109472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos-fuentes-rojas","id":235109472,"login":"carlos-fuentes-rojas","node_id":"U_kgDODgN8YA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/faast-app/faast-claude-marketp