 otro lead\n- qa ya NO delega (disallowedTools: Agent): reparte a qa-frontend/qa-backend via\n  handoffs y el lead/sesión principal los invoca en paralelo\n- Resto de subagentes: solo Explore. Hook actualizado y re-probado (9 casos) ✔\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a6586909bf99fa3bc55d4396b686910b579bc39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/trees/4a6586909bf99fa3bc55d4396b686910b579bc39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/commits/d514a4fe59d4f7ef299bc32bb73cae6dc099dfea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235109472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos-fuentes-rojas","id":235109472,"login":"carlos-fuentes-rojas","node_id":"U_kgDODgN8YA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commit/d514a4fe59d4f7ef299bc32bb73cae6dc099dfea","node_id":"C_kwDORv6JqtoAKGQ1MTRhNGZlNTlkNGY3ZWYyOTliYzMyYmI3M2NhZTZkYzA5OWRmZWE"