ojas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos-fuentes-rojas","id":235109472,"login":"carlos-fuentes-rojas","node_id":"U_kgDODgN8YA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commits/1c43a69163fa520d33d69af1d6c5ce66d43ffdff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:50:32Z","email":"carlos.fuentes@faast.app","name":"Carlos Fuentes Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:50:32Z","email":"carlos.fuentes@faast.app","name":"Carlos Fuentes Rojas"},"message":"feat(dev-team): v2.4.0 — bloqueo de delegación anidada de subagentes (ahorro de tokens)\n\nProblema: los agentes tenían tools:\"*\" (incluye Agent/Task) y sus prompts hablan\nde equipo → backend lanzaba backends anidados (visto: 48k+78k tokens para un\ntriage), duplicando contexto sin dividir trabajo.\n\nDos capas:\n- disallowedTools: Agent en los 13 agentes trabajadores (setup, po, architect,\n  ui-designer, backend, frontend, dba, qa-frontend, qa-backend, release-manager,\n  infra, cybersec, tech-writer) + regla explícita de no-delegación en el prompt\n- Hook PreToolUse (block-nested-delegation.py): deniega Agent/Task llamado desde\n  dentro de un subagente dev-team, con mensaje que el agente ve. Excepciones:\n  qa → qa-frontend/qa-backend (1 instancia c/u), lead → equipo (nunca otro lead),\n  cualquiera → Explore (búsqueda barata solo-lectura). Main session sin cambios.\n  Nunca falla hacia afuera. Probado con 11 casos ✔\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c07e27555a75b1966c4a74232468682df29ab37a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/trees/c07e27555a75b1966c4a74232468682df29ab37a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/commits/1c43a69163fa520d33d69af1d6c5ce66d43ffdff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235109472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos-fuentes-rojas","id":235109472,"login":"carlos-fuentes-rojas","node_id":"U_kgDODgN8YA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commit/1c43a69163fa520d33d69af1d6c5ce66d43ffdff","node_id":"C_kwDORv6JqtoAKDFjNDNhNjkxNjNmYTUyMGQzM2Q2OWFmMWQ2YzVjZTY2ZDQzZmZkZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/commit/bf5eac25c67f82e93d076fd28bc5af888e24249d","sha":"bf5eac25c67f82e93d076fd28bc5af888e24249d","url":"https://api.github.com/repo