nt/blocked...)\n- /team-office: oficina virtual 2D estilo Gather Town — servidor Node sin\n  dependencias (SSE + watch de filesystem, solo lectura) + canvas con salas,\n  avatares por agente, estado en vivo, tarea actual y sobres animados por handoff.\n  Smoke test ejecutado (estados, parsing de handoffs, SSE) ✔\n- /team-metrics ahora usa activity.jsonl como fuente primaria (lead time real)\n- new-project/onboard crean wiki+metrics; flujo diario del Lead cierra con\n  wiki ingest\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d3c48a317b72ed82752976f7db3fa776f7bbc8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/trees/7d3c48a317b72ed82752976f7db3fa776f7bbc8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/commits/ff3caf8c62f6ef0001512af9d19642948438a830","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235109472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos-fuentes-rojas","id":235109472,"login":"carlos-fuentes-rojas","node_id":"U_kgDODgN8YA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/u