mail":"carlos.fuentes@faast.app","name":"carlos-fuentes-rojas"},"message":"feat: add interactive DB connection setup to onboard + DBA agent\n\nOnboard Paso 2b: asks user for DB credentials (host, port, user, password)\nper service. Saves to .coordination/db-connections.json (config) and\n.coordination/.db-secrets (passwords, gitignored). Verifies connection\nif client tools available. Supports MySQL, SQL Server, PostgreSQL, MongoDB.\n\nDBA agent: updated to read credentials from db-connections.json and\n.db-secrets before each task. Asks user if credentials missing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e3558f60295902b895dcf60da91e38a4c7910c14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/trees/e3558f60295902b895dcf60da91e38a4c7910c14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faast-app/faast-claude-marketplace/git/commits/0a8851915b168ebdf9882fd9cca1bbc86c709fa9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235109472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlos-fuentes-rojas","id":235109472,"login":"carlos-fuentes-rojas","node_id":"U_kgDODgN8YA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlos-fuentes-rojas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com